INSERT INTO `Equipment` VALUES ('AEL','BOK','','','BH-BD',201,'0','Blade Dancer','Once per battle, during this operative\'s activation, you can use the Bladewind Tactical Ploy without spending any CP.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('AEL','BOK','','','BH-FG',204,'0','Feather\'s Glide','Add [TRI] to this operative\'s Movement characteristic.','OpMod','M','+[TRI]','','','Battle Honour'),('AEL','BOK','','','BH-FW',203,'0','Fate\'s Whisper','Once per battle, at the start of the Roll Defence Dice step of a shooting attack made against this operative, you can use this ability. If you do so, before rolling your Defence Dice, you can retain one as a successful critical save without rolling it.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('AEL','BOK','','','BH-GS',202,'0','Gun Singer','Once per battle, during this operative\'s activation, you can use the Starfall Tactical Ploy without spending any CP.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('AEL','BOK','','','BH-SG',205,'0','Supreme Grace','<ul>\n<li>You can ignore any or all modifiers to this operative\'s Movement characteristic</li>\n<li>Each time this operative is activated, ignore the first distance of [CIRCLE] it travels for a climb, drop, or traverse during that activation<li>\n</ul>','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('AEL','BOK','','','BH-ST',206,'0','Superlative Technique','Each time this operative fights in combat, in the Resolve Successful Hits step of that combat, if you did not retain any critical hits, you can strike or parry with one normal hit as if it were a critical hit.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('AEL','BOK','','','PG',0,'3','Plasma Grenade','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br/>\n<table class=\"eqtable\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name</th><th>A</th><th>BS</th><th>D</th><th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plasma Grenade</td><td>4</td><td>3+</td><td>3/4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rng [PENT], Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect, Limited</td>\n</tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','BOK','','','RE-DGOMH',402,'3','Death Gaze of Morai-Heg','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Death Gaze of Morai-Heg:</strong>\nWhile an enemy operative is within this operative\'s Engagement Range, subtract 1 from the Attacks characteristic of that enemy operative\'s weapons.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('AEL','BOK','','','RE-HWOE',406,'1','Healing Waters Of Eshariel','After the battle, in the Update Dataslates step, this operative passes Casualty and Recovery tests.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('AEL','BOK','','','RE-KA',401,'3','Khaine\'s Arrow','Select a Shuriken Catapult the operative is equipped with (note that you cannot select a Twin Shuriken Catapult). That weapon gains the Lethal 5+ special rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepid:SC','SR:Silent','','','Rare Equipment'),('AEL','BOK','','','RE-SOTDS',403,'1','Sting Of The Deathstalker','STRIKING SCORPION operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\r <strong>Sting Of The Deathstalker:</strong>\r The target suffers 3 Mortal Wounds as a result of this operative\'s Mandiblasters ability.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('AEL','BOK','','','RE-SPOE',404,'3','Shimmerplate Of Efinir','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Shimmerplate Of Efinir:</strong>\nEach time this operative fights in combat or a shooting attack is made against it, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat or shooting attack, you opponent cannot retain Attack Dice results of less than 6 as critical hits (e.g. as a result of the Lethal X or Rending rules).','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('AEL','BOK','','','RE-YSS',405,'2','Ynnari Spirit Stone','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Ynnari Spirit Stone:</strong>\nOnce per battle, at the start or end of this operative\'s activation, you can use this ability. If you do so, this operative regains 2D3 lost Wounds.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('AEL','BOK','','','ROF',0,'1','Rune Of Foresight*','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Rune of Foresight:</strong>\nWhen you reveal this equipment, select one of your opponent\'s Strategic or Tactical Ploys\n(excluding Command Re-roll). The first time your opponent uses that ploy, you gain 1 CP.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','BOK','','','ROP',0,'1','Rune Of Prophecy*','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Rune Of Prophecy:</strong>\nOnce per battle, after rolling off to determine initiative, you can add or subtract 1 from your result.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','BOK','','','ROS',0,'3','Rune Of Shielding*','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Rune of Shielding:</strong>\nOnce per battle, when this operative fights in combat or a shooting attack is made against it,\nin the Resolve Successful Hits step of that combat or shooting attack,\nyou can ignore the damage inflicted on it from one attack die.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','BOK','','','SWG',0,'3','Shadow-Wave Grenade','The operative can perform the following action during the battle:<br/>\r <strong>Shadow-Wave Grenade (1 AP):</strong><br/>\r Place the centre of one of your Shadow-Wave tokens within [PENT] of this operative.\r That token creates an area of smoke with a [CIRCLE] radius and unlimited upward height (but not below).\r Until the end of the Turning Point, an operative is Obscured if every Cover line drawn to it crosses an area of smoke,\r This operative can only perform this action once, and cannot perform this action while within Engagement Range of an enemy operative.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','BOK','','','WBT',0,'3','Wraithbone Talisman','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Wraithbone Talisman:</strong>\nOnce per battle, when this operative fights in combat, makes a shooting attack, or a shooting attack is made against it, you can use the Command Re-roll Tactical Ploy without spending any Command Points.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','BOK','','','WP',0,'1','Weaponised Panoply','DIRE AVENGER operative only.\nSelect Fists or Gun Butts the operative is equipped with.\nAdd 1 to that weapon\'s Attacks characteristic for the battle.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','BOK24','','','ROF',3,'0','Rune Of Foresight','When this equipment is revealed, roll one D3. In the Strategy phase of the turning point equal to the result, you gain 1 additional CP.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','BOK24','','','ROP',1,'0','Rune Of Prophecy','Once per battle, after rolling off to decide initiative, you can add D3 to, or subtract D3 from, your result.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','BOK24','','','ROS',2,'0','Rune Of Shielding','Once per battle, when an attack dice inflicts Normal Dmg on a friendly BLADES OF KHAINE operative, you can ignore that inflicted damage.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','BOK24','','','WBT',4,'0','Wraithbone Talisman','Once per turning point, when a friendly BLADES OF KHAINE operative is shooting, fighting or retaliating, if you roll two or more fails, you can discard one of them to retain another as a normal success instead.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','COM','WYCH','','AD',0,'2','Adrenalite*','WYCH operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Adrenalite:</strong> Each time this operative fights in combat, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat, if it performed a Charge action during that activation, you can re-roll one of your attack dice.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','COM','KBL','','AG',0,'3','Agonite*','KABALITE operative only. Select one Splinter Cannon, Splinter Pistol, or Splinter Rifle the operative is equipped with.\nThat weapon gains the Relentless special rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepname:splinter','SR:Relentless','','','Equipment'),('AEL','COM','KBL','','DB',0,'3','DeathBloom*','KABALITE operative only. Select one Splinter Cannon, Splinter Pistol, or Splinter Rifle the operative is equipped with. \nThat weapon gains the Rending critical hit rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepname:splinter','SR:Rending','','','Equipment'),('AEL','COM','KBL','','FER',0,'3','Feralex*','KABALITE operative only. Select one Splinter Cannon, Splinter Pistol, or Splinter Rifle the operative is equipped with. \nThat weapon gains the Splash 1 critical hit rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepname:splinter','SR:Splash 1','','','Equipment'),('AEL','COM','WYCH','','GL',0,'2','Grave Lotus*','WYCH operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Grave Lotus:</strong> Each time this operative fights in combat, in the Resolve Successful Hits step of that combat, the first time you strike, inflict one additional damage.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','COM','WYCH','','HG',0,'2','Haywire Grenade','WYCH operative only. The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n 	<tr>\n 		<th>Name</th>\n         <th>A</th>\n         <th>BS</th>\n         <th>D</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td>Haywire Grenade</td>\n         <td>4</td>\n         <td>3+</td>\n         <td>2/3</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Blast [CIRCLE], Lim, Haywire*</td>\n     </tr>\n </table>\n <strong>Haywire:</strong> Each time a friendly operative makes a shooting attack with this weapon, if the target has a Save characteristic of 3+ or better, this weapon has the Lethal 4+ special rule for that shooting attack.','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','COM','WYCH','','HYP',0,'2','Hypex*','WYCH operative only. Add [TRI] to this operative\'s Movement characteristic for the battle.','OpMod','M','+[TRI]','','','Equipment'),('AEL','COM','KBL','SYB','KB',0,'3','Kabalite Banner','SYBARITE operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Kabalite Banner:</strong> While a friendly KABALITE operative is Visible to and within [SQUARE] of this operative, when determining control of an objective marker, treat that friendly operative\'s APL characteristic as being 1 higher. Note that this is not a modifier.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','COM','WYCH','','PB',0,'2','PainBringer*','WYCH operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>PainBringer:</strong> Each time an attack would inflict damage on this operative, if the damage to be inflicted is 3 or less, subtract 1 from the amount of damage that would be inflicted from that attack die.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','COM','','','PG',0,'2','Plasma Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n	<tr>\n		<th>Name</th>\n        <th>A</th>\n        <th>BS</th>\n        <th>D</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n		<td>Plasma Grenade</td>\n        <td>4</td>\n        <td>3+</td>\n        <td>3/4</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Blast [CIRCLE], Lim, Indirect</td>\n    </tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','COM','','','PGL',0,'3','Phantasm Grenade Launcher','LEADER operative only. The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n 	<tr>\n 		<th>Name</th>\n         <th>A</th>\n         <th>BS</th>\n         <th>D</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td>Phantasm Grenade Launcher</td>\n         <td>4</td>\n         <td>3+</td>\n         <td>1/2</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Blast [TRI], Lethal 5+, Stun</td>\n     </tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','COR','','','BH-CT',206,'0','Cut-Throat','Each time this operative fights in combat, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat, if you are the Attacker and either friendly operatives are supporting this operative or the target is not Ready,\nthe melee weapon this operative is equipped with gains the Rending critical hit rule.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('AEL','COR','','','BH-EM',205,'0','Expert Marksman','You do not need to subtract any Action Points for this operative to perform the Take Aim action.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('AEL','COR','','','BH-IF',201,'0','Important Fate','Each time this operative fights in combat or a shooting attack is made against it, in the Resolve Successful Hits step of that combat or shooting attack, the first Attack die that inflict Critical Damage on this operative inflicts Normal Damage instead.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('AEL','COR','','','BH-MOC',204,'0','Master Of Concealment','If this operative has a Conceal order and is in Cover provided by Light terrain, enemy operatives cannot treat it as being on an Engage order as a result of a Vantage Point.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('AEL','COR','','','BH-PL',202,'0','Pirate Lord','Once per battle, you can use the Light Fingers, Deadly Ambush, or Opportunistic Fighters Tactical Ploy without spending any CPs if this operative is the CORSAIR VOIDSCARRED operative specified by that Tactical Ploy.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('AEL','COR','','','BH-SH',203,'0','Swift Hunter','Each time this operative performs a Charge action or moves as a result of the Deadly Ambush Tactical Ploy, it can move an additional [TRI] for that action or ploy.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('AEL','COR','','','CB',0,'1','Corsair Blade','The operative is equipped with the following melee weapon for the battle:<br/>\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>A</th>\n<th>BS</th>\n<th>D</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Corsair Blade</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3+</td>\n<td>3/4</td>\n</tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','COR','','','DM',0,'2','Diuturnal Mantle','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Diuturnal Mantle:</strong>\nEach time a shooting attack is made against this operative, if the ranged weapon has the Torrent or Blast special rule, this operative is treated as having a Save characteristic of 3+ for that shooting attack.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','COR','COR','WS','LH',0,'2','Lodestar Helm*','VOIDSCARRED WAY SEEKER operative only.<br/>\nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Lodestar Helm:</strong>\nThe second time this operative performs the Manifest Psychic Power action in each of its activations,\nit does not suffer any Mortal Wounds as a result of rolling a 1-2 (note this does not allow you to select a psychic power to be resolved).','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','COR','COR','FA','MF',0,'3','Mistfield*','VOIDSCARRED FELARCH operative only.<br/>\nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Mistfield:</strong>\nWhile a friendly CORSAIR VOIDSCARRED operative is within [CIRCLE] of this operative, that operative has a 5+ Invulnerable Save.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','COR','','','OS',0,'2','Ocular Scanner*','The operative can perform the following action during the battle:<br/>\r <strong>Ocular Scanner (1 AP):</strong><br/>\r Until the end of this operative\'s activation, the ranged weapons it is equipped with gain the No Cover special rule.','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','COR','COR','FD','PC',0,'2','Pathfinder Cloak*','VOIDSCARRED FATE DEALER operative only.<br/>\nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Pathfinder Cloak:</strong>\nWhile this operative has a Conceal order, it is always treated as having a Conceal order, regardless of any other rules (e.g. Vantage Point).','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','COR','','','PG',0,'3','Plasma Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br/>\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>A</th>\n<th>BS</th>\n<th>D</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plasma Grenade</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>3+</td>\n<td>3/4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Blast [CIRCLE], Lim, Indirect</td>\n</tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','COR','','','RE-FB',0,'2','Flip Belt','The operative gains the FLY keyword for the battle.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('AEL','COR','','','RE-PRA',404,'3','Psychoreactive Armour','Change the operative\'s Save characteristic to 3+ for the battle.','OpMod','SV','3+','','','Rare Equipment'),('AEL','COR','','','RE-RPW',405,'2','Relic Power Weapon','Operative equipped with a Power Weapon only. The Power Weapon this operative is equipped with gains the Balanced special rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepname:Power Weapon','SR:Balanced','','','Rare Equipment'),('AEL','COR','','','RE-RWS',406,'2','Relic Witch Staff','VOIDSCARRED WAY SEEKER operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Relic Witch Staff</strong>\nThe second time this operative performs the Manifest Psychic Power action in each of its activations, you can re-roll the 1D6 when determining the result of that action.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('AEL','COR','','','RE-SDH',401,'3','Long-Sight Helm','Ranged weapons this operative is equipped with gain the Ceaseless special rule for the battle.','WepMod','weptype:R','SR:Ceaseless','','','Rare Equipment'),('AEL','COR','','','RE-SPST',403,'4','Spirit Stone','VOIDSCARRED SOUL WEAVER operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Spirit Stone:</strong>\nThis operative can perform the Soul Channel action twice during its activation.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('AEL','COR','','','ROP',0,'2','Runes Of Protection','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Runes Of Protection:</strong>\nEach time a shooting attack is made against this operative, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack,\nif that shooting attack was made as a result of the Manifest Psychic Power action, you can re-roll any or all of your defence dice.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','COR24','','','DM',1,'0','Diuturnal Mantles','Whenever an operative is shooting a friendly CORSAIR VOIDSCARRED operative, if the ranged weapon in that sequence has the Blast or Torrent weapon rule, you can re-roll one of your defence dice.\nIn addition, friendly CORSAIR VOIDSCARRED operatives are not affected by the X\" Devastating X weapon rule (i.e, Devastating with a distance) unless they are the target during that sequence.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','COR24','','','MF',2,'0','Mistfield','Once per Turning point, when an operative is shooting a friendly CORSAIR VOIDSCARRED operative more than 3\" from it, at the start of the Roll Defence Dice step, you can use this rule.\nIf you do, worsen the X of the piercing weapon rule by 1 (If any) until the end of that sequence. Note that Piercing 1 would therefore be ignored.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','COR24','','','ROG',3,'0','Runes Of Guidance','Once per turning point, whenever a friendly CORSAIR VOIDSCARRED WAY SEEKER or CORSAIR VOIDSCARRED SOUL WEAVER operative is performing a PSYCHIC unique action (excluding Warp Fold),\nyou can use this rule. If you do, until the end of that action, add 3\" to its distance requirement. Note this has no effect on PSYCHIC weapons (e.g, the Devastating distance requirement of Lightning Strike).','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','COR24','','','SC',4,'0','Star Charts','<strong>STRATEGIC GAMBIT</strong><br/>\nRoll 1D3, if the result is higher than the number of current turning point, you gain 1CP and cannot use this STRATEGIC GAMBIT for the rest of the battle.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','CW','DA','EXA','ASB',0,'2','Avenger Shrine Banner*','DIRE AVENGER EXARCH operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Avenger Shrine Banner:</strong>\nWHile a friendly DIRE AVENGER operative is Visible to and within [SQUARE] of this operative, when determining control of an object marker, treat that friendly operative\'s APL characteristic as being 1 higher. Note that this is not a modifier.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','CW','','','CS',0,'2','Celestial Shield*','GUARDIAN DEFENDER or STORM GUARDIAN operative only.\nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Celestial Shield:</strong>\nOnce per battle, in the Roll Defence Dice step of a shooting attack made against this operative, you can use this ability. If you do so, for that shooting attack, this operative has a 4+ Invulnerable Save.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','CW','RNGR','','PC',0,'2','Pathfinder Cloak','RANGER operative only. The operative gains the following ability:\n<br/>\n<strong>Pathfinder Cloak:</strong>\nWhile this operative has a Conceal order, it is always treated as having a Conceal order, regardless of any other rules (e.g. Vantage Point).','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','CW','','','PG',0,'2','Plasma Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n	<tr>\n		<th>Name</th>\n        <th>A</th>\n        <th>BS</th>\n        <th>D</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n		<td>Plasma Grenade</td>\n        <td>4</td>\n        <td>3+</td>\n        <td>3/4</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Blast [CIRCLE], Lim, Indirect</td>\n    </tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','CW','','','RS',0,'3','Ranger Scope','Select one Ranger Long Rifle the operative is equipped with. That weapon gains the Lethal 5+ special rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepname:long rifle','SR:Lethal 5+','','','Equipment'),('AEL','CW','','','WB',0,'3','Wraithbone Talisman','The operative gains the following ability:\n<br/>\n<strong>Wraithbone Talisman:</strong>\nOnce per battle, when this operative is fighting in combat, making a shooting attack or a shooting attack is being made against it, you can use the Command Re-Roll Tactical Ploy without spending any CP.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','CW','DA','','WP',0,'1','Weaponised Panoply','DIRE AVENGER operative only. The operative is equipped with the following melee weapon for the battle:\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n	<tr>\n		<th>Name</th>\n        <th>A</th>\n        <th>WS</th>\n        <th>D</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n		<td>Weaponised Panoply</td>\n        <td>3</td>\n        <td>3+</td>\n        <td>3/4</td>\n    </tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','HOTA','','','BH-CON',205,'0','Conniving','Each time this operative is activated, you can use the Cruel Deception Tactical Ploy for it without spending any CP.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('AEL','HOTA','','','BH-EOS',201,'0','Epicurean Of Suffering','The first time you would spend a Pain Token to re-roll one of your Attack or Defence dice for this operative in each battle, the effect takes place but that Pain Token is not spent.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('AEL','HOTA','','','BH-PA',202,'0','Pain Artist','If this operative incapacitates an enemy operative while fighting in combat, it gains 1 additional Pain Token.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('AEL','HOTA','','','BH-PP',206,'0','Patient Predator','Each time this operative fights in combat or makes a shooting attack against an enemy operative that is not Ready, your opponent cannot re-roll their Attack or Defence dice.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('AEL','HOTA','','','BH-SH',203,'0','Shadow Hunter','Each time a shooting attack is made against this operative, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, before rolling your Defence Dice, if it is in Cover and more than [PENT] from the active operative, you can retain on additional die as a successful normal save as a result of Cover.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('AEL','HOTA','','','BH-SS',204,'0','Spire Stalker','Each time this operative climbs, drops, or traverses, you can ignore the first distance of [CIRCLE] if travels for that climb, drop, or traverse.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('AEL','HOTA','','','CS',0,'1','Chain Snare','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\r <strong>Chain Snare:</strong>\r While only one enemy operative is within Engagement Range of this operative, that enemy operative is snared.\r Each time a snared enemy operative would perform a Fall Back action, roll 1D6, subtracting 1 if that enemy operative has a higher Wounds characteristic than this operative, and adding 1 if that enemy operative is injured.\r On a 4+, that enemy operative cannot perform that action, but no Action Points are subtracted.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','HOTA','','','KB',6,'2','Kabalite Banner*','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Kabalite Banner:</strong>\nWhile a friendly HAND OF THE ARCHON operative is Visible To and within [SQUARE] of this operative,\nwhen determining control of an objective marker, treat that friendly operative\'s APL characteristic as being 1 higher.\nNote that this is not a modifier.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','HOTA','','','PG',4,'3','Plasma Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name</th><th>A</th><th>BS</th><th>D</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plasma Grenade</td><td>4</td><td>3+</td><td>3/4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr><th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect, Limited</td></tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','HOTA','','','PGL',5,'3','Phantasm Grenade Launcher*','The operative can perform the following action during the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Phantasm Grenade (1 AP):</strong>\nSelect one point on the killzone within [PENT] of this operative.\nRoll 1D6 for each operative within [SQUARE] of that point, subtracting 1 from the result if that operative is not Visible To this operative.\nOn a 4+, subtract 1 from that operative\'s APL. This operative can only perform this action once, and cannot perform this action while within Engagement Range of an enemy operative.','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','HOTA','','','RE-CLF',403,'3','Clone Field','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Clone Field:</strong>\nOnce during the battle, when this operative is selected as the target of a combat or shooting attack, you can use this ability. If you do so, this operative can immediately perform a free Dash action as though it can FLY (and can do so even if it is in Engagement Range of an enemy operative).\nIf it is no longer a valid target, that combat or shooting attack immediately ends (the action points subtracted are not refunded).','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('AEL','HOTA','','','RE-GPA',401,'2','Ghostplate Armour','This operative has a Save characteristic of 3+ for the battle.','OpMod','SV','3+','','','Rare Equipment'),('AEL','HOTA','','','RE-LT',405,'3','Living Trophy','The operative gains 1 Pain Token for the battle.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('AEL','HOTA','','','RE-PC',404,'2','Pain Casket','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Pain Casket:</strong>\nEach time a friendly HAND OF THE ARCHON operative within [PENT] of this operative would gain a Pain Token, you can select another friendly HAND OF THE ARCHON operative within [PENT] of this operative to gain it instead.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('AEL','HOTA','','','RE-SSB',406,'2','Soul-Scent Barb','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Soul-Scent Barb:</strong>\nWhen you select this item of equipment, also select one enemy operative.\nUntil the end of the battle, each time this operative fights in combat with or makes a shooting against that enemy operative, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat or shooting attack,\nyou can re-roll any or all of your Attack dice.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('AEL','HOTA','','','RE-TST',402,'2','Tormented Soulstone','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Tormented Soulstone:</strong>\nOnce during the battle, when the operative is activated, you can use this ability. If you do so, this operative regains 1D3 + 3 lost Wounds.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('AEL','HOTA','','','RP',3,'3','Refined Poison (Shardcarbine/Splinter Cannon)','Select one Shardcarbine or Splinter Cannon the operative is equipped with.\r Add 1 to the Normal Damage characteristic of that weapon for the battle.\r','WepMod','wepid:SC','D:1/0','','','Equipment'),('AEL','HOTA','','','RP2',3,'2','Refined Poison (Splinter Pistol/Rifle)','Select one Splinter Pistol or Splinter Rifle the operative is equipped with. Add 1 to the Normal Damage characteristic of that weapon for the battle.','WepMod','wepid:SP,SR','D:1/0','','','Equipment'),('AEL','HOTA','','','TC',2,'1','Toxic Coating (Array Of Blades)','Select one Array Of Blades the operative is equipped with. That weapon gains the Lethal 5+ special rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepid:AOB','SR:Lethal 5+','','','Equipment'),('AEL','HOTA','','','TC2',2,'2','Toxic Coating','Select one melee weapon (excluding Array Of Blades) the operative is equipped with. That weapon gains the Lethal 5+ special rule for the battle.','WepMod','weptype:M','SR:Lethal 5+','','','Equipment'),('AEL','HOTA','','','WB',1,'1','Wicked Blade','Operative is equipped with Array of Blades only. Add 1 to that weapon\'s Attacks characteristic for the battle.','WepMod','wepname:array','A:1','','','Equipment'),('AEL','HOTA24','','','CS',1,'0','Chain Snare','Whenever an enemy operative would perform the Fall Back action while within control range of a friendly HAND OF THE ARCHON operative, if no other enemy operatives are within that friendly operative’s control range,\nyou can use this rule.\nIf you do, roll two D6, or one D6 if that enemy operative has a higher Wounds stat than that friendly operative.\nIf any result is a 4+, that enemy operative cannot perform that action during that activation or counteraction (no AP are spent on it).','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','HOTA24','','','RP',4,'0','Refined Poison','Up to twice per turning point, whenever a friendly HAND OF THE ARCHON operative is performing the Shoot action and you select a shardcarbine, splinter cannon, splinter pistol, splinter rifle or stinger pistol,\nyou can use this rule. If you do, until the end of that action, add 1 to the Normal Dmg stat of that weapon.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','HOTA24','','','TC',3,'0','Toxic Coating','Up to twice per turning point, whenever a friendly HAND OF THE ARCHON operative is fighting or retaliating and you’re selecting a melee weapon, you can use this rule.\nIf you do, until the end of that sequence, that operative’s melee weapon has the Lethal 5+ weapon rule.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','HOTA24','','','WB',2,'0','Wicked Blades','Add 1 to the Atk stat of friendly HAND OF THE ARCHON operatives’ array of blades.','WepMod','wepid:AOB','A:+1','','','Equipment'),('AEL','MND','','','BD',106,'1','Bone Darts','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br/>\r <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\r <tr>\r 	<th>Name</th>\r 	   <th>A</th>\r 	   <th>BS</th>\r 	   <th>D</th>\r    </tr>\r    <tr>\r 	<td>Bone Darts</td>\r 	   <td>4</td>\r 	   <td>3+</td>\r 	   <td>2/3</td>\r    </tr>\r    <tr>\r 	<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\r    </tr>\r    <tr>\r 	<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Lim, Silent</td>\r    </tr>\r </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','MND','','','BH-BC',206,'0','Balerune Conjunction','In the Select Equipment step, you can equip this operative with a Soul Gem for 0EP. If you choose to pay the cost for the Soul Gem, this operative\'s Baleblast gains the Blast [CIRCLE] special rule for the battle instead.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('AEL','MND','','','BH-DMF',203,'0','Darkness Made Flesh','While this operative is withing Shadow and more than [PENT] from the active operative, improve its Invulnerable Save by 1.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('AEL','MND','','','BH-FA',204,'0','Flitting Apparition','This operative can perform the Fall Back action for one less action point (to a minimum of 0).','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('AEL','MND','','','BH-FAS',201,'0','From Any Shadow','While this operative is within [TRI] of a Light part of a terrain feature that is not lower than it, it is withing Shadow.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('AEL','MND','','','BH-HH',205,'0','Hungering Horror','This operative can perform the Charge action while within Engagement Range of an enemy operative.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('AEL','MND','','','BH-TP',202,'0','Twilight Paths','Each time this operative moves, as long as it finishes that move within Shadow, you can ignore any or all modifiers to its Movement characteristic and it can FLY.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('AEL','MND','','','CS',100,'1','Chain Snare','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Chain Snare:</strong>\nWhile only one enemy operative is within Engagement Range of this operative, that enemy operative is Snared.\nEach time a snared enemy operative would perform the Fall Back action, roll 1D6, subtracting 1 if that enemy operative has a higher Wounds characteristic than this operative, and adding 1 if that enemy operative is Injured.\nOn a 4+, that enemy operative cannot perform that action, but no AP are subtracted.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','MND','','','HP',102,'2','Haunting Projection*','The operative can perform the following action during the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Haunting Projection (1 AP):</strong>\nSelect one objective marker within [PENT] of this operative. Until the end of the battle, when determining control of that objective marker, if this operative is in the kill zone, treat enemy operatives\' total APL as being 1 less. This operative can only perform this action once.','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','MND','','','RE-MB',406,'2','Murderer\'s Blade','Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of the operative\'s Melee Weapons for the battle (to a maximum of 5).','WepMod','weptype:M','A:+1','','','Rare Equipment'),('AEL','MND','','','RE-MOM',402,'2','Mirror Of Miseries','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/><strong>Mirror Of Miseries:</strong> Each time this operative incapacitates an enemy operative, you can select one other enemy operative within [SQUARE] of the incapacitated operative to suffer a number of Mortal Wounds equal to the incapacitated operative\'s APL.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('AEL','MND','','','RE-MV',404,'2','Malevolent Visage','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/><strong>Malevolent Visage:</strong> Once during each of this operative\'s activations, you can select one enemy operative Visible to it. Until the start of this operative\'s next activation or until this operative is incapacitated (whichever comes first), if no other enemy operatives are within Engagement Range of this operative, your opponent cannot re-roll Attack or Defence dice for the enemy operative you selected.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('AEL','MND','','','RE-ND',403,'2','Nightmare Doll','The operative can perform the following action during the battle:<br/><strong>Nightmare Doll (1 AP):</strong> Select one enemy operative Visible To this operative. Until the end of the battle, each time this operative\'s activation ends, that enemy operative suffers 1 Mortal Wound, or 1D3 Mortal Wounds if it is within [PENT] of this operative. This operative can only perform this action once, and cannot perform it while within Engagement Range of any other enemy operatives.','Action','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('AEL','MND','','','RE-SG',405,'1','Shroud-Glyph','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/><strong>Shroud-Glyph:</strong> Defence Dice automatically retained for this operative as a result of Cover and the Gloaming Shroud Strategic Ploy are critical saves.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('AEL','MND','','','RE-SS',401,'2','Spirit Syphon','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/><strong>Spirit Syphon:</strong> Each time this operative incapacitates an enemy operative, you can select one friendly MANDRAKE operative within [PENT] of this operative to regain a number of lost Wounds equal to the incapacitated operative\'s APL.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('AEL','MND','','','SG',103,'3','Shadow Glyph','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Shadow Glyph:</strong>\nWhile this operative has a Conceal order, it  is always treated as having a Conceal order, regardless of any other rules (e.g. Vantage Point).','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','MND','','','SGEM',105,'2','Soul Gem','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Soul Gem:</strong>\nSelect a Baleblast the operative is equipped with. That weapon gains the Blast [TRI] special rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepname:baleblast','SR:Blast [TRI]','','','Equipment'),('AEL','MND','','','SP',104,'2','Spectral Essence','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Spectral Essence:</strong>\nEach time this operative performs the Dash action, it can move an additional [TRI] for that action.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','MND24','','','BD',1,'0','Bone Darts','Once per turning point, a friendly MANDRAKE operative can use the following ranged weapon:\n<table class=\"eqtable\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name</th><th>ATK</th><th>HIT</th><th>DMG</th><th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bone Dart</td><td>4</td><td>3+</td><td>2/4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"4\">Weapon Rules</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rng 6\", Rending, Silent</td>\n</tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','MND24','','','CS',2,'0','Chain Snare','Whenever an enemy operative would perform the Fall Back action while within control range of a friendly MANDRAKE operative,\nif no other enemy operatives are within that friendly operative\'s control range, you can use this rule.\nIf you do, roll 2D6, or 1D6 if that enemy operative has a higher Wounds stat than that friendly operative.\nIf any result is a 4+, that enemy cannot perform that action during that activation or counteraction (No AP are spent on it).','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','MND24','','','SG',3,'0','Shadow Glyph','Once per turning point, when a friendly MANDRAKE operative is activated WITHIN SHADOW, you can use this rule.\nIf you do, until the start of its next activation, while that operative has a Conceal order and is in cover, it cannot be selected as a valid target, taking precedence over all other rules (e.g, vantage point).','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','MND24','','','SGM',4,'0','Soul Gem','Once per turning point, when a friendly MANDRAKE operative is performing the Shoot action and you select a Baleblast, you can use this rule.\nIf you do, until the end of that action, that weapon has the Blast 1\" rule.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','TRP','','','AMW',0,'3','Accelerated Monofilament Wire','Select one Harlequin\'s Embrace the operative is equipped with. That weapon gains the Reap 1 critical hit rule and Lethal 5+ special rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepname:embrace','SR:Reap 1,Lethal 5+','','','Equipment'),('AEL','TRP','','','DM',0,'3','Death Mask*','This operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Death Mask:</strong>\nIf this operative is incapacitated, at the end of that activation, you gain 1 CP.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','TRP','','','PG',0,'3','Prismatic Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n	<tr>\n		<th>Name</th>\n        <th>A</th>\n        <th>BS</th>\n        <th>D</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n		<td>Prismatic Grenade</td>\n        <td>4</td>\n        <td>3+</td>\n        <td>3/4</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n		<td colspan=\"4\">\n			Rng [PENT], Limited, Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect, Stun\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','TRP','','','PPC',0,'3','Pure PsychoCrystals','Select one Neuro Disruptor the operative is equipped with. That weapon gains the Lethal 5+ special rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepname:disruptor','SR:Lethal 5+','','','Equipment'),('AEL','TRP','','','SMW',0,'3','Supertensile Monofilament Wire','Select one Harlequin\'s Kiss the operative is equipped with. Add 1 to that weapon\'s Normal Damage characteristic for the battle.','WepMod','wepname:kiss','D:1/0','','','Equipment'),('AEL','TRP','','','STR',0,'3','Shrieker Toxin Rounds','Select one Shuriken Pistol the operative is equipped with. That weapon gains the MW1 critical hit rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepname:shuriken pistol','SR:MW1','','','Equipment'),('AEL','TRP','','','WBT',0,'3','Wraithbone Tasliman','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Wraithbone Talisman:</strong>\nOnce per battle, when this operative is fighting in combat, making a shooting attack, or a shooting attack is made against it, you can use the Command Re-Roll Tactical Ploy without spending any CP.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','VDT','','','AMFW',0,'3','Accelerated Monofilament Wire','Select one Embrace the operative is equipped with.\r That weapon gains the Reap 1 critical hit rule and Lethal 5+ special rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepname:embrace','SR:Reap 1, Lethal 5+','','','Equipment'),('AEL','VDT','','','BH-DS',204,'0','Dazzling Spectacle','Each time this operative performs a Fight action in an activation in which it has already performed a Shoot action, or performs a Shoot action in an activation in which it has already performed a Fight action,\nin the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat or shooting attack, you can re-roll any or all of your Attack  Dice results of one result.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('AEL','VDT','','','BH-MA',203,'0','Martial Artistry','Each time this operative fights in combat, at the end of the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat, if you have retained more normal hits than your opponent has, you can change one of your retained successful normal hits to a critical hit instead.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('AEL','VDT','','','BH-PE',206,'0','Pre-Eminent','Once per battle, if an operative with this Battle Honour is the first friendly operative to be activated during the Turning Point, you can use this Battle Honour.\nIf you do so, until the end of the Turning Point, weapons that operative is equipped with gain the Lethal 5+ special rule.\nNote that you can only use this Battle Honour once per battle (even if more than one friendly operative has this Battle Honour).','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('AEL','VDT','','','BH-VIRT',205,'0','Virtuoso','Once per battle, this operative can perform two Shoot actions with a Shuriken Pistol or two Fight actions during its activation.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('AEL','VDT','','','BH-WH',201,'0','Whimsical','Each time this operative is activated, you can use the Capricious Role Tactical Ploy for this operative without spending any CP.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('AEL','VDT','','','BH-WV',202,'0','Well Versed','Once per battle, you can use a VOID-DANCER TROUPE Tactical Ploy without spending any CP if this is the VOID-DANCERT TROUPE operative specified by that Tactical Ploy.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('AEL','VDT','','','DM',0,'3','Death Mask*','This operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Death Mask:</strong>\nIf this operative is incapacitated, at the end of that activation, you gain 1 CP.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','VDT','','','PG',0,'3','Prismatic Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n    <tr>\n        <th>Name</th>\n        <th>A</th>\n        <th>BS</th>\n        <th>D</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td>Prismatic Grenade</td>\n        <td>4</td>\n        <td>3+</td>\n        <td>3/4</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td colspan=\"4\">\n            Rng [PENT], Limited, Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect, Stun\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','VDT','','','PPC',0,'3','Pure Psychocrystals*','Select one Neuro Disruptor the operative is equipped with.\nThat weapon gains the Lethal 5+ special rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepname:disruptor','SR:Lethal 5+','','','Equipment'),('AEL','VDT','','','RE-CS',402,'3','Crystal Shard','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Crystal Shard:</strong>\nOnce per battle, when a shooting attack is made against this operative, at the start of the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, you can use this ability.\nIf you do so, until the end of the Turning Point, this operative has a 3+ Invulnerable Save.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('AEL','VDT','','','RE-FF',404,'3','Falcon\'s Feather','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Falcon\'s Feather:</strong>\nAt the start of each Firefight phase after the first, if this operative is not within Line Of Sight of every enemy operative, it can perform a free Dash action.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('AEL','VDT','','','RE-HG',401,'1','Hidden Guise','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Hidden Guise:</strong>\nOnce per battle, at the start of the Strategy Phase, you can select this operative to have the pivotal role instead.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('AEL','VDT','','','RE-MP',405,'2','Mocking Panoply','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Mocking Panoply:</strong>\nEach time this operative moves, you can roll 1D6 for each enemy operative it moved within [CIRCLE] of during that move. On a 5+, that enemy operative suffers 1D3 Mortal Wounds.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('AEL','VDT','','','RE-ROM',406,'2','Raiment Of Mirrors','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Raiment Of Mirrors:</strong>\nEach time this operative fights in combat, or a shooting attack is made against it by an enemy operative within [PENT] of it, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat or shooting attack, your opponent\'s Attack Dice results of 1-3 are failed hits.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('AEL','VDT','','','RE-SC',403,'3','Shimmerclone','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Shimmerclone:</strong>\nOnce per battle, in the Resolve Successful Hits step of a combat or shooting attack, when damage would be inflicted on this operative from an Attack die, you can use this ability.\nIf you do so, ignore the damage inflicted by that Attack die.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('AEL','VDT','VDT','DJS','SG',0,'1','Support Grip*','DEATH JESTER operative only.\nRemove the Heavy special rule from the Shrieker Cannon that operative is equipped with for the battle.\nThat weapon gains the following special rule for the battle instead:<br/>\n<strong>Cumbersome:</strong> \nAn operative cannot move more than 3[CIRCLE] in the same activation in which it performs a Shoot action with this ranged weapon.','WepMod','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','VDT','','','STMFW',0,'3','Supertensile Monofilament Wire','Select one Kiss the operative is equipped with.\nAdd 1 to that weapons\'s Normal Damage characteristic for the battle.','WepMod','wepname:kiss','D:1/0','','','Equipment'),('AEL','VDT','','','STR-C',0,'4','Shrieker Toxin Rounds (Shrieker Cannon)','Select one Shrieker Cannon the operative is equipped with. That weapon gains the MW1 critical hit rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepid:SC','SR:MW1','','','Equipment'),('AEL','VDT','','','STR-P',0,'3','Shrieker Toxin Rounds (Shuriken Pistol)','Select one Shuriken Pistol the operative is equipped with. That weapon gains the MW1 critical hit rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepid:SP','SR:MW1','','','Equipment'),('AEL','VDT','','','WBT',0,'3','Wraithbone Talisman','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Wraithbone Talisman:</strong>\nOnce per battle, when this operative is fighting in combat, making a shooting attack, or a shooting attack is being made against it,\nyou can use the Command Re-Roll Tactical Ploy without spending any Command Points.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','VDT24','','','DM',3,'0','Death Mask','Keep a Tragedy tally. Whenever a friendly VOID-DANCER TROUPE operative that has an ACCOLADE rule is incapacitated, add 1 to your Tragedy tally. When your Tragedy tally reaches 3, you gain 1CP and stop that tally.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','VDT24','','','STR',2,'0','Shrieker Toxic Rounds','Once per turning point, when a friendly VOID-DANCER TROUPE operative is performing the Shoot action and you select a shuriken pistol or shrieker cannon (focused), you can use this rule.\nIf you do, until the end of that action, that weapon has the Devastating 1 weapon rule.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','VDT24','','','UM',4,'0','Understudy\'s Mask','Once per battle, when you activate a friendly VOID-DANCER TROUPE operative, if the friendly operative that has the PIVOTAL ROLE has been incapacitated, you can use this rule.\nIf you do, that activated operative has the PIVOTAL ROLE for the battle.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('AEL','VDT24','','','WBT',1,'0','Wraithbone Talisman','Once per turning point, when a friendly VOID-DANCER TROUPE operative is shooting, fighting or retaliating, if you roll two or more fails, you can discard one of them to retain another as a normal success instead.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','BLD','','','AP',0,'2','Armour Plates','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Armour Plates:</strong> Each time a shooting attack is made against this operative, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, you can re-roll any or all of your Defence Dice results of 1.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','BLD','','','BH-AOTT',201,'0','Ardent On The Trigger','Each time this operative makes a shooting attack against a target within [PENT] of it, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that shooting attack, you can re-roll any or all of your Attack Dice results of one result.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','BLD','','','BH-AUD',206,'0','Audacious','In each Firefight phase, while this operative does not have a Blooded Token and is within [PENT] of your opponent\'s drop zone, treat it as if it had a Blooded Token.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','BLD','','','BH-BR',203,'0','Bitter Resolve','Each time a shooting attack is made against this operative, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, if this operative has less than its starting number of Wounds, you can re-roll one of your Defence Dice.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','BLD','','','BH-MAR',204,'0','Marauder','Once per Turning Point, one friendly operative with this Battle Honour (excluding a TRAITOR OGRYN operative) can perform one mission action or the Pick Up action for one less AP (to a minimum of 0 AP).','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','BLD','','','BH-MFV',202,'0','Motivation For Violence','Each time this operative performs a Charge action, it can move an additional [TRI] for that action.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','BLD','','','BH-ZL',205,'0','Zealous','If this operative is incapacitated, if it has a Blooded Token and incapacitated one or more enemy operatives during the battle, add that token to your pool.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','BLD','','','BP',0,'1','Beast Pelt','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\r <strong>Beast Pelt:</strong> Each time a shooting attack is made against this operative, if the ranged weapon has the Blast or Torrent special rule, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, you can re-roll one of your Defence Dice. This operative is unaffected by the Splash critical hit rule.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','BLD','','','CB',0,'1','Chem-Breather','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Chem-Breather:</strong> You can ignore any or all modifiers to this operative\'s APL and it is not affected by the Stun critical hit rule.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','BLD','','','FG',0,'2','Frag Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n  <tr>\n  <th>Name</th>\n          <th>A</th>\n          <th>BS</th>\n          <th>D</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  <td>Frag Grenade</td>\n          <td>4</td>\n          <td>3+</td>\n          <td>2/3</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  <th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n  </tr>\n      <tr>\n  <td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect, Limited</td>\n  </tr>\n  </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','BLD','BLD','TRSW','IS',0,'2','Incendiary Shells','TRAITOR TRENCH SWEEPER operative only. A shotgun the operative is equipped with gains the following special rule for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Incendiary Shells:</strong> Each time this weapon is selected to shoot with, you can choose to fire incendiary shells. If you do so, for that shooting attack:\n<ul>\n<li>This weapon gains the Blast [TRI] special rule.</li>\n<li>Subtract 1 from this weapon\'s Normal Damage characteristic.</li>\n</ul>','WepMod','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','BLD','','','KG',0,'3','Krak Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n  <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n  	<tr>\n  		<th>Name</th>\n          <th>A</th>\n          <th>BS</th>\n          <th>D</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td>Krak Grenade</td>\n          <td>4</td>\n          <td>3+</td>\n          <td>4/5</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n  	</tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Lim, AP1, Indirect</td>\n  	</tr>\n  </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','BLD','','','RE-AB',401,'3','Alchemyk Bomb*','TRAITOR BRIMSTONE GRENADIER operative only.\nThe operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n   <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n   	<tr>\n   		<th>Name</th>\n           <th>A</th>\n           <th>BS</th>\n           <th>D</th>\n       </tr>\n       <tr>\n   		<td>Alchemyk Bomb</td>\n           <td>4</td>\n           <td>3+</td>\n           <td>3/4</td>\n       </tr>\n       <tr>\n   		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n   	</tr>\n       <tr>\n   		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect, No Cover, Lim, Rending</td>\n   	</tr>\n   </table>','WepMod','wepname:flamer','SR:AP1|D:0/1','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','BLD','','','RE-BF',406,'3','Baleflame','TRAITOR GUNNER operative equipped with a Flamer only.\nThe Flamer the operative is equipped with gains the following improvements for the battle:\n<ul>\n<li>Add 1 to its Critical Damage characteristic</li>\n<li>It gains the AP1 special rule</li>\n</ul>','WepMod','wepname:flamer','SR:AP1|D:0/1','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','BLD','','','RE-CR',404,'3','Cursed Rounds','TRAITOR CHIEFTAIN operative only. A Bolt Pistol or Boltgun the operative is equipped with gains the following improvements for the battle:\n<ul>\n<li>Add 1 to its Critical Damage characteristic</li>\n<li>It gains the AP1 special rule</li>\n</ul>','WepMod','wepname:bolt','SR:AP1|D:0/1','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','BLD','','','RE-DI',405,'3','Diabolic Icon','The operative can perform the following action during the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Diabolic Icon (1 AP):</strong>\nUntil the end of the Turning Point, each time a friendly BLOODED operative Visible To and within [SQUARE] of this operative is activated, or while a friendly BLOODED operative is Visible To and within [SQUARE] of this operative,\nthat friendly operative is motivated by a diabolic icon during that activation.\nEach time an operative motivated by a diabolic icon fights in combat, if it has a Blooded Token, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat, before rolling your Attack Dice,\nyou can retain one as a successful normal hit without rolling it.\nThis is in addition to any retained as a result of the Blooded ability.','Action','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','BLD','','','RE-DO',403,'2','Dark Orator','TRAITOR COMMSMAN or TRAITOR CHIEFTAIN operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Dark Orator:</strong>\nFor the purposes of this operative\'s Blooded Icon or Sacrilegious Actuation action, you can select any friendly operatives in the killzone, instead of one Visible to and/or within [PENT] of this operative.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','BLD','','','RE-UHS',402,'2','Unholy Sigil','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Unholy Sigil:</strong>\nEach time this operative is activated, you can use this ability. If you do so, until the end of that activation:\n<ul>\n<li>If this operative does not have a Blooded Token, treat it as if it had a Blooded Token.</li>\n<li>If this operative has a Blooded Token, treat it as if it were Under The Gaze Of The Gods. This has no effect if the operative is only treated as having a Blooded Token.</li>\n<li>At the end of this operative\'s activation, if this operative has not caused an enemy operative to lose any wounds, this operative suffers 1D3 Mortal Wounds.</li>\n</ul>','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','BLD','','','ST',0,'3','Sinister Trophy*','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Sinister Trophy:</strong> While an enemy operative is within Engagement Range of this operative, subtract 1 from the Attacks characteristic of melee weapons it is equipped with.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','BLD','','','WB',0,'1','Wicked Blades','Select a Bayonet or Improvised Blade the operative is equipped with. Add 1 to that weapon\'s Normal Damage characteristic.','WepMod','wepid:B,IB','D:1/0','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','BLD','','','WB-BS',0,'2','Wicked Blades (Bayonet And Shield)','Select a Bayonet and Shield the operative is equipped with. Add 1 to that weapon\'s Normal Damage characteristic.','WepMod','wepid:BS','D:1/0','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','BLD24','','','CS',1,'0','Chaos Sigil','The Reward Earned firefight ploy costs you 0 CP.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','BLD24','','','SOBW',3,'0','Symbols of Bloody Worship','Whenever a friendly BLOODED operative ends an action, if it was not incapacitated but inflicted damage on any enemy operatives during that action, it regains 1 lost wound.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','BLD24','','','ST',2,'0','Sinister Trophies','Whenever an enemy operative is shooting against, fighting against, or retaliating against a friendly BLOODED operative that has one of your Blooded tokens and is within 2\" of it,\nyour opponent cannot re-roll their attack dice results of 1.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','BLD24','','','WB',4,'0','Wicked Blades','Add 1 to both Dmg stats of each friendly BLOODED operative\'s bayonet, bayonet and shield, and improvised blade for the battle.','WepMod','wepid:BAY,BAS,IB','D:1/1','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','CSM','','','BF',0,'2','Belt Feed','Excludes CHAOS CULTIST operatives. Select one Boltgun or Bolt Pistol the operative is equipped with.\r That weapon gains the Ceaseless Special Rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepid:BP,BG','SR:Ceaseless','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','CSM','','','BFHB',0,'3','Belt Feed (Heavy Bolter)','Excludes CHAOS CULTIST operatives. Select one Heavy Bolter the operative is equipped with. That weapon gains the Ceaseless Special Rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepid:HB','SR:Ceaseless','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','CSM','','','DB',0,'3','Dark Blessing','Select one melee weapon the operative is equipped with.\r Add 1 to that weapon\'s Attack characteristic for the battle.','WepMod','weptype:M','A:+1','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','CSM','','','FG',0,'2','Frag Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br />\r  <table width=\"100%\" class=\"eqtable\">\r  <tr>\r  	<th>Name</th>\r      <th>A</th>\r      <th>BS</th>\r      <th>D</th>\r  </tr>\r  <tr>\r  	<td>Frag Grenade</td>\r      <td>4</td>\r      <td>3+</td>\r      <td>2/3</td>\r  </tr>\r  <tr>\r  	<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\r  </tr>\r  <tr>\r  	<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Lim, Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect</td>\r  </tr>\r  </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','CSM','','','GT',0,'3','Grisly Trophy*','Excludes CHAOS CULTIST operatives. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\r <strong>Grisly Trophy:</strong> \r While this operative is Visible to and within [SQUARE] of an enemy operative, subtract 1 from the Attacks characteristic of ranged and melee weapons that enemy operative is equipped with.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','CSM','','','KG',0,'3','Krak Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br />\r <table width=\"100%\" class=\"eqtable\">\r <tr>\r 	<th>Name</th>\r     <th>A</th>\r     <th>BS</th>\r     <th>D</th>\r </tr>\r <tr>\r 	<td>Krak Grenade</td>\r     <td>4</td>\r     <td>3+</td>\r     <td>4/5</td>\r </tr>\r <tr>\r 	<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\r </tr>\r <tr>\r 	<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Lim, AP1, Indirect</td>\r </tr>\r </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','CSM','','','MR',0,'2','Malefic Rounds','Excludes CHAOS CULTIST operatives. Select one Boltgun, Bolt Pistol, or Heavy Bolter the operative is equipped with.\r That weapon gains the P1 Special Rule for the battle. If it already has the P1 Special Rule, it gains the AP1 Special Rule instead.','WepMod','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','CSM','','','SD',0,'3','Sacrificial Dagger*','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\r <strong>Sacrificial Offering:</strong> \r Once per Turning Point, when this operative incapacitates an enemy operative in combat, this operative can regain up to 4 lost wounds.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','CSM','','','SUS',0,'3','Suspensor System','Excludes CHAOS CULTIST operatives. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n\n<ul><li>\n<strong>Suspensor System:</strong> \nThe Heavy Special Rule of ranged weapons the operative is equipped with is treated differently.\nInstead, an operative cannot move more than 3 [CIRCLE] in the same activation in which it performs a Shoot action with any of those ranged weapons. \n</li></ul>','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','CULT','CULT','MUT','AG-BARBED-MUT',206,'0','Barbed','<em>Accursed Gift<br/></em>\n This operative\'s melee weapons gain the Reap 1 critical hit rule.','WepMod','weptype:M','SR:Reap 1','','','Accursed Gift'),('CHAOS','CULT','CULT','TOR','AG-BARBED-TOR',206,'0','Barbed','<em>Accursed Gift<br/></em>\n This operative\'s melee weapons gain the Reap 2 critical hit rule.','WepMod','weptype:M','SR:Reap 2','','','Accursed Gift'),('CHAOS','CULT','CULT','MUT','AG-CHIT-MUT',203,'0','Chitinous','<em>Accursed Gift<br/></em>\nImprove this operative\'s Save characteristic by 1.','OpMod','SV','-1','','','Accursed Gift'),('CHAOS','CULT','CULT','TOR','AG-CHIT-TOR',203,'0','Chitinous','<em>Accursed Gift<br/></em>\nImprove this operative\'s Save characteristic by 1.','OpMod','SV','-1','','','Accursed Gift'),('CHAOS','CULT','CULT','MUT','AG-FLEET-MUT',202,'0','Fleet','<em>Accursed Gift<br/></em>\nAdd [TRI] to this operative\'s Movement characteristic.','OpMod','M','+[TRI]','','','Accursed Gift'),('CHAOS','CULT','CULT','TOR','AG-FLEET-TOR',202,'0','Fleet','<em>Accursed Gift<br/></em>\nAdd [TRI] to this operative\'s Movement characteristic.','OpMod','M','+[TRI]','','','Accursed Gift'),('CHAOS','CULT','CULT','MUT','AG-HORNED-MUT',204,'0','Horned','<em>Accursed Gift<br/></em>\nEach time this operative finishes a Charge action, you can select one enemy operative within its Engagement Range to suffer 1 Mortal Wound.','Ability','','','','','Accursed Gift'),('CHAOS','CULT','CULT','TOR','AG-HORNED-TOR',204,'0','Horned','<em>Accursed Gift<br/></em>\nEach time this operative finishes a Charge action, you can select one enemy operative within its Engagement Range to suffer 1D3 Mortal Wounds.','Ability','','','','','Accursed Gift'),('CHAOS','CULT','CULT','MUT','AG-SINEW-MUT',205,'0','Sinewed','<em>Accursed Gift<br/></em>\n <ul>\n <li>You can ignore any or all modifiers to the Weapon Skill characteristic of this operative\'s Melee weapons</li>\n <li>This operative\'s melee weapons gain the Brutal special rule</li>\n </ul>','WepMod','weptype:M','SR:Brutal','','','Accursed Gift'),('CHAOS','CULT','CULT','TOR','AG-SINEW-TOR',205,'0','Sinewed','<em>Accursed Gift<br/></em>\n <ul>\n <li>You can ignore any or all modifiers to the Weapon Skill characteristic of this operative\'s Melee weapons</li>\n <li>This operative\'s melee weapons gain the Brutal special rule</li>\n </ul>','WepMod','weptype:M','SR:Brutal','','','Accursed Gift'),('CHAOS','CULT','CULT','MUT','AG-WINGED-MUT',201,'0','Winged','<em>Accursed Gift<br/></em>\r Each time this operative performs an action in which it moves:\r  <ul>\r  <li>Ignore the first distance of [CIRCLE] it travels for a climb, drop, or traverse</li>\r  </ul>','Ability','','','','','Accursed Gift'),('CHAOS','CULT','CULT','TOR','AG-WINGED-TOR',201,'0','Winged','<em>Accursed Gift<br/></em>\r Each time this operative performs an action in which it moves:\r  <ul>\r  <li>Ignore the first distance of [CIRCLE] it travels for a climb, drop, or traverse</li>\r  </ul>','Ability','','','','','Accursed Gift'),('CHAOS','CULT','','','BH-DB',206,'0','Dark Blessings','The first time you select an Accursed Gift for your KillTeam, also select a different Accursed Gift to be the Dark Blessing. Each time an operative with this ability would gain an Accursed Gift, they can gain the Dark Blessing instead (max one per operative).','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','CULT','','','BH-DC',204,'0','Dark Communion','This operative does not need to be within [PENT] of a CULT DEMAGOGUE for the purposes of that operative\'s Unique Actions.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','CULT','','','BH-PM',205,'0','Pain Metamorphosis','While this operative is not a MUTANT or TORMENT, at the end of each combat or shooting attack in which it lost wounds but was not incapacitated, it can Mutate.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','CULT','','','BH-TFS',203,'0','Thirst For Slaughter','Each time this operative performs a Charge action, improve the WS characteristic of its melee weapons by 1 until the end of the activation.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','CULT','','','BH-TR',202,'0','Tainted Resilience','This operative cannot be injured.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','CULT','','','BH-VR',201,'0','Violent Rampage','This operative can perform the Charge action while within Engagement Range of an enemy operative.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','CULT','','','CG',3,'2','Covert Guise','DEVOTEE operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Covert Guise</strong>\nAt the end of the Scouting step, if this operative is wholly within your drop zone, it can perform a free Dash action.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','CULT','','','CS',4,'2','Chaos Sigil','The operative gains the following ability for the battle. If the operative mutates into anther operative type as a result of the Mutation ability, it keeps the following ability for the battle.<br/>\n<strong>Chaos Sigil</strong>\nThis operative has a 5+ Invulnerable Save.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','CULT','','','FG',0,'2','Frag Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the follwing ranged weapon for the battle. If the operative mutates into a MUTANT or TORMENT operative, this equipment is removed from it.\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n   <tr>\n   <th>Name</th>\n           <th>A</th>\n           <th>BS</th>\n           <th>D</th>\n       </tr>\n       <tr>\n   <td>Frag Grenade</td>\n           <td>4</td>\n           <td>3+</td>\n           <td>2/3</td>\n       </tr>\n       <tr>\n   <th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n   </tr>\n       <tr>\n   <td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect, Limited, No Overwatch</td>\n   </tr>\n   </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','CULT','','','KG',1,'3','Krak Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the follwing ranged weapon for the battle. If the operative mutates into a MUTANT or TORMENT operative, this equipment is removed from it.\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n   	<tr>\n   		<th>Name</th>\n           <th>A</th>\n           <th>BS</th>\n           <th>D</th>\n       </tr>\n       <tr>\n   		<td>Krak Grenade</td>\n           <td>4</td>\n           <td>3+</td>\n           <td>4/5</td>\n       </tr>\n       <tr>\n   		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n       </tr>\n       <tr>\n   		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], AP1, Indirect, Limited, No Overwatch</td>\n       </tr>\n   </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','CULT','','','RE-AC',406,'1','Accursed Consecration','DARK COMMUNE operative only. The operative gainst the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Accursed Consecration:</strong>\nWhen this item of equipment is revealed, select one Accursed Gift for this operative to gain.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','CULT','','','RE-AS',405,'3','Abhorrent Sceptre','CULT DEMAGOGUE or MINDWITCH operative only. The operative gainst the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Abhorrent Sceptre:</strong>\nEach time this operative is activated, it can perform one free Unique Action during its activation.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','CULT','','','RE-MF',404,'4','Mutating Flames','ICONARCH operative only. The operative gainst the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Mutating Flames:</strong>\nAdd [CIRCLE] to the distance of this operative\'s Ruinous Deterioration and Ruinous Ingvigoration abilities.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','CULT','','','RE-NI',401,'2','Noxious Ichor','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Noxious Ichor:</strong>\nEach time an Attack die inflicts damage on this operative, roll 1D6 separately for each enemy operative within its Engagement Range: on a 3+, that enemy operative suffers 1 Mortal wound.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','CULT','','','RE-PS',402,'2','Paralysing Sting','This operative\'s Melee weapons gain the Stun critical hit rule.','WepMod','weptype:M','SR:Stun','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','CULT','','','RE-VC',403,'3','Vicious Claw','Add 1 to both Damage characteristics of the operative\'s Melee weapons.','WepMod','weptype:M','D:1/1','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','CULT','','','TW',2,'1','Trophy Weapon*','DEVOTEE operative only. Select a Crude Melee Weapon or Pistol the operative is equipped with. Add 1 to both Damage characteristics of that weapon for the battle.','WepMod','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','CULT','','','VB',5,'3','Vile Blessing*','The operative gains the following ability for the battle. If the operative mutates into anther operative type as a result of the Mutation ability, it keeps the following ability for the battle.<br/>\n<strong>Vile Blessing</strong>\nOnce per battle, in the Resolve Successful Hits step of a combat or shooting attack, you can ignore the damage inflicted on this operative from one Attack die.\nThis must be done before rolling to ignore lost wounds (see Unnatural Regeneration ability).','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','CULT24','CULT24','MUT','AG-BARBED-MUT',206,'0','Barbed','Whenever this operative is fighting or retaliating:<ul><li>Enemy operatives cannot assist.</li><li>Each time you strike, also inflict 1 damage on each other enemy operative within this operative’s control range.</li></ul>','Ability','','','','','Accursed Gift'),('CHAOS','CULT24','CULT24','TOR','AG-BARBED-TOR',206,'0','Barbed','Whenever this operative is fighting or retaliating:<ul><li>Enemy operatives cannot assist.</li><li>Each time you strike, also inflict D3 damage on each other enemy operative within this operative’s control range.</li></ul>','Ability','','','','','Accursed Gift'),('CHAOS','CULT24','CULT24','MUT','AG-CHIT-MUT',203,'0','Chitinous','Improve this operative’s Save stat by 1.','OpMod','SV','-1','','','Accursed Gift'),('CHAOS','CULT24','CULT24','TOR','AG-CHIT-TOR',203,'0','Chitinous','Improve this operative’s Save stat by 1.','OpMod','SV','-1','','','Accursed Gift'),('CHAOS','CULT24','CULT24','MUT','AG-FLEET-MUT',202,'0','Fleet','Add 1\" to this operative’s Move stat.','OpMod','M','+1','','','Accursed Gift'),('CHAOS','CULT24','CULT24','TOR','AG-FLEET-TOR',202,'0','Fleet','Add 1\" to this operative’s Move stat.','OpMod','M','+1','','','Accursed Gift'),('CHAOS','CULT24','CULT24','MUT','AG-HORNED-MUT',204,'0','Horned','Whenever this operative ends its move during the Charge action, you can inflict 1 damage on one enemy operative within its control range.','Ability','','','','','Accursed Gift'),('CHAOS','CULT24','CULT24','TOR','AG-HORNED-TOR',204,'0','Horned','Whenever this operative ends its move during the Charge action, you can inflict  D3 damage on one enemy operative within its control range.','Ability','','','','','Accursed Gift'),('CHAOS','CULT24','CULT24','MUT','AG-SINEW-MUT',205,'0','Sinewed','You can ignore any changes to the Hit stat of this operative’s','Ability','','','','','Accursed Gift'),('CHAOS','CULT24','CULT24','TOR','AG-SINEW-TOR',205,'0','Sinewed','You can ignore any changes to the Hit stat of this operative’s','Ability','','','','','Accursed Gift'),('CHAOS','CULT24','CULT24','MUT','AG-WINGED-MUT',201,'0','Deformed Wings','Whenever this operative is climbing, treat the vertical distance as 2\" (regardless of how far the operative actually moves vertically). Whenever this operative is dropping, ignore the vertical distance.','Ability','','','','','Accursed Gift'),('CHAOS','CULT24','CULT24','TOR','AG-WINGED-TOR',201,'0','Deformed Wings','Whenever this operative is climbing, treat the vertical distance as 2\" (regardless of how far the operative actually moves vertically). Whenever this operative is dropping, ignore the vertical distance.','Ability','','','','','Accursed Gift'),('CHAOS','CULT24','','','BS',1,'0','Baleful Script','Once per battle STRATEGIC GAMBIT. Change one of your ACCURSED GIFTS. Note that if it is an ACCURSED GIFT an operative has from the Abhorrent Mutation firefight ploy, only that operative benefits from this.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','CULT24','','','CG',2,'0','Covert Guises','After revealing this equipment option, roll one D3. As a STRATEGIC GAMBIT in the first turning point, a number of friendly CHAOS CULT DEVOTEE operatives equal to the result that are wholly within your drop zone can immediately perform\na free Reposition action, but must end that move wholly within 3\" of your drop zone.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','CULT24','','','UT',3,'0','Unholy Talisman','Once per turning point, when an operative is shooting a friendly CHAOS CULT operative, in the Roll Defence Dice step, you can retain one of your normal successes as a critical success instead.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','CULT24','','','VB',4,'0','Vile Blessing','Once per battle, when an attack dice inflicts Normal Dmg on a friendly CHAOS CULT operative (excluding DEVOTEE), you can ignore that inflicted damage.\nIf that friendly operative is a MUTANT or TORMENT operative, you cannot roll for the Unnatural Regeneration rule for that attack dice then decide to use this rule on the same dice – you must use one or the other.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','DAEM','DETTE','','AM',0,'3','Alluring Musk','SLAANESH operative only. The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n<table width=\"100%\" class=\"eqtable\">\n	<tr>\n		<th>Name</th>\n        <th>A</th>\n        <th>BS</th>\n        <th>D</th>\n	</tr>\n    <tr>\n		<td>Alluring Musk</td>\n        <td>5</td>\n        <td>2+</td>\n        <td>1/1</td>\n	</tr>\n    <tr><th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th></tr>\n    <tr><td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Stun</td></tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','DAEM','BL','','BH',0,'1','Brass Horns','KHORNE operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Brass Horns:</strong>\nEach time this operative fights in combat, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat, if it performed a Charge action during that activation, you can re-roll one of your attack dice.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','DAEM','PB','','DH',0,'1','Death\'s Heads','NURGLE operative only. The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n<table width=\"100%\" class=\"eqtable\">\n	<tr>\n		<th>Name</th>\n        <th>A</th>\n        <th>BS</th>\n        <th>D</th>\n	</tr>\n    <tr>\n		<td>Death\'s Heads</td>\n        <td>4</td>\n        <td>3+</td>\n        <td>3/5</td>\n	</tr>\n    <tr><th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th></tr>\n    <tr><td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT]</td></tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','DAEM','DETTE','','PC',0,'2','Piercing Claws','SLAANESH operative only.\nSelect one Claws the operative is equipped with. Add 1 to that weapon\'s Critical Damage characteristic and it gains the Rending Special Rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepname:claws','D:0/1|SR:Rending','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','DAEM','','','RD',0,'2','Ritual Dagger','PINK HORROR or BLUE HORROR operative only. The operative is equipped with the following melee weapon for the battle:\n<table width=\"100%\" class=\"eqtable\">\n	<tr>\n		<th>Name</th>\n        <th>A</th>\n        <th>BS</th>\n        <th>D</th>\n	</tr>\n    <tr>\n		<td>Ritual Dagger</td>\n        <td>3</td>\n        <td>4+</td>\n        <td>3/6</td>\n	</tr>\n    <tr><th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th></tr>\n    <tr><td colspan=\"4\">Balanced</td></tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','DAEM','PB','','RV',0,'3','Rancid Vomit','NURGLE operative only. The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n<table width=\"100%\" class=\"eqtable\">\n	<tr>\n		<th>Name</th>\n        <th>A</th>\n        <th>BS</th>\n        <th>D</th>\n	</tr>\n    <tr>\n		<td>Rancid Vomit</td>\n        <td>5</td>\n        <td>2+</td>\n        <td>2/3</td>\n	</tr>\n    <tr><th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th></tr>\n    <tr><td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Tor [TRI]</td></tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','DAEM','BL','','SS',0,'3','Scorched Skull','KHORNE operative only. The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n<table width=\"100%\" class=\"eqtable\">\n	<tr>\n		<th>Name</th>\n        <th>A</th>\n        <th>BS</th>\n        <th>D</th>\n	</tr>\n    <tr>\n		<td>Scorched Skull</td>\n        <td>4</td>\n        <td>4+</td>\n        <td>4/5</td>\n	</tr>\n    <tr><th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th></tr>\n    <tr><td colspan=\"4\">AP1</td></tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','DAEM','','','TOF',0,'2','Trinket Of Flux','PINK HORROR or BLUE HORROR operative only.\nSelect one Coruscating Flames or Fizzing Flames the operative is equipped with. Add 1 to that weapon\'s Damage characteristic for the battle.','WepMod','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','DG','','','BG',0,'2','Blight Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n 	<tr>\n 		<th>Name</th>\n         <th>A</th>\n         <th>BS</th>\n         <th>D</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td>Blight Grenade</td>\n         <td>4</td>\n         <td>3+</td>\n         <td>2/3</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n 	</tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Blast [CIRCLE], Lim, Indirect, Ceaseless</td>\n 	</tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','DG','','','FC',0,'3','Filth Censer*','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Filth Censer:</strong>\nEach time you use the Contagion Strategic Ploy, enemy operatives are treated as being injured while this operative is Visible to and within 2 [CIRCLE] of them (instead of [CIRCLE]).','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','DG','','','KG',0,'3','Krak Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n 	<tr>\n 		<th>Name</th>\n         <th>A</th>\n         <th>BS</th>\n         <th>D</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td>Krak Grenade</td>\n         <td>4</td>\n         <td>3+</td>\n         <td>4/5</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n 	</tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Lim, AP1, Indirect</td>\n 	</tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','DG','','','MT',0,'2','Mephitic Toxin','Select one Plague Knife or Plague Knives the operative is equipped with. Add 1 to that weapon\'s Normal Damage characteristic.','WepMod','wepname:plague kni','D:1/0','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','DG','','','NG',0,'3','Nurgling*','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Nurgling Mischief:</strong> Once per battle, when an enemy operative Visible to and within [SQUARE] of this operative is activated, you can use this ability. If you do so, subtract 1 from that enemy operative\'s APL.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','DG','','','PB',0,'3','Plague Bell*','The operative can perform the following action during the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Plague Bell (1 AP):</strong>\nUntil the end of the Turning Point, each time a friendly BUBONIC ASTARTES operative is activated within [PENT] of this operative, until the end of that activation, add [CIRCLE] to that friendly operative\'s Movement characteristic.','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','DG','','','VR',0,'1','Virulent Rounds','Select one Boltgun or Bolt Pistol the operative is equipped with. Add 1 to that weapon\'s Critical Damage characteristic.','WepMod','wepid:BG,BP','D:0/1','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','FELL','','','BH-FER',203,'0','Fervent','Before the battle, when selecting equipment, you can equip this operative with War Paint for 0 EP and it does not have to be in your stash.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','FELL','','','BH-PM',204,'0','Primal Mark','Each time an enemy operative fights in combat with or makes a shooting attack against this operative, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat or shooting attack,\nkeep track of each successful normal hit with a result that equals the selected weapon\'s WS/BS characteristic. Such attack dice inflict half damage on this operative (rounding up).','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','FELL','','','BH-RL',205,'0','Ruthless','Each time this operative fights in combat, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat, for each attack die result of 1 that your opponent discards, the enemy operative in that combat suffers 1 Mortal Wound.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','FELL','','','BH-SBC',206,'0','Sustained By Conflict','Each time a shooting attack is made against this operative, if it is Visible to and within [PENT] of an enemy operative, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack,\nyou can re-roll one of your Defence dice.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','FELL','','','BH-SF',202,'0','Savage Fortitude','In the Update Dataslates step, if this operative incapacitated one or more enemy operatives during the battle and was incapacitated itself, you can re-roll its Casualty test.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','FELL','','','BH-WILD',201,'0','Wild','While this operative has fewer than its starting number of Wounds remaining, its melee weapons gain the Ceaseless special rule.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','FELL','FELL','','CR',2,'1','Corrupted Rounds','Select one Autopistol the operative is equipped with. That weapon gains the Rending critical hit rul for the battle.','WepMod','wepname:autopistol','SR:Rending','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','FELL','FELL','','CW',3,'2','Corrupted Weapon','Select one Bludgeon or Cleaver the operative is equipped with (excluding Skullcleaver or Triple Cleavers).\nThat weapon gains the Rending critical hit rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepid:BL,CL','SR:Rending','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','FELL','FELL','','FG',0,'2','Frag Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n  	<tr>\n  		<th>Name</th>\n          <th>A</th>\n          <th>BS</th>\n          <th>D</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td>Frag Grenade</td>\n          <td>4</td>\n          <td>3+</td>\n          <td>2/3</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect, Limited, No Overwatch</td>\n      </tr>\n  </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','FELL','FELL','','KG',1,'3','Krak Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n  	<tr>\n  		<th>Name</th>\n          <th>A</th>\n          <th>BS</th>\n          <th>D</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td>Krak Grenade</td>\n          <td>4</td>\n          <td>3+</td>\n          <td>4/5</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], AP1, Indirect, Limited</td>\n      </tr>\n  </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','FELL','','','RE-BH',402,'2','Brass Hooves','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Crown Of Horns:</strong>\nYou can use the Wild Rage Tactical Ploy for 0 CP if this operative is the friendly FELLGOT RAVAGER operative.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','FELL','','','RE-COH',401,'2','Crown Of Horns','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Crown Of Horns:</strong>\nYou can use the Animalistic Fury Tactical Ploy for 0 CP if this operative is the friendly FELLGOT RAVAGER operative.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','FELL','','','RE-DT',404,