s for 0CP each.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','FELL24','','','CS',3,'0','Chaos Sigil','Once per turning point, when an operative is shooting a friendly FELLGOR RAVAGER operative, at the start of the Roll Defence Dice step, you can use this rule.\nIf you do, worsen the x of the Piercing weapon rule by 1 (if any) until the end of that sequence. Note that Piercing 1 would therefore be ignored.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','FELL24','','','GM',2,'0','Gore Marks','Once per turning point, when a friendly FELLGOR RAVAGER operative is fighting or retaliating, you can use this rule.\nIf you do, inflict 1 damage on that friendly operative and re-roll one of your attack dice. If the result is a fail, inflict 1 additional damage on that friendly operative.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','FELL24','','','WP',4,'0','War Paint','You can ignore any changes to the Move stat of friendly FELLGOR RAVAGER operatives from being injured.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','GPI','','','BH-FF',202,'0','Freakish Follower','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nIf this operative is ready, it can be activated to fulfil the Group Activation requirements of another friendly\nGELLERPOX INFECTED operative it could not normally be group activated with (e.g. even if it is not of the same type, and even if it has a Croup Activation characteristic of 1).','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','GPI','','','BH-FS',206,'0','Fly Swarm','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nEach time a shooting attack is made against this operative by an enemy operative more than [PENT] from it,\nin the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, you can re-roll any or all of your defence dice results of l.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','GPI','','','BH-OG',204,'0','Obstinate Gifts','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nYou can ignore any or all modifiers to this operative\'s Movement and APL characteristics.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','GPI','','','BH-RR',203,'0','Repulsive Resilience','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nFor the purposes of the Revoltingly Resilient ability, you can re-roll results of 1 for this operative.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','GPI','','','BH-RS',201,'0','Repugnant Stench','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nEach time an enemy operative is activated within [SQUARE] of this operative, that enemy operative is treated as being injured for the purposes of its Movement characteristic,','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','GPI','','','BH-TT',204,'0','Twisted Talon','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nIf this operative is a GLITCHLING, melee weapons this operative is equipped with gain the Lethal 5+ special rule.\nOtherwise, melee weapons this operative is equipped with gain the Brutal special rule.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','GPI','','','CM',0,'2/3','Cursemite','You gain a CURSEMITE operative for the battle.\nThe first time you select this equipment for each battle, it costs 3EP; otherwise, it costs 2EP.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','GPI','GPI','VTC','ENG-BAL',22,'0','Engineered - Balanced','<em>Vulgrar Thrice-Cursed<br/></em>Fleshmelded Weapons gain Balanced.','WepMod','wepid:FMW','SR:Bal','','','Engineered'),('CHAOS','GPI','GPI','VTC','ENG-BRU',22,'0','Engineered - Brutal','<em>Vulgrar Thrice-Cursed<br/></em>Fleshmelded Weapons gain Brutal.','WepMod','wepid:FMW','SR:Brutal','','','Engineered'),('CHAOS','GPI','GPI','VTC','ENG-CD',21,'0','Engineered - Critical Damage','<em>Vulgrar Thrice-Cursed<br/></em>Fleshmelded Weapons gain +1 Critical Damage.','WepMod','wepid:FMW','D:0/1','','','Engineered'),('CHAOS','GPI','GPI','VTC','ENG-L5',22,'0','Engineered - Lethal 5+','<em>Vulgrar Thrice-Cursed<br/></em>Fleshmelded Weapons gain Lethal 5+.','WepMod','wepid:FMW','SR:Lethal 5+','','','Engineered'),('CHAOS','GPI','GPI','VTC','ENG-ND',20,'0','Engineered - Normal Damage','<em>Vulgrar Thrice-Cursed<br/></em>Fleshmelded Weapons gain +1 Normal Damage.','WepMod','wepid:FMW','D:1/0','','','Engineered'),('CHAOS','GPI','GPI','VTC','ENG-RND',22,'0','Engineered - Rending','<em>Vulgrar Thrice-Cursed<br/></em>Fleshmelded Weapons gain Rending.','WepMod','wepid:FMW','SR:Rending','','','Engineered'),('CHAOS','GPI','','','ESS',1,'2/3','Eyestinger Swarm','You gain an EYESTINGER SWARM operative for the battle.\nThe first time you select this equipment for each battle, it costs 3EP; otherwise, it costs 2EP.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','GPI','','','RE-FH',401,'1/3','Flesh Hunger','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle. If the operative is a NIGHTMARE HULK, this equipment costs 3 EP; otherwise it costs 1 EP.<br/>\n<strong>Flesh Hunger:</strong>\nEach time an enemy operative is incapacitated by this operative while within its Engagement Range, this operative regains 1D3 lost Wounds.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','GPI','','','RE-MP',402,'1','Mutoid Pheromones','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Mutoid Pheromones:</strong>\nWhile a friendly MUTOID VERMIN operative is within [SQUARE] of this operative, improve the WS and BS of weapons that friendly operative is equipped with by 1.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','GPI','','','RE-SE',406,'2','Scrapcode Emanator','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Scrapcode Emanator:</strong>\nEach time an enemy operative within [PENT] of this operative fights in combat or makes a shooting attack,\nin the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat or shooting attack,\nyour opponent must re-roll one of their successful critical hits.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','GPI','','','RE-TP',404,'1','Toxic Pus','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\r The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\r <strong>Toxic Pus:</strong>\r Each time this operative loses a Wound, roll 1D6 for each enemy operative within its Engagement Range. On a 6, that enemy ooperative suffers 1 Mortal Wound.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','GPI','','','RE-UA',405,'1/2','Unreal Aura','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nIf the operative is a NIGHTMARE HULK, this equipment costs 2 EP. Otherwise, it costs 1 EP.<br/>\nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Unreal Aura:</strong>\nThis operative has a 5+ Invulnerable Save.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','GPI','','','RE-VI',403,'1','Vermin Infestation','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nThe operative can perform the following action during the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Vermin Infestation (1 AP):</strong>\nSelect one friendly MUTOID VERMIN operative that is incapacitated and removed from the killzone.\nSet it up again with all of its Wounds remaining, Visible To and within [SQUARE] of this operative.\nThis operative can only perform this action once per battle.','Action','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','GPI','','','SG',2,'2/3','Sludge-Grub','You gain a SLUDGE-GRUB operative for the battle.\nThe first time you select this equipment for each battle, it costs 3EP; otherwise, it costs 2EP.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','GPI24','','','MS',3,'0','Mutated Symptoms','Once per battle, when you activate a friendly GELLERPOX INFECTED operative, you can select one additional TECHNO-CURSE for that operative to gain until the end of the turning point (it must be different from your existing TECHNO-CURSE). Note that if a rule refers to an enemy operative being affected by your selected TECHNO-CURSE rule (e.g. Plague Bellows faction equipment), it is affected by your additional TECHNO-CURSE rule too.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','GPI24','','','MV',1,'0','Mutoid Vermin','After revealing this equipment option, add two GELLERPOX INFECTED MUTOID VERMIN operatives to your kill team for the battle. You can select this equipment option up to twice per battle.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','GPI24','','','PB',4,'0','Plague Bellows','Whenever an enemy operative is within 2\" of friendly GELLERPOX INFECTED NIGHTMARE HULK operatives, that enemy operative is affected by your selected TECHNO-CURSE rule.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','GPI24','','','PS',2,'0','Polluted Stockpile','After revealing this equipment option, roll 2D6: on a 7+, remove one of your opponent’s selected equipment options; otherwise, that player removes one of their own selected equipment options.\nThey cannot select that equipment again during the game sequence (e.g. in the Scouting step of Approved Ops). You cannot select this equipment option after the Select Operatives step.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','GPI24','','','TC-BW',101,'0','Barrelwarp','<strong>Techno-Curse</strong><br/>\nSubtract 1 from the Atk stat of that enemy operative’s ranged weapons.','Ability','','','','','Techno-Curse'),('CHAOS','GPI24','','','TC-SRS',102,'0','Screaming Rustspikes','<strong>Techno-Curse</strong><br/>\nWhenever that enemy operative is fighting or retaliating against a friendly GELLERPOX INFECTED operative, if your opponent discards any attack dice as a fail, inflict 1 damage on that enemy operative.','Ability','','','','','Techno-Curse'),('CHAOS','GPI24','','','TC-VVS',103,'0','Viral Vox-Static','<strong>Techno-Curse</strong><br/>\nThat enemy operative’s APL stat cannot be added to (remove all positive APL stat changes it has).','Ability','','','','','Techno-Curse'),('CHAOS','LEG','','','AS',0,'3','Aggression Stimulants*','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Aggression Stimulants:</strong>\nEach time this operative fights in combat, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat,\nif this operative performed a Charge action during this Turning Point, you can re-roll one of your attack dice.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','LEG','','','BH-AOC',201,'0','Apostle Of Chaos','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nThis operative gains the Favoured Of The Dark Gods ability.\n<br/>\n<strong>Favoured Of The Dark Gods:</strong>\nOnce per Turning Point, when it is your turn to use a Strategic Ploy, if any friendly operatives with this ability are in the killzone, you can use a Strategic Ploy without spending any CPs; that Strategic Ploy must have the same <MARK OF CHAOS> selectable keyword as one friendly operative with this ability. For example, if an operative with this ability has the KHORNE keyword, you could use the Blood for the Blood God Strategic Ploy. If an operative with this ability has the UNDIVIDED keyword, you can use the following Strategic Ploys for this ability instead: Hateful Assault, Malicious Volleys.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','LEG','','','BH-DA',203,'0','Devastating Assault','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nMelee weapons this operative is equipped with gain the Brutal special rule.','WepMod','weptype:R','SR:Brutal','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','LEG','','','BH-FBH',205,'0','Fueled By Hate','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nWhile this operative has fewer than half its Wounds remaning, each time it is activated, add 1 to its APL.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','LEG','','','BH-SOTDG',204,'0','Servant Of The Dark Gods','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nOnce per action, when an Attack die would inflict Critical Damage on this operative, you can choose for it to inflict Normal Damage instead.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','LEG','','','BH-VI-M',206,'0','Vengeance Incarnate (Melee)','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nSelect one melee weapon this operative is equipped with. Improve the Weapon Skill characteristic of that weapon by 1 (to a maximum of 2+).','WepMod','weptype:M','BS:-1','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','LEG','','','BH-VI-R',207,'0','Vengeance Incarnate (Ranged)','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nSelect one ranged weapon this operative is equipped with. Improve the Ballistic Skill characteristic of that weapon by 1 (to a maximum of 2+).','WepMod','weptype:R','BS:-1','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','LEG','','','BH-WB',202,'0','Warp-Blessed','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nImprove this operative\'s Save characteristic by 1 (to a maximum of 2+).','OpMod','SV','2+','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','LEG','','','CB-K-WO',101,'0','[CB] Khorne - Wrathful Onslaught','<em>Chaos Blessing - Khorne</em><br/>\r Each time this operative fights in combat, in the Resolve Successful Hits step of that combat, if you did not retain any critical hits, you can strike with one normal hit as if it were a critical hit. ','Ability','','','','','Chaos Blessing'),('CHAOS','LEG','','','CB-N-DV',102,'0','[CB] Nurgle - Disgusting Vigour','<em>Chaos Blessing - Nurgle</em><br/>\r Each time a shooting attack is made against this operative, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, you can retain one normal save as a critical save. ','Ability','','','','','Chaos Blessing'),('CHAOS','LEG','','','CB-S-UA',103,'0','[CB] Slaanesh - Unnatural Agility','<em>Chaos Blessing - Slaanesh</em><br/>\r Add [TRI] to this operative\'s Movement characteristic.','OpMod','M','+[TRI]','','','Chaos Blessing'),('CHAOS','LEG','','','CB-T-EG',104,'0','[CB] Tzeentch - Empyreal Guidance','<em>Chaos Blessing - Tzeentch</em><br/>\r Each time this operative makes a shooting attack, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that shooting attack, you can retain one of your attack dice results of 5+ that is a sucessful hit as a critical hit. ','Ability','','','','','Chaos Blessing'),('CHAOS','LEG','','','CB-U-VC',105,'0','[CB] Undivided - Vicious Reavers','<em>Chaos Blessing - Undivided</em><br/>\r Each time this operative fights in combat or makes a shooting attack, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat or shooting attack, if the target is within [PENT] of it, you can re-roll one of your attack dice.','Ability','','','','','Chaos Blessing'),('CHAOS','LEG','','','FG',0,'2','Frag Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n <tr>\n <th>Name</th>\n         <th>A</th>\n         <th>BS</th>\n         <th>D</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n <td>Frag Grenade</td>\n         <td>4</td>\n         <td>3+</td>\n         <td>2/3</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n <th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n </tr>\n     <tr>\n <td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect, Limited</td>\n </tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','LEG','','','GT',0,'3','Grisly Trophy*','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Grisly Trophy:</strong>\nWhile this operative is Visible to and with [SQUARE] of an enemy operative, subtract 1\nfrom the Attacks characteristic of ranged and melee weapons that enemy operative is equipped with.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','LEG','','','KG',0,'3','Krak Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n <tr>\n <th>Name</th>\n         <th>A</th>\n         <th>BS</th>\n         <th>D</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n <td>Krak Grenade</td>\n         <td>4</td>\n         <td>3+</td>\n         <td>4/5</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n <th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n </tr>\n     <tr>\n <td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], AP1, Indirect, Limited</td>\n </tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','LEG','','','MB',0,'2','Malefic Blade','The operative is equipped with the following melee weapon for the battle:\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n     <tr>\n         <th>Name</th>\n         <th>A</th>\n         <th>WS</th>\n         <th>D</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n         <td>Malefic Blade</td>\n         <td>5</td>\n         <td>3+</td>\n         <td>3/5</td>\n     </tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','LEG','LEG','BA','MS',0,'2','Malign Scripture','LEGIONARY BALEFIRE ACOLYTE operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Malign Scripture:</strong>\nOnce per battle, this operative can perform two Manifest Psychic Power actions during its activation.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','LEG','','','RE-BOTD',401,'3','Brands Of The Damned','<em>Rare Equipment<br/></em>\nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Brands Of The Damned:</strong>\nOnce per battle, if this operative is in the kill zone, you can use a Tactical Ploy without spending any CP;\nthat Tactical Ploy must have the same <MARK OF CHAOS> selectable keyword as this operative.\nFor example, if this operative has the SLAANESH keyword, you can use the Sickening Captivation Tactical Ploy.\nIf this operative has the UNDIVIDED keyword, you can use the Veteran Of The Long War or Command Re-Roll Tactical Ploys instead.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','LEG','LEG','BUT','RE-DA',405,'3','Daemon Axe','<em>Rare Equipment<br/></em>\nLEGIONARY BUTCHER operative only.<br/>\nAdd 1 to the Attacks characteristic of the Double-Handed Chain Axe the operative is equipped with for the battle.','WepMod','wepid:DHCA','A:+1','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','LEG','','','RE-GOV',402,'2','Gauntlets Of Vengeance','<em>Rare Equipment<br/></em>\nOperative equipped with Fists only.<br/>\nThe Fists the operative is equipped with gain the following improvements for the battle:\n<ul>\n<li>It gains the Relentless special rule and the Rending critical hit rule</li>\n<li>Add 1 to its Attacks characteristics</li>\n</ul>','WepMod','wepid:F','SR:Relentless, Rending|A:+1','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','LEG','LEG','IB','RE-IOC',404,'4','Icon Of Chaos','<em>Rare Equipment<br/></em>\nLEGIONARY ICON BEARER operative only.<br/>\nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Icon Of Chaos:</strong>\nWhile this operative is in the kill zone, friendly LEGIONARY operatives cannot be Injured.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','LEG','LEG','BA','RE-POS',403,'2','Pages Of Scabrius','<em>Rare Equipment<br/></em>\nLEGIONARY BALEFIRE ACOLYTE operative only.<br/>\nThis operative can perform the Manifest Psychic Power action twice during its activation.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','LEG','','','RE-RBP',406,'2','Relic Bolt Pistol','<em>Rare Equipment<br/></em>\nOperative equipped with Bolt Pistol or Tainted Bolt Pistol only.<br/>\nThe Bolt Pistol or Tainted Bolt Pistol the operative is equipped with gains the following improvements for the battle:\n<ul>\n<li>Add 1 to its Attacks characteristic</li>\n<li>It gains the Relentless special rule</li>\n</ul>','WepMod','wepid:BP,TBP','A:+1|SR:Relentless','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','LEG','','','SS',0,'3','Suspensor System','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Suspensor System:</strong>\nThe Heavy special rule of ranged weapons the operative is equipped with is treated differently.\nInstead, an operative cannot move more than 3[CIRCLE] in the same activation in which it\nperforms a Shoot action with any of those ranged weapons.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','LEG','','','TR',0,'3','Tainted Rounds*','Select one Boltgun, Bolt Pistol, or Tainted Bolt Pistol the operative is equipped with.\r Add 1 to both Damage characteristics of that weapon.','WepMod','wepid:BP,BG,TBP','D:1/1','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','LEG','','','WA',0,'3','Warded Armour*','Change the operative\'s Save characteristic to 2+ for the battle.\nIn the Resolve Successful Hits step of a combat or shooting attack, if an attack die inflicts damage on this operative,\nits Save characteristic is changed back to its normal characteristic for the rest of the battle.','OpMod','SV','2+','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','LEG24','','','CT',54,'0','Chaos Talismans','<strong>STRATEGIC GAMBIT</strong>\nSelect one Marks of Chaos keyword.\nOnce during each of their activations, when a friendly LEGIONARY operative that has that keyword is shooting, fighting or retaliating, if you roll two or more fails,\nyou can inflict D3 damage on that friendly operative to discard one of them and retain the other as a normal success instead.\nNote that if it is the Shoot action and that damage incapacitates that friendly operative, the action does not end (continue the sequence with your successful attack dice).','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','LEG24','','','MB',52,'0','Malefic Blades','Friendly LEGIONARY operatives have the following melee weapon for the battle:\n<table class=\"eqtable\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name</th><th>ATK</th><th>HIT</th><th>DMG</th><th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Malefic Blade</td><td>5</td><td>3+</td><td>3/4</td>\n</tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','LEG24','','','MOC-K',1,'0','Khorne - Wrathful Onslaught','This operative\'s melee weapons have the Severe weapon rule.<br/><strong>Severe: </strong>If you do not retain any critical successes, you can change one of your normal successes to a critical success. Any rules that take effect as a result of retaining a critical success (e.g. Devastating, Piercing Crits, etc.) still do.','WepMod','weptype:M','SR:Severe','','','Mark Of Chaos'),('CHAOS','LEG24','','','MOC-N',2,'0','Nurgle - Disgusting Vigour','Whenever Normal Dmg of 3 or more is inflicted on this operative, roll one D6: on a 5+, subtract 1 from that inflicted damage.','Ability','','','','','Mark Of Chaos'),('CHAOS','LEG24','','','MOC-S',3,'0','Slaanesh - Unnatural Agility','Add 1\" to this operative’s Move stat.','Ability','','','','','Mark Of Chaos'),('CHAOS','LEG24','','','MOC-T',4,'0','Tzeentch - Empyreal Guidance','This operative’s ranged weapons have the Severe weapon rule.<br/><strong>Severe: </strong>If you do not retain any critical successes, you can change one of your normal successes to a critical success. Any rules that take effect as a result of retaining a critical success (e.g. Devastating, Piercing Crits, etc.) still do.','WepMod','weptype:R','SR:Severe','','','Mark Of Chaos'),('CHAOS','LEG24','','','MOC-U',5,'0','Undivided - Vicious Reavers','Whenever this operative is shooting against, fighting against or retaliating against an enemy operative within 6\" of it, this operative\'s weapons have the Ceaseless weapon rule.','Ability','','','','','Mark Of Chaos'),('CHAOS','LEG24','','','TR',53,'0','Tainted Rounds','Once per turning point, when a friendly LEGIONARY operative is performing the Shoot action and you select a bolt pistol or boltgun, you can use this rule.\nIf you do, until the end of that action, that weapon has the Rending weapon rule.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','LEG24','','','WA',51,'0','Warded Armour','<strong>STRATEGIC GAMBIT</strong> Select one friendly LEGIONARY operative. Until the Ready step of the next Strategy phase, change that operative’s Save stat to 2+.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','NC','','','BH-AOWD',204,'0','At One With Darkness','Each time a shooting attack is made against this operative, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, before rolling your defence dice, if it is in Cover, you can do one of the following:\n<ul>\n<li>Retain one additional die as a successful normal save as a result of Cover.</li>\n<li>Retain one additional die as a successful critical save instead of a normal save as a result of Cover.</li>\n</ul>','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','NC','','','BH-MF',206,'0','Malicious Fighter','When this operative is incapacitated by an enemy operative within its Engagement Range, that enemy operative suffers 1D3+1 Mortal Wounds.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','NC','','','BH-MOS',201,'0','Master Of Stealth','While this operative has a Conceal order, it is always treated as having a Conceal order, regardless of other rules (e.g. Vantage Point).','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','NC','','','BH-PS',202,'0','Prey Stalker','This operative can perform the Charge action while it has a Conceal order.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','NC','','','BH-SH',203,'0','Spiteful  Hunter','This operative can perform the Charge action while within Engagement Range of an enemy operative.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','NC','','','BH-VM',205,'0','Vicious Murderer','This operative\'s Melee weapons gain the Brutal special rule. While this operative has combat support, its Melee weapons gain the Lethal 5+ special rule for that combat. If they already have Lethal 5+, they gain the Rending critical hit rule for that combat instead.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','NC','','','CB',105,'1','Combat Blade','The operative is equipped with the following melee weapon for the battle:<br/>\n <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n 	<tr>\n 		<th>Name</th>\n         <th>A</th>\n         <th>WS</th>\n         <th>D</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td>Combat Blade</td>\n 		<td>4</td>\n         <td>3+</td>\n         <td>3/5</td>\n     </tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','NC','','','CS',103,'1','Chain Snare','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Chain Snare:</strong>\nWhile only one enemy operative is within Engagement Range of this operative, that enemy operative is Snared.\nEach time a snared enemy operative would perform the Fall Back action, roll 1D6, subtracting 1 if that enemy operative has a higher Wounds characteristic than this operative, and adding 1 if that enemy operative is Injured.\nOn a 4+, that enemy operative cannot perform that action, but no AP are subtracted.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','NC','','','FG',106,'2','Frag Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br/>\n  <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n  	<tr>\n  		<th>Name</th>\n          <th>A</th>\n          <th>WS</th>\n          <th>D</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td>Frag Grenade</td>\n  		<td>4</td>\n          <td>3+</td>\n          <td>2/3</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td colspan=\"4\">\n  			Rng [PENT], Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect, Lim\n	    </td>\n      </tr>\n  </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','NC','','','FS',101,'2','Flayed Skin','<em>Not available for operatives equipped with a Grisly Trophy.<br/></em>\nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Flayed Skin:</strong>\nWhile this operative is Visible To and within [SQUARE] of an enemy operative, your opponent cannot re-roll attack or defence dice for that enemy operative.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','NC','','','GT',102,'3','Grisly Trophy*','<em>Not available for operatives equipped with Flayed Skin.<br/></em>\nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Grisly Trophy:</strong>\nWhile this operative is Visible To and within [SQUARE] of an enemy operative, subtract 1 from the Attacks characteristic of that enemy operative\'s Ranged and Melee weapons.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','NC','','','KG',107,'3','Krak Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br/>\n  <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n  	<tr>\n  		<th>Name</th>\n          <th>A</th>\n          <th>WS</th>\n          <th>D</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td>Krak Grenade</td>\n  		<td>4</td>\n          <td>3+</td>\n          <td>4/5</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td colspan=\"4\">\n  			Rng [PENT], AP1, Indirect, Lim, No Overwatch\n          </td>\n      </tr>\n  </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','NC','','','RE-CW',405,'2','Chainweb','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/><strong>Chainweb:</strong> Unless they being a move outside of this operative\'s Engagement Range and can FLY, enemy operatives cannot move out of this operative\'s Engagement Range.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','NC','','','RE-EOM',402,'2','Elixir Of Misery','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/><strong>Elixir Of Misery:</strong> Keep a Misery tally for this operative. Each time an operative is incapacitated, add 1 to the Misery tally. Once per battle, when this operative is activated, you can use this ability. If you do so, this operative regains a number of lost Wounds equal to your Misery tally (to a maximum of 8).','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','NC','NC','VIS','RE-HH',406,'2','Harbinger\'s Helm','VISIONARY operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/><strong>Harbinger\'s Helm:</strong> For the purposes of this operative\'s Prescience ability, add 3 Prescience tokens to your pool (do not roll 1D3).','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','NC','NC','FRM','RE-II',404,'2','Infernal Ichor','FEARMONGER operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/><strong>Infernal Ichor:</strong> <ul><li>Change the Blast [CIRCLE] special rule of this operative\'s Terrorchem Vial to Blast [SQUARE].</li><li>Change the distance requirement for this operative\'s Poison Objective action to [SQUARE] (instead of [CIRCLE]).','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','NC','','','RE-MA',401,'2','Macabre Adornments','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/><strong>Macabre Adornments:</strong> Each time an enemy operative is activated, if this operative is Visible To and within [SQUARE] of it, subtract 1 from its APL.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','NC','','','RE-ME',403,'2','Malign Etchings','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/><strong>Malign Etchings:</strong> Each time a shooting attack is made against this operative, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that shooting attack, your opponent cannot retain attack dice as critical hits (they must be retained as normal hits instead).','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','NC','NC','HGNR','SS',104,'3','Suspensor System','<em>HEAVY GUNNER operative only.<br/></em>\nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Suspensor System:</strong>\nThe Heavy special rule of this operative\'s ranged weapons is treated differently.\nInstead, an ooperative cannot move more than 3[CIRCLE] in the same activation in which it performs the Shoot action with any of those ranged weapons.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','NC24','','','CJ',2,'0','Comms Jammer','Whenever an enemy operative is within 8\" of a friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative, that enemy operative\'s APL stat cannot be added to. Note that this does not affect APL stats that have already been changed.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','NC24','','','CS',1,'0','Chain Snare','Whenever an enemy operative would perform the Fall Back action while within control range of a friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative, if no other enemy operatives are within that friendly operative\'s control range, you can use this rule.\nIf you do, roll 2D6, or 1D6 if that enemy operative has a higher Wounds stat than that friendly operative.\nIf any result is a 4+, that enemy operative cannot perform that action during that activation or counteraction (No AP are spent on it).','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','NC24','','','FS',3,'0','Flayed Skin','Whenever an enemy operative is shooting against, fighting against or retaliating against a friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative within 2\" of it, your opponent cannot re-roll their attack dice results of 1.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','NC24','','','GT',4,'0','Grisly Trophy','Once per Battle, when a friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative incapacitates an enemy operative within 2\" of it, you can use this rule.\nIf you do, that friendly operative gains one of your Grisly Trophy tokens (if it does not already have one).\nWhenever a friendly NEMESIS CLAW operative that has one of your Grisly Trophy tokens is visible to and within 2\" of an enemy operative, subtract 1 from the ATK stat of that enemy operative\'s weapons.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','PM24','','','BG',2,'0','Blight Grenades','Friendly PLAGUE MARINE operatives have the following ranged weapon (you cannot select it for use more than twice during the battle):\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name</th><th>A</th><th>BS</th><th>D</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Blight Grenade</td><td>4</td><td>4+</td><td>2/4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr><th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"4\">Range 6\", Blast 2\", Saturate, Severe, *Poison</td></tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','PM24','','','PB',1,'0','Plague Bells','You can ignore any changes to the stats of friendly PLAGUE MARINE operatives from being injured (including their weapons’ stats).','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','PM24','','','PR',3,'0','Plague Rounds','Friendly PLAGUE MARINE operatives\' boltguns and bolt pistols have the Poison and Severe weapon rules.','WepMod','wepid:BG,BP','SR:*Poison, Severe','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','PM24','','','PV',4,'0','Poison Vents','Whenever an enemy operative that has one of your Poison tokens is activated within 3\" of a friendly PLAGUE MARINE operative, inflict D3 damage on it (instead of the normal 1).','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','TS','','','ASE',0,'2','All-Seeing Eye*','\nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>All-seeing Eye:</strong> Once per battle, you can do one of\nthe following:\n<ul>\n<li>If this operative is ready, you can activate it after\nactivating a friendly operative.</li>\n<li>You can activate a ready friendly operative after\nactivating this operative.</li>\n</ul>','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','TS','TZA','','ER',0,'2','Ensorcelled Rounds','TZAANGOR operative only. Select one autopistol the\noperative is equipped with. Add 1 to that weapon\'s Damage\ncharacteristics for the battle.','WepMod','wepname:autopistol','D:1/1','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','TS','','','GB',0,'2','Gargoyle Bayonet','The operative is equipped with the following melee weapon\nfor the battle:\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n	<tr>\n		<th>Name</th>\n        <th>A</th>\n        <th>WS</th>\n        <th>D</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n		<td>Gargoyle Bayonet</td>\n        <td>3</td>\n        <td>3+</td>\n        <td>4/4</td>\n    </tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','TS','TZA','','GH',0,'1','Gilded Horns','TZAANGOR operative only. The operative gains the following\nability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Gilded Horns:</strong> Each time this operative fights in combat,\nif it performed a Charge action during that activation, in\nthe Roll Attack Dice step of that combat, you can retain one\nof your attack dice results of 5+ that is a successful hit as a\ncritical hit.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','TS','RUB','SR','MS',0,'2','Mythic Scroll*','ASPIRING SORCERER operative only. The operative gains the\nfollowing ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Mythic Scroll:</strong> Once per battle, during this operative\'s\nactivation, it can perform a free Manifest Psychic\nPower action.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','TS','','','RW',0,'3','Runic Ward*','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Runic Ward:</strong> Once per battle, in the Roll Defence Dice step\nof a shooting attack made against this operative, you can\nuse this ability. If you do so, you can retain one of your failed\nsaves as a successful normal save, or one of your successful\nnormal saves as a successful critical save.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','TS','TZA','','TT',0,'3','Treasure Trinket*','TZAANGOR operative only. Add 1 CP to your pool for\nthe battle.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','WC','','','[BOT]-AET-CR',209,'0','[BOT] Aetheric - Crystalline','<em>Boon Of Tzeentch</em><br/><br/>\nImprove this operative’s Save characteristic by 1.','OpMod','SV','-1','','','Boon Of Tzeentch'),('CHAOS','WC','','','[BOT]-AET-EW',208,'0','[BOT] Aetheric - Empyric Ward','<em>Boon Of Tzeentch</em><br/><br/>\nThis operative has a 4+ invulnerable save.','OpMod','','','','','Boon Of Tzeentch'),('CHAOS','WC','','','[BOT]-AET-IM',207,'0','[BOT] Aetheric - Immaterial Flight','<em>Boon Of Tzeentch</em><br/><br/>\nThis operative gains the FLY keyword.','Ability','','','','','Boon Of Tzeentch'),('CHAOS','WC','','','[BOT]-FAT-IS',206,'0','[BOT] Fate - Incorporeal Sight','<em>Boon Of Tzeentch</em><br/><br/>\nRanged weapons this operative is equipped with (excluding ranged weapons from a psychic power) gain the Lethal 5+ and No Cover special rules.','WepMod','weptype:R','SR:Lethal 5+, No Cover','','','Boon Of Tzeentch'),('CHAOS','WC','','','[BOT]-FAT-POD',201,'0','[BOT] Fate - Patron Of Destiny','<em>Boon Of Tzeentch</em><br/><br/>\nOnce per Turning Point, when this operative is fighting in combat or making a shooting attack or a shooting attack is being made against it, you can use the Command Re-roll Tactical Ploy without spending any CPs. Each time you do so, roll one D6: on a 1-3, this operative loses this ability for the rest of the battle.','Ability','','','','','Boon Of Tzeentch'),('CHAOS','WC','','','[BOT]-FAT-TW',205,'0','[BOT] Fate - Time-Walker','<em>Boon Of Tzeentch</em><br/><br/>\r <ul>\r <li>Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of melee weapons this operative is equipped with.</li>\r <li>Add [TRI] to this operative’s Movement characteristic.</li>\r </ul>','WepMod','weptype:M','A:+1','','','Boon Of Tzeentch'),('CHAOS','WC','','','[BOT]-MUT-AT',204,'0','[BOT] Mutation - Avian Talons','<em>Boon Of Tzeentch</em><br/><br/>\nEach time this operative fights in combat, if it performed a Charge action during this activation, in the Resolve Successful Hits step of that combat, if you did not retain any critical hits, you can strike with one normal hit as if it were a critical hit.','Ability','','','','','Boon Of Tzeentch'),('CHAOS','WC','','','[BOT]-MUT-MA',203,'0','[BOT] Mutation - Mutant Appendage','<em>Boon Of Tzeentch</em><br/><br/>\nOnce per Turning Point, during this operative’s activation, it can perform a mission action or the Pick Up action for one less AP (to a minimum of 0AP).','Ability','','','','','Boon Of Tzeentch'),('CHAOS','WC','','','[BOT]-MUT-WS',202,'0','[BOT] Mutation - Warp Swell','<em>Boon Of Tzeentch</em><br/><br/>\nAdd 1 to the Normal Damage characteristic of melee weapons this operative is equipped with.','WepMod','weptype:R','D:1/0','','','Boon Of Tzeentch'),('CHAOS','WC','WC','SOR','[DISC]-DEST',101,'0','Destiny Discipline','<strong>Weave Fate:</strong> Select one friendly WARPCOVEN operative Visible to this operative. Until the start of this operative’s next activation, until it\'s incapacitated, or until this psychic power is selected again (whichever comes first), each time a shooting attack is made against that operative, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, you can re-roll any or all of your defence dice.<br><br/>\n <strong>Twist Destiny:</strong> Select one enemy operative Visible to this operative. Until the start of this operative’s next activation, until it\'s incapacitated, or until this psychic power is selected again (whichever comes first):\n <ul>\n <li>Each time that enemy operative fights in combat or makes a shooting attack, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that shooting attack, your opponent cannot re-roll their attack dice.</li>\n <li>That enemy operative ignores all positive modifiers to its APL.</li>\n </ul><br/>\n <strong>Doombolt:</strong> Perform a free Shoot action using the following ranged weapon:\n <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n <tr>\n 	<th>Name</th><th>A</th><th>BS</th><th>D</th>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n 	<td>Doombolt</td><td>4</td><td>3+</td><td>3/3</td>\n </tr>\n <tr colspan=\"4\">\n <th>Special Rules</th>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n <td>Lethal 5+, MW2</td>\n </tr>\n </table>','Weapon,Action','','','','','Discipline'),('CHAOS','WC','WC','SOR','[DISC]-TEMP',102,'0','Tempyric Discipline','<strong>Ephemeral Instability:</strong> Until the start of this operative’s next activation, until it\'s incapacitated, or until this psychic power is selected again (whichever comes first), subtract [TRI] from the distance that enemy operatives can move when performing Charge and Dash actions.<br><br/>\n<strong>Temporal Manipulation:</strong> Select one friendly WARPCOVEN operative Visible to and within [PENT] of this operative. That operative regains 2D3 lost wounds.<br/><br/>\n<strong>Fluxblast:</strong> Perform a free Shoot action using the following ranged weapon:\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr>\n	<th>Name</th><th>A</th><th>BS</th><th>D</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n	<td>Fluxblast</td><td>4</td><td>3+</td><td>3/4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr colspan=\"4\">\n<th>Special Rules</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Blast [CIRCLE], Rending</td>\n</tr>\n</table>','Weapon,Action','','','','','Discipline'),('CHAOS','WC','WC','SOR','[DISC]-WARP',103,'0','Warpfire Discipline','<strong>Warp Portal:</strong> Select one friendly WARPCOVEN operative Visible to and within [SQUARE] of this operative that has not performed an action in which it moved during this Turning Point. Remove it from the killzone and set it back up again within [PENT] of this operative and not within Engagement Range of an enemy operative. That friendly operative cannot perform actions in which it moves during this Turning Point.<br><br/>\n<strong>Infernal Fire:</strong> Select one enemy operative Visible to this operative. Until the start of this operative’s next activation, until it\'s incapacitated, or until this psychic power is selected again (whichever comes first), each time a friendly WARPCOVEN operative fights in combat or makes a shooting attack against that enemy operative, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat or shooting attack, you can re-roll any or all of your attack dice.<br/><br/>\n<strong>Firestorm:</strong> Perform a free Shoot action using the following ranged weapon:\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr>\n	<th>Name</th><th>A</th><th>BS</th><th>D</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n	<td>Firestorm</td><td>5</td><td>4+</td><td>2/2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr colspan=\"4\">\n<th>Special Rules</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Barrage, Blast [TRI], Indirect</td>\n</tr>\n</table>','Weapon,Action','','','','','Discipline'),('CHAOS','WC','WC','SOR','AR',0,'2','Arcane Robes','SORCERER operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Arcane Robes:</strong> Once per Turning Point, when Critical Damage would be inflicted upon this operative, you can use this ability. If you do so, that attack dice inflicts Normal Damage instead.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','WC','','','BH-AM',321,'0','Avian Mobility','<em>Tzaangor Specialist<br/></em>\n<ul>\n<li>You can ignore any or all modifiers to this operative\'s Movement characteristic</li>\n<li>Each time this operative climbs or drops, you can ignore the first vertical distance of [CIRCLE] it travels for that climb or drop</li>\n</ul>','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','WC','','','BH-AU',313,'0','Automata','<em>Rubric Marine Specialist<br/></em>\n<ul>\n<li>Each time this operative is activated, you can ignore any or all modifiers to its APL</li>\n<li>This operative is not affected by the Stun critical hit rule</li>\n</ul>','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','WC','WC','SOR','BH-BN',301,'0','Boon','<em>Sorcerer Specialist<br/></em>\nThis operative gains one Boon Of Tzeentch','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','WC','','','BH-MUT',322,'0','Mutation','<em>Tzaangor Specialist<br/></em>\nThis operative gains one Boon Of Tzeentch.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','WC','WC','SOR','BH-RA',303,'0','Rubric Affinity','<em>Sorcerer Specialist<br/></em>\r Select one friendly RUBRIC MARINE operative from your dataslate. For the purposes of that operative\'s Sorcerer\'s Command ability, this SORCERER operative only needs to be in the killzone (instead of within [PENT]).','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','WC','','','BH-SAV',323,'0','Savage','<em>Tzaangor Specialist<br/></em>\nWeapons this operative is equipped with gain the Rending critical hit rule.','WepMod','weptype:M','SR:Rending','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','WC','WC','SOR','BH-ST',302,'0','Studious','<em>Sorcerer Specialist<br/></em>\nSelect one Psychic Power from a discipline this operative has not studied. This operative knows that Psychic Power.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','WC','','','BH-UW',312,'0','Unwavering','<em>Rubric Marine Specialist<br/></em>\nThis operative has a 4+ Invulnerable Save.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','WC','','','BH-WARD',311,'0','Warded','<em>Rubric Marine Specialist<br/></em>\nThe first time an Attack Die would inflict damage on this operative in each battle, halve the damage instead (rounding up).','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('CHAOS','WC','WC','TZFTR','EAR',0,'2','Ensorcelled Rounds','TZAANGOR FIGHTER operative only. Select one autopistol the operative is equipped with. Add 1 to that weapon’s Damage characteristics for the battle.','WepMod','wepname:autopistol','D:1/1','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','WC','','','GB',0,'2','Gargoyle Bayonet','RUBRIC MARINE operative only. The operative is equipped with the following melee weapon for the battle:\n <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n 	<tr>\n 		<th>Name</th>\n         <th>A</th>\n         <th>BS</th>\n         <th>D</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td>Gargoyle Bayonet</td>\n         <td>4</td>\n         <td>3+</td>\n         <td>4/4</td>\n     </tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','WC','','','GH',0,'1','Gilded Horns','TZAANGOR operative only. The operative gams the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Gilded Horns:</strong> Each time this operative fights in combat, if it performed a Charge action during that activation, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat, you can retain one of your attack dice results of 5+ that is a successful hit as a critical hit.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','WC','WC','TZFTR','HCM',0,'1','High-Capacity Magazine (AutoPistol)','Select one autopistol the operative is equipped with. That weapon gains the Ceaseless special rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepid:AP','SR:Ceaseless','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','WC','','','HCMBG',0,'3','High-Capacity Magazine (Bolt Pistol/Boltgun)','Select one inferno bolt pistol or inferno boltgun the operative is equipped with. That weapon gains the Ceaseless special rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepid:IBP,IBG','SR:Ceaseless','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','WC','','','OT',0,'2','Occult Talisman','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Occult Talisman:</strong> Each time this operative would lose a wound as a result of a mortal wound or a shooting attack from a psychic power, roll one D6: on a 5+, that wound is not lost.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','WC','','','RE-AA',402,'3','Animate Avians','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Animate Avians:</strong>\nWhile an enemy operative is within Engagement Range of this operative, subtract 1 from the Attacks characteristic of melee weapons that enemy operative is equipped with.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','WC','','','RE-AG',404,'3','Aeonglass','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Aeonglass:</strong>\nOnce per battle, when this operative is activated, you can use this ability. if you do so, add 1 to this operative\'s APL.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','WC','','','RE-CB',406,'3','Changeblade','The operative can perform the following action during the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Changeblade (1 AP):</strong>\nSelect one friendly TZAANGOR operative Visible To and within [TRI] of this operative and roll 1D6:\n<ul>\n<li>On a 1-2, that operative suffers 1 Mortal Wound</li>\n<li>On a 3-4, until the end of the battle, improve the BS and WS characteristics of ranged and melee weapons that operative is equipped with by 1</li>\n<li>On a 5-6, that operative gains 3 Wounds. This can take it above its Wounds characteristic (any Wounds gained above its Wounds characteristic are removed at the end of the battle)</li>\n</ul>','Action','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','WC','','','RE-FH',405,'3','Fluxhelm','SORCERER operative only. The operative gains one Boon Of Tzeentch for the battle (that Boon is removed at the end of the battle). It must be randomly determined.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','WC','','','RE-SAV',401,'1','Oculus (AutoPistol)','Select an Autopistol the operative is equipped with. Remove its Rng [PENT] special rule for the battle.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','WC','','','RE-SAV2',401,'2','Oculus (Bolt Pistol)','Select an Inferno Bolt Pistol the operative is equipped with. Remove its Rng [PENT] special rule for the battle.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','WC','','','RE-WFM',403,'3','Witchfire Mantle','SORCERER operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Witchfire Mantle:</strong>\nEach time this operative makes a shooting attack with a ranged weapon from a Psychic Power, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that shooting attack, you can re-roll one of your Attack Dice.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('CHAOS','WC','WC','SOR','SS',0,'4','Sorcerous Scroll*','SORCERER operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Sorcerous Scroll:</strong> When this operative gains this ability, select one psychic power from a discipline this operative has not studied. Once in the battle, when this operative performs the Manifest Psychic Power action, if it is not within Engagement Range of an enemy operative, you can select that psychic power to be resolved for that action.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','WC24','','','AR',4,'0','Arcane Robes','Whenever an attack dice would inflict Critical Dmg on a friendly WARPCOVEN SORCERER operative, you can choose for that attack dice to inflict Normal Dmg instead.\nYou cannot use this rule for each friendly WARPCOVEN SORCERER operative more than once per turning point.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','WC24','','','BOT-AB',108,'0','[BOT] Astral Bombardment','Select one of this operative\'s PSYCHIC ranged weapons. That weapon has the Devastating 1 weapon rule. If you select a doombolt, it has the 2\" Devastating 2 weapon rule instead of Devastating 2.','WepMod','wepid:FB,FS,FSTRM,MB','SR:Dev1','','','Boon Of Tzeentch'),('CHAOS','WC24','','','BOT-AB-DB',108,'0','[BOT] Astral Bombardment (Doombolt)','Select one of this operative\'s PSYCHIC ranged weapons. That weapon has the Devastating 1 weapon rule. If you select a doombolt, it has the 2\" Devastating 2 weapon rule instead of Devastating 2.','WepMod','wepid:DB','SR:2\" Dev2','','','Boon Of Tzeentch'),('CHAOS','WC24','','','BOT-EFTW',103,'0','[BOT] Echoes From The Warp','Once per battle, when you counteract with this operative, you can change its order, and it can perform an additional 1AP action for free during that counteraction, but both actions must be different.','Ability','','','','','Boon Of Tzeentch'),('CHAOS','WC24','','','BOT-IF',105,'0','[BOT] Immaterial Flight','Once per turning point, when this operative is performing the Charge or Reposition action during its activation, it can FLY.\nIf it does, don’t move it. Instead, remove it from the killzone and set it back up wholly within a distance equal to its Move stat of its original location, measuring the horizontal distance only.\nIn a killzone that uses the close quarters rules (e.g. Killzone: Gallowdark), this distance cannot be measured over or through Wall terrain, and that operative cannot be set up on the other side of an access point\n(in other words, it cannot FLY through an open hatchway).<br/>\nNote that it gains no additional distance when performing the Charge action. It must be set up in a location it can be placed, and unless it’s the Charge action, it cannot be set up within control range of an enemy operative.','Ability','','','','','Boon Of Tzeentch'),('CHAOS','WC24','','','BOT-IS',101,'0','[BOT] Incorporeal Sight','This operative’s ranged weapons have\nthe Saturate weapon rule. Whenever\nthis operative is shooting, enemy\noperatives cannot be obscured.','WepMod','weptype:R','SR:Sat, NoObscure','','','Boon Of Tzeentch'),('CHAOS','WC24','','','BOT-MA',107,'0','[BOT] Mutant Appendage','Having an enemy operative within this operative\'s control range does not prevent it from performing the Pick Up Marker or mission actions.<br/>\nOnce per activation, this operative can perform the Pick Up Marker, Place Marker or a mission action for 1 less AP.','Ability','','','','','Boon Of Tzeentch'),('CHAOS','WC24','','','BOT-MOTI',109,'0','[BOT] Master Of The Immaterium','Add 3\" to the distance requirements of this operative’s PSYCHIC actions that have a distance requirement.','Ability','','','','','Boon Of Tzeentch'),('CHAOS','WC24','','','BOT-TOF',106,'0','[BOT] Twist Of Fate','This operative’s PSYCHIC ranged weapons have the Piercing Crits 1 weapon rule.','WepMod','weptype:P','SR:PrcCrit1','','','Boon Of Tzeentch'),('CHAOS','WC24','','','BOT-TW',102,'0','[BOT] Time-Walk','Add 1\" to this operative’s Move stat.','Ability','','','','','Boon Of Tzeentch'),('CHAOS','WC24','','','BOT-WA',104,'0','[BOT] Warp Swell','Add 1 to the Normal Dmg stat of this operative’s melee weapons.','WepMod','weptype:M','D:1/0','','','Boon Of Tzeentch'),('CHAOS','WC24','','','DMW',2,'0','Daemonmaw Weapons','Add 1 to the Atk stat of friendly WARPCOVEN RUBRIC MARINE operatives’ melee weapons. Whenever a friendly WARPCOVEN RUBRIC MARINE operative is retaliating, its melee weapons have the Accurate 1 weapon rule.','WepMod','weptype:M','A:+1','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','WC24','','','ER',1,'0','Ensorcelled Rounds','Friendly WARPCOVEN operatives’ inferno boltguns, inferno bolt pistols and autopistols have the Devastating 1 weapon rule.','WepMod','wepid:IBG,IBP,AP','SR:Dev1','','','Equipment'),('CHAOS','WC24','WC24','SOD','SOD-LDR',0,'0','Leader - Destiny','You must select at least one friendly SORCERER operative, and one of your selected SORCERER operatives must have the LEADER keyword for the battle.\nAdd 1 to that LEADER operative\'s Wounds stat for the battle.','OpMod','W','+1','','','Sorcerer Leader'),('CHAOS','WC24','WC24','SOT','SOT-LDR',0,'0','Leader - Tempyrion','You must select at least one friendly SORCERER operative, and one of your selected SORCERER operatives must have the LEADER keyword for the battle.\nAdd 1 to that LEADER operative\'s Wounds stat for the battle.','OpMod','W','+1','','','Sorcerer Leader'),('CHAOS','WC24','WC24','SOW','SOW-LDR',0,'0','Leader - Warpfire','You must select at least one friendly SORCERER operative, and one of your selected SORCERER operatives must have the LEADER keyword for the battle.\nAdd 1 to that LEADER operative\'s Wounds stat for the battle.','OpMod','W','+1','','','Sorcerer Leader'),('CHAOS','WC24','','','SS',3,'0','Sorcerous Scrolls','Once per battle, when a friendly WARPCOVEN SORCERER operative is activated or counteracts, you can select one additional BOON OF TZEENTCH for it to have until the end of the turning point,\nbut it cannot be the same BOON OF TZEENTCH that it or any other friendly operative has.\nThis takes precedence over the normal Boons of Tzeentch rules.\nNote that if you use this rule when a friendly operative counteracts and you select Echoes from the Warp, it can be used immediately to change the operative’s order and perform a free action during that counteraction.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('HBR','AEF','AEF','VND','CC',1,'4','Camo Cloak*','VINDICARE ASSASSIN operative only.\nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Camo Cloak:</strong>\nIf this operative is in Cover and has a Conceal order, any enemy operatives count this operative as being Obscured.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('HBR','AEF','AEF','VND','EA',2,'4','Exitus Ammunition','VINDICARE ASSASSIN operative only.</br/>\nOnce per battle, this operative can use one of the following ranged weapons:\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n	<tr>\n		<th>Name</th>\n		<th>A</th>\n		<th>BS</th>\n		<th>D</th>\n	</tr>\n	<tr>\n		<td>Shield-Breaker Round</td>\n		<td>4</td>\n		<td>2+</td>\n		<td>4/1</td>\n	</tr>\n	<tr>\n		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n	</tr>\n	<tr>\n		<td colspan=\"4\">Lethal 5+, Silent, Heavy, MW6</td>\n	</tr>\n</table>\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n	<tr>\n		<th>Name</th>\n		<th>A</th>\n		<th>BS</th>\n		<th>D</th>\n	</tr>\n	<tr>\n		<td>Hellfire Round</td>\n		<td>4</td>\n		<td>2+</td>\n		<td>3/3</td>\n	</tr>\n	<tr>\n		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n	</tr>\n	<tr>\n		<td colspan=\"4\">Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect, Lethal 5+, Heavy, Splash 2</td>\n	</tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('HBR','AEF','AEF','EVS','ES',6,'4','Enhanced Stimms','EVERSOR ASSASSIN operative only.\nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Enhanced Stimms:</strong>\nOnce per battle, when this operative is performing a Charge action, add an additional [CIRCLE] to the Movement characteristic of this operative for this action.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('HBR','AEF','AEF','CUL','ETH',4,'4','Etherium','CULEXUS ASSASSIN operative only.\nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Etherium:</strong>\nAny enemy operatives further than [PENT] from this operative always count this operative as an operative with a Conceal order.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('HBR','AEF','AEF','EVS','MB',5,'3','Melta Bomb*','EVERSOR ASSASSIN operative only.</br/>\nThe operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br/>\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n	<tr>\n		<th>Name</th>\n		<th>A</th>\n		<th>BS</th>\n		<th>D</th>\n	</tr>\n	<tr>\n		<td>Melta Bomb</td>\n		<td>4</td>\n		<td>2+</td>\n		<td>6/3</td>\n	</tr>\n	<tr>\n		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n	</tr>\n	<tr>\n		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng 2[CIRCLE], Blast [CIRCLE], AP2, MW4, Indirect, Lim</td>\n	</tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('HBR','AEF','AEF','CAL','PB',7,'3','Poison Blade','CALLIDUS ASSASSIN operative only.</br/>\nThe operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br/>\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n	<tr>\n		<th>Name</th>\n		<th>A</th>\n		<th>BS</th>\n		<th>D</th>\n	</tr>\n	<tr>\n		<td>Poison Blade</td>\n		<td>4</td>\n		<td>2+</td>\n		<td>3/2</td>\n	</tr>\n	<tr>\n		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n	</tr>\n	<tr>\n		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Lethal 5+, Silent, MW2, Lim</td>\n	</tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('HBR','AEF','AEF','CUL','POG',3,'3','Psyk-Out Grenade*','CULEXUS ASSASSIN operative only.</br/>\nThe operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br/>\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n	<tr>\n		<th>Name</th>\n		<th>A</th>\n		<th>BS</th>\n		<th>D</th>\n	</tr>\n	<tr>\n		<td>Psyk-Out Grenade</td>\n		<td>4</td>\n		<td>3+</td>\n		<td>1/2</td>\n	</tr>\n	<tr>\n		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n	</tr>\n	<tr>\n		<td colspan=\"4\">Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect, Lim, Psyk-Out*</td>\n	</tr>\n</table>\n* <strong>Psyk-Out:</strong> \nIf an enemy operative loses any wounds as a result of an attack with this weapon and has a Conceal order, change it to Engage order; if it has an Engage order, change it to Conceal order.\n<br/>\nEach time a shooting attack is made with this weapon, if the target has the PSYKER or DAEMON keyword, this weapon gains the MW2 special rule for that attack.','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('HBR','AEF','AEF','CAL','VOS',8,'4','Veil Of Shadows*','CALLIDUS ASSASSIN operative only.\nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Veil Of Shadows:</strong>\nOnce per battle, you can remove this operative from the killzone. \nThen, place this operative anywhere in the killzone, but it should be more than [PENT] away from the closest enemy operative.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('HBR','SHV','','','AUS',0,'3','Auspex*','The operative can perform the following action during the battle: <br/> <strong>Auspex (2 AP):</strong>  Select one friendly SPACE MARINE operative within [SQUARE] of and Visible to this operative. Until the end of the Turning Point, that operative\'s ranged weapons are treated as having the No Cover Special Rule. This operative cannot perform this action while within Engagement Range of enemy operatives.','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('HBR','SHV','','','IOFTM',0,'2','Invocation Of The Chapter\'s Might','TERMINATOR operative only. This operative cannot have its movement reduced by any means, and can move through traversible terrain and scramble as if it were not there.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('HBR','SHV','','','NAR',0,'2','Narthecium*','<em>Replaces Power Fist/Chainfist<br/></em>\nSPACE HULK VETERAN WARRIOR operative only. The operative gains the MEDIC keyword until the start of the next battle and can perform the following action during the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Narthecium (1 AP):</strong>\nSelect one friendly SPACE MARINE operative visible to and within [TRI] of this operative.\nThat operative regains 2D3 lost Wounds. This operative cannot perform this action while within Engagement Range of an enemy operative.','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('HBR','SHV','','','PS',0,'3','Purity Seal','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n <strong>Purity Seal:</strong> Once per battle, when this operative is fighting in combat, making a shooting attack, or a shooting attack is being made against it, you can use the Command Re-Roll Tactical Ploy (see the Kill Team Core Book) without spending any CP.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('HBR','SHV','','','SOTA',0,'2','Standard Of The Ancients*','SPACE HULK VETERAN WARRIOR operative only. The operative gains the ICON BEARER keyword until the start of the next battle and gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Icon Bearer:</strong>\nWhen determining control of an objective marker, treat this operative\'s APL characteristic as being 1 higher. Note that this is not a modifier.\nIn narrative play, this is cumulative with the Focused Battle Honour.\n<br/>\n<strong>Standard Of The Ancients:</strong>\nOnce per Turning Point, one friendly SPACE MARINE operative within [PENT] of this operative can perform one free Shoot or Fight action during that SPACE MARINE operative\'s activation.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('HBR','SHV','','','SUS',0,'3','Suspensor System','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n <br/>\n <strong>Suspensor System:</strong> \n The Heavy Special Rule of ranged weapons the operative is equipped with is treated differently.\n Instead, an operative cannot move more than 3 [CIRCLE] in the same activation in which it performs a Shoot action with any of those ranged weapons. ','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('HBR','SHV','','','TH',0,'2','Teleport Homer','The operative can perform the following action during the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Plant Teleport Homer (1 AP):</strong>\nPlace a Teleport Homer token within [TRI] of this operative.\nThis operative cannot perform this action if it is within Engagement Range of an enemy operative.\nA friendly operative deploying via Teleport Strike can deploy directly onto the Teleport Homer token, even if it is within Engagement Range of an enemy operative.','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('HBR','WDR','WDR','','CB',1,'1','Combat Blade',' The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br/>\n <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n         <tr>\n                 <th>Name</th>\n                 <th>A</th>\n                 <th>WS</th>\n                 <th>D</th>\n         </tr>\n         <tr>\n                 <td>Combat blade</td>\n                 <td>3</td>\n                 <td>4+</td>\n                 <td>3/4</td>\n         </tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('HBR','WDR','WDR','','FG',2,'2','Frag Grenade',' The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br/>\n <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n         <tr>\n                 <th>Name</th>\n                 <th>A</th>\n                 <th>BS</th>\n                 <th>D</th>\n         </tr>\n         <tr>\n                 <td>Frag grenade</td>\n                 <td>4</td>\n                 <td>3+</td>\n                 <td>2/3</td>\n         </tr>\n         <tr>\n                 <th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n         </tr>\n         <tr>\n                 <td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect, Limited</td>\n         </tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('HBR','WDR','WDR','','IG',3,'3','Impact Grenade',' The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br/>\n <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n         <tr>\n                 <th>Name</th>\n                 <th>A</th>\n                 <th>BS</th>\n                 <th>D</th>\n         </tr>\n         <tr>\n                 <td>Impact grenade</td>\n                 <td>4</td>\n                 <td>3+</td>\n                 <td>4/5</td>\n         </tr>\n         <tr>\n                 <th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n         </tr>\n         <tr>\n                 <td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], AP1, Indirect, Limited</td>\n         </tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('HBR','WDR','WDR','','IP',7,'2','Infiltration Pod','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Infiltration Pod:</strong>\nDuring the mission sequence, in the Set Up Operatives step, you can set up this operative wholly within 2[CIRCLE] of your drop zone.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('HBR','WDR','WDR','','JP',5,'2','Jump Pack*','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Jump Pack:</strong>\nThis operative has the <strong>FLY</strong> keyword for the purposes of moving around, across, and over other operatives. However, each time this operative is climbing or dropping, treat the total vertical distance as [CIRCLE].','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('HBR','WDR','WDR','','S',6,'1','Stims','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Stims:</strong>\nOnce per battle, when this operative is activated, you can use this ability.\nIf you do so, until the end of the activation, you can ignore any or all modifiers to this operative\'s APL and Movement characteristics and this operative is not Injured.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('HBR','WDR','WDR','','SG',4,'3','Shield Generator*','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Energy Shield:</strong>\nOnce per Turning Point, when a shooting attack is made against this operative, you can use this ability. \nIf you do so, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, if this operative is not in Cover, before rolling your defence dice, you can retain one as a successful normal save without rolling it. If this operative is in Cover, the dice you can retain as a successful normal save as a result of Cover can be retained as a critical save instead.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('HBR','WDR','WDR','WDT','TR',8,'2','Tracing Rounds','WARPDIVER TROOPER operatives only.\r  The operative\'s ranged weapons gains the following critical hit rules for the battle:<br/>\r  <strong>Tracing Rounds:</strong>\r  Each time a friendly operative makes a shooting attack with this weapon against a target, in the Roll Attack Dice Step of that shooting attack, if you retain and critical hits, this weapon gains the No Cover special rule for that shooting attack.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','AES','AES','RVR','[AP]-AGG',1,'0','Aggressive','<em>Attack Pattern<br/></em>Melee weapons this operative is equipped with gain the Relentless special rule.','WepMod','weptype:M','SR:Relentless','','','Attack Pattern'),('IMP','AES','AES','RVR','[AP]-DEF',3,'0','Defensive','<em>Attack Pattern<br/></em>Improve this operative\'s Save characteristic by 1.','OpMod','SV','-1','','','Attack Pattern'),('IMP','AES','AES','RVR','[AP]-SWIFT',2,'0','Swift','<em>Attack Pattern<br/></em>Add [CIRCLE] to this operative\'s Movement characteristic.','OpMod','M','+[CIRCLE]','','','Attack Pattern'),('IMP','AES','','','BH-JE',205,'0','Judicious Efficiency','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>For the purposes of the Ruthless Efficiency ability, enemy operatives do not need to be within [PENT] of this operative.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','AES','','','BH-NL',204,'0','No Lenience','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>Each time this operative makes a shooting attack against an enemy operative that is not in Cover, ranged weapons it is equipped with have the Lethal 5+ special rule for that shooting attack.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','AES','','','BH-OBS',201,'0','Obstinate','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>Defence dice results of 5+ rolled for this operative that are successful saves are critical saves.','WepMod','weptype:R','BS:-1','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','AES','','','BH-PC',202,'0','Precinct Champion','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>Improve the Weapon Skill characteristic of melee weapons this operative is equipped with by 1 (to a maximum of 2+).','WepMod','weptype:M','BS:-1','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','AES','','','BH-PE',206,'0','Priority Endowment','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>In the Select Equipment Step, when selecting equipment from your stash, you can select one item of equipment to equip this operative with for one less equipment point (to a minimum of 0EP).','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','AES','','','BH-RD',203,'0','Rigid Determination','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>You can ignore any or all modifiers to this operative’s Movement characteristics and to the Ballistic Skill and Weapon Skill characteristics of weapons it is equipped with.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','AES','','','FG',104,'2','Frag Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr><th>Name</th><th>A</th><th>BS</th><th>D</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Frag Grenade</td><td>4</td><td>3+</td><td>2/3</td></tr>\n<tr><th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th><tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Blast [CIRCLE], Ind, Lim</td><tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','AES','','','KG',105,'3','Krak Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr><th>Name</th><th>A</th><th>BS</th><th>D</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Krak Grenade</td><td>4</td><td>3+</td><td>4/5</td></tr>\n<tr><th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th><tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], AP1, Ind, Lim</td><tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','AES','','','MAN',102,'2','Manacles','The operative can perform the following action during the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Arrest (1 AP):</strong>\nPerform a free Fight action with this operative against a valid target with a Wounds characteristic of 7 or less.\nAt the end of that combat, if neither operative has been incapacitated, the target is arrested until the end of the battle.\nWhile a friendly EXACTION SQUAD operative is within Engagement Range of no more than one arrested enemy operative and no other enemy operatives,\nthat arrested enemy operative cannot perform any actions other than Pass.\nOperatives that can perform this action cannot themselves be arrested.','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','AES','','','RE-CX19',406,'1','CX-19 Web agent','<em>Rare Equipment<br/></em>Select a webber the operative is equipped with. That weapon gains the Torrent [CIRCLE] special rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepname:webber','SR:Tor [CIRCLE]','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','AES','','','RE-ER',402,'1','Executioner Rounds','<em>Rare Equipment<br/></em>Operative equipped with a combat shotgun only.\nIn the Set Up Operatives step, select a type of ammunition for this operative to have loaded into its combat shotgun for the battle: cartridges or executioner rounds.\nIf it has loaded cartridges, it uses either profile of its combat shotgun as normal.\nIf it has loaded executioner rounds, it can only use the long range profile of its combat shotgun, but it gains the following benefits for the battle:\n<ul>\n<li>Its Damage characteristics are 3/4.</li>\n<li>It gains the No Cover special rule.</li>\n<li>Improve its Ballistic Skill characteristic by 1.</li>\n</ul>\n\nThe operative can perform the following action during the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Load Shtgun (1 AP):</strong>\nChange the type of ammunition loaded into the combat shotgun this operative is equipped with (see above).','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','AES','AES','PE','RE-FWGC',401,'2','Flak-Weave Greatcoat','<em>Rare Equipment<br/></em>PROCTOR-EXACTANT operative only. Each time this operative fights in combat or a shooting attack is made against it, subtract 1 from both Damage characteristics of weapons the enemy operative is equipped with for that combat or shooting attack.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','AES','','','RE-LBGB',404,'2','\"Last Breath\" Gas Bomb*','<em>Rare Equipment<br/></em>The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n <tr>\n <th>Name</th><th>A</th><th>WS</th><th>D</th>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n <td>\"Last Breath\" Gas Bomb</td><td>4</td><td>3+</td><td>1/3</td>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n <th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n <td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Blast [SQUARE], Indirect, Lethal 5+, Limited</td>\n </tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','AES','','','RE-RS',403,'2/3','Relic Silencer','<em>Rare Equipment<br/></em>Select a shotpistol or scoped shotpistol the operative is equipped with.\nThat weapon gains the Silent special rule for the battle. If you selected a scoped shotpistol, this equipment costs 3EP; otherwise, it costs 2EP.','WepMod','wepname:shotpistol','SR:Silent','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','AES','','','RE-VI',405,'3','Volition Inhibitor','<em>Rare Equipment<br/></em>The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Volition Inhibitor:</strong> While an enemy operative is within (square) of this operative, worsen the Ballistic Skill and Weapon Skill characteristics of weapons that enemy operative is equipped with by 1.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','AES','','','RMV',101,'1','Reinforced Mirror-Visor','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Reinforced Mirror-Visor:</strong>\nYou can ignore any or all modifiers to this operative\'s APL and it is not affected by the Stun critical hit rule.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','AES','','','SG',106,'3','Stun Grenade','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Stun Grenade:</strong>\nSelect one point in the killzone within [PENT] of this operative.\nRoll 1D6 for each operative within [CIRCLE] of that point, subtracting 1 from the result if that operative is not Visible To this operative.\nOn a 4+, sutract 1 from that operative\'s APL. This operative can only perform this action once, and cannot perform this action while within Engagement Range of an enemy operative.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','AES','','','SP',100,'1','Shotpistol','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr><th>Name</th><th>A</th><th>BS</th><th>D</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Shotpistol</td><td>4</td><td>4+</td><td>3/3</td></tr>\n<tr><th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th><tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT]</td><tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','AES','','','SPL',103,'1','Strobing Phosphor-Lumen','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Strobing Phosphor-Lumen:</strong>\nEach time an enemy operative Visible To and within [PENT] of this operative fights in combat or makes a shooting attack against a friendly EXACTION SQUAD operative within [CIRCLE] of this operative, \nin the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat or shooting attack, your opponent cannot re-roll their attack dice.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','AES24','','','MAN',1,'0','Manacles','Whenever an enemy operative would perform the Fall Back action while within control range of a friendly EXACTION SQUAD operative, if no other enemy operatives are within that friendly operative’s control range,\nyou can use this rule.\nIf you do, roll two D6, or one D6 if that enemy operative has a higher Wounds stat than that friendly operative.\nIf any result is a 4+, that enemy operative cannot perform that action during that activation or counteraction (no AP are spent on it).','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','AES24','','','RMV',4,'0','Reinforced Mirror-Visor','You can ignore any changes to the APL stats of friendly EXACTION SQUAD operatives, and they aren’t affected by enemy operatives’ Shock weapon rule.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','AES24','','','SIS',3,'0','Special-Issue Shells','Once per turning point, when a friendly EXACTION SQUAD operative is performing the Shoot action and you select a combat shotgun, executioner shotgun, scoped shotpistol or shotpistol, you can use this rule.\nIf you do, select one of the following weapon rules for that weapon to have until the end of that action:\n<ul>\n<li>Saturate.</li>\n<li>Piercing 1, but only if the target has a Save stat of 3+ or better.</li>\n<li>Torrent 1\", but you cannot select more than one secondary target.</li>\n</ul>','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','AES24','','','SPL',2,'0','Strobing Phosphor-Lumen','Whenever an enemy operative is shooting against, fighting against or retaliating against a friendly EXACTION SQUAD operative within 2\" of it, your opponent cannot re-roll their attack dice results of 1.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','AOD','','','AUS',4,'0','Auspex','Once per turning point, when a friendly ANGEL OF DEATH operative performs the Shoot action and you’re selecting a valid target, you can use this rule.\nIf you do, until the end of the activation (or counteraction), enemy operatives within 8\" of it cannot be obscured.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','AOD','','','CR',1,'0','Chapter Reliquaries','You can use the Wrath of Vengeance firefight ploy for 0CP if the specified friendly operative has an Engage order.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','AOD','','','CT-AGG',100,'0','[CT] Aggressive','<em>When selecting your kill team, select a primary and secondary CHAPTER TACTIC for friendly ANGEL OF DEATH operatives to gain for the battle. Multiple instances of the same CHAPTER TACTIC are not cumulative.</em><br/><br/>This operative’s melee weapons have the Rending weapon rule.<hr/><strong>Rending:</strong> If you retain any critical hits, retain 1 normal hit as a critical hit instead.','WepMod','weptype:M','SR:Rending','','','Chapter Tactic'),('IMP','AOD','','','CT-DUE',101,'0','[CT] Dueller','<em>When selecting your kill team, select a primary and secondary CHAPTER TACTIC for friendly ANGEL OF DEATH operatives to gain for the battle. Multiple instances of the same CHAPTER TACTIC are not cumulative.</em><br/><br/>Once per sequence, whenever this operative is fighting or retaliating:\n<ul>\n<li>One of your normal successes can block one unresolved critical success (unless the enemy operative’s weapon has the Brutal weapon rule).</li>\n<li>One of your critical successes can block two unresolved normal successes (instead of one critical success).</li>\n</ul>','Ability','','','','','Chapter Tactic'),('IMP','AOD','','','CT-HRD',102,'0','[CT] Hardy','<em>When selecting your kill team, select a primary and secondary CHAPTER TACTIC for friendly ANGEL OF DEATH operatives to gain for the battle. Multiple instances of the same CHAPTER TACTIC are not cumulative.</em><br/><br/>Whenever an operative is shooting this operative, defence dice results of 5+ are critical successes.','Ability','','','','','Chapter Tactic'),('IMP','AOD','','','CT-MOB',103,'0','[CT] Mobile','<em>When selecting your kill team, select a primary and secondary CHAPTER TACTIC for friendly ANGEL OF DEATH operatives to gain for the battle. Multiple instances of the same CHAPTER TACTIC are not cumulative.</em><br/><br/><ul>\n<li>This operative can perform the Fall Back action for 1 less AP.</li>\n<li>This operative can perform the Charge action while within control range of an enemy operative, and can leave that operative\'s control range to do so (but then normal requirements for that move apply).</li>\n</ul>','Ability','','','','','Chapter Tactic'),('IMP','AOD','','','CT-RES',104,'0','[CT] Resolute','<em>When selecting your kill team, select a primary and secondary CHAPTER TACTIC for friendly ANGEL OF DEATH operatives to gain for the battle. Multiple instances of the same CHAPTER TACTIC are not cumulative.</em><br/><br/>You can ignore any changes to this operative\'s APL stat.','Ability','','','','','Chapter Tactic'),('IMP','AOD','','','CT-SHRP',105,'0','[CT] Sharpshooter','<em>When selecting your kill team, select a primary and secondary CHAPTER TACTIC for friendly ANGEL OF DEATH operatives to gain for the battle. Multiple instances of the same CHAPTER TACTIC are not cumulative.</em><br/><br/>Whenever this operative is shooting during an activation in which it has not performed the Charge, Fall Back or Reposition action, its bolt weapons have the Severe weapon rule.<hr/><strong>Severe:</strong> If you do not retain any critical successes, you can change one of your normal successes to a critical success. Any rules that take effect as a result of retaining a critical success (e.g. Devastating, Piercing Crits, etc.) still do.','Ability','','','','','Chapter Tactic'),('IMP','AOD','','','CT-SS',106,'0','[CT] Siege Specialist','<em>When selecting your kill team, select a primary and secondary CHAPTER TACTIC for friendly ANGEL OF DEATH operatives to gain for the battle. Multiple instances of the same CHAPTER TACTIC are not cumulative.</em><br/><br/>This operative\'s ranged weapons have the Saturate weapon rule.<hr/><strong>Saturate:</strong> The defender cannot retain Cover saves.','WepMod','weptype:R','SR:Sat','','','Chapter Tactic'),('IMP','AOD','','','CT-ST',107,'0','[CT] Stealthy','<em>When selecting your kill team, select a primary and secondary CHAPTER TACTIC for friendly ANGEL OF DEATH operatives to gain for the battle. Multiple instances of the same CHAPTER TACTIC are not cumulative.</em><br/><br/>Whenever an operative is shooting this operative, if you can retain any cover saves, you can retain one additional cover save, or you can retain one cover save as a critical success.\nThis is not cumulative with improved cover saves from Vantage terrain.','Ability','','','','','Chapter Tactic'),('IMP','AOD','','','PS',1,'0','Purity Seals','Once per turning point, when a friendly ANGEL OF DEATH operative is shooting, fighting or retaliating, if you roll two or more fails, you can discard one of them to retain another as a normal success instead.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','AOD','','','TS',3,'0','Tilting Shields','Once per turning point, when a friendly ANGEL OF DEATH operative is fighting or retaliating, after your opponent rolls their attack dice, you can use this rule.\nIf you do, your opponent cannot retain attack dice results of less than 6 as critical successes during that sequence (e.g. as a result of the Lethal, Rending or Severe weapon rules).','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','DKK24','','','CB',2,'0','Comm-Beads','Whenever a friendly DEATH KORPS WATCHMASTER or friendly DEATH KORPS CONFIDANT operative issues a GUARDSMAN ORDER, you can use this rule.\nIf you do, instead of each friendly DEATH KORPS operative within 6\" of it receiving that order, you can select one friendly DEATH KORPS operative to receive that order.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','DKK24','','','CM',1,'0','Chronometer','Once per battle STRATEGIC GAMBIT in the first or second turning point.\nEach friendly DEATH KORPS operative wholly within your territory can immediately perform a free Dash action in an order of your choice, but each that does so must end that move closer to an opponent\'s drop zone or killzone edge.<br/>\nYou cannot use this STRATEGIC GAMBIT and the Regroup strategy ploy during the same turning point.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','DKK24','','','GB',4,'0','Gas Bombardment','Once per battle STRATEGIC GAMBIT. Place your Gas marker in the killzone; it cannot be placed underneath Vantage terrain.\nWhenever an operative is within 3\" of that marker, subtract 1 from its APL stat. In the Ready step of the next Strategy phase, remove that marker.\nNote that an operative\'s APL stat is only changed while it is within 3\" of that marker. If it moves more than 3\" from that marker, its APL stat is no longer changed by this rule.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','DKK24','','','HA',3,'0','Hand Axes','Friendly DEATH KORPS operatives have the following melee weapon:\n<table class=\"eqtable\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name</th><th>ATK</th><th>HIT</th><th>DMG</th><th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hand Axe</td><td>3</td><td>4+</td><td>3/4</td>\n</tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','ECC','','','FG',0,'2','Frag Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br />\n <table width=\"100%\" class=\"eqtable\">\n <tr>\n 	<th>Name</th>\n     <th>A</th>\n     <th>BS</th>\n     <th>D</th>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n 	<td>Frag Grenade</td>\n     <td>4</td>\n     <td>3+</td>\n     <td>2/3</td>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n 	<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n 	<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Lim, Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect</td>\n </tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','ECC','','','KG',0,'3','Krak Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br />\n<table width=\"100%\" class=\"eqtable\">\n<tr>\n	<th>Name</th>\n    <th>A</th>\n    <th>BS</th>\n    <th>D</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n	<td>Krak Grenade</td>\n    <td>4</td>\n    <td>3+</td>\n    <td>4/5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n	<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n	<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Lim, AP1, Indirect</td>\n</tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','ECC','','','POR',0,'2','Phial Of Restoration','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<ul><li><strong>Phial Of Restoration:</strong> Once per battle, when this operative is activated, it can use this ability. If it does so, it regains up to 2D3 lost wounds.</li></ul>','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','ECC','','','PS',0,'3','Purity Seal','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n <strong>Purity Seal:</strong> Once per battle, when this operative is fighting in combat, making a shooting attack, or a shooting attack is being made against it, you can use the Command Re-Roll Tactical Ploy (see the Kill Team Core Book) without spending any CP.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','ECC','','','RS',0,'2','Rosarius','LEADER operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<ul><li><strong>Rosarius:</strong> This operative has a 4+ Invulnerable Save</li></ul>','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','ECC','REP','REP','SB',0,'2','Scourging Barbs','SISTER REPENTIA operative only. \nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<ul><li><strong>Scourging Barbs:</strong> Each time this operative fights in combat, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat, you can re-roll one of your attack dice.\nIf the result of that re-roll is a 1 or 2, this operative suffers 1 Mortal Wound.\n</li></ul>','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','ESS','','','BH-CQC',202,'0','Close-Quarters Composure','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nEach time this operative makes a shooting attack against an enemy operative within [PENT] of it,\nranged weapons it is equipped with have the No Cover special rule for that shooting attack.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','ESS','','','BH-DISC',204,'0','Discretionary','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nOnce per battle, when this operative is activated, you can use the Daring Tactical Ploy without spending any Command Points','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','ESS','','','BH-LOY',201,'0','Loyal To House Vhane','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nEach time this operative fights in combat or makes a shootingattack, if it is within [PENT] of a friendly ELUCIA VHANE operative,\nin the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat or shooting attack, before rolling your attack dice, you can retain one as a successful normal hit without rolling it.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','ESS','','','BH-VC',203,'0','Voidmaster\'s Commendation','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nRanged weapons this operative is equipped with gain the Balanced special rule.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','ESS','','','BH-VOTF',205,'0','Veteran Of The Frontier','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nEach time a shooting attack is made against this operative,\nif this operative is within [PENT] of an enemy operative and more than [SQUARE] from all other friendly operatives,\nin the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, you can retain one successful normal save as a critical save instead.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','ESS','','','BH-WP',206,'0','Well Prepared','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nIn the Select Equipment step, when selecting equipment frrom your stash, you can select one item of equipment.\nEvery operative with this Battle Honour that can be equipped with that item can do so for one less equipment point each (to a minimum of OEP).','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','ESS','','','CA',1,'2','Carapace Armour','VOIDSMAN or VOIDMASTER operative only.\nImprove the operative\'s Save characteristic to 4+ for the battle.','OpMod','SV','4+','','','Equipment'),('IMP','ESS','','','CG',3,'2','Concussion Grenade','The operative can perform the following action during the battle:<br/><br/>\n<strong>Concussion Grenade (1 AP):</strong><br/>\nSelect one point on the killzone within [PENT] of this operative.\nRoll 1D6 for each operative within [CIRCLE] of that point, subtracting 1 from the result if that operative is not Visible To this operative.\nOn a 4+, sutract 1 from that operative\'s APL.\nThis operative can only perform this action once, and cannot perform this action while within Engagement Range of an enemy operative.','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','ESS','','','FG',4,'2','Frag Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n  <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n  	<tr>\n  		<th>Name</th>\n          <th>A</th>\n          <th>BS</th>\n          <th>D</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td>Frag Grenade</td>\n          <td>4</td>\n          <td>3+</td>\n          <td>2/3</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Blast [CIRCLE], Lim, Indirect</td>\n      </tr>\n  </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','ESS','','','FV',0,'1','Flash Visor','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/><br/>\n<strong>Flash Visor:</strong>\nYou can ignore any or all modifiers to this operative\'s APL and it is not affected by the Stun critical hit rule.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','ESS','','','HSCP',2,'2','Hot-Shot Capacitor Pack','Add 1 to both Damage characteristics of Lasguns and Laspistols this operative is equipped with for the battle.','WepMod','wepid:LG,LP','D:1/1','','','Equipment'),('IMP','ESS','','','KG',5,'3','Krak Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n  <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n  	<tr>\n  		<th>Name</th>\n          <th>A</th>\n          <th>BS</th>\n          <th>D</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td>Krak Grenade</td>\n          <td>4</td>\n          <td>3+</td>\n          <td>4/5</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], AP1, Lim, Indirect, No Overwatch</td>\n      </tr>\n  </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','ESS','','','RE-AG',401,'4','Archeotech Grenade*','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nThe operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle. It cannot make a shooting attack with this weapon by performing an Overwatch action.<br/>\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n  	<tbody><tr>\n  		<th>Name</th>\n          <th>A</th>\n          <th>BS</th>\n          <th>D</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td>Archeotech Grenade</td>\n          <td>4</td>\n          <td>3+</td>\n          <td>2/2</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Indirect, Lethal 4+, Lim, No Overwatch, MW3</td>\n      </tr>\n  </tbody></table>','Weapon','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','ESS','ESS','CAN','RE-AS',404,'2','Aggression Serum','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nCANID operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Aggression Serum:</strong>\nYou can ignore any or all modifiersto this operative\'s Movement characteristic.\nIn addition, the vicious bite this operative is equipped with gains the Relentless special rule for the battle.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','ESS','ESS','VM','RE-DS',402,'3','Decksweeper','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nVOIDSMAN operative only. Select a rotor cannon the operative is equipped with. That weapon gains the Relentless special rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepname:rotor','SR:Relentless','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','ESS','ESS','REJAD','RE-MSU',403,'2','Medicae Servo-Unit','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nREJUVENAT ADEPT operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Medicae Servo-Unit:</strong>\nFor the purposes of this operative\'s Healing Serum action, you can select one friendly ELUCIDIAN STARSTRIDER operative within [PENT] of this operative (instead of Visible To and within [TRI].','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','ESS','ESS','CAN','RE-RVGG',405,'4','Relic Voltagheist Generator','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nCANID operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Relic Voltagheist Generator:</strong>\nThis operative has a 3+ Invulnerable Save.','OpMod','S','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','ESS','','','RE-SU',406,'1','Support Uplink','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Support Uplink:</strong>\nEach time you make a shooting attack with a Privateer Support Asset,\nyou can determine Line of Sight from this operative (even if it isn\'t a NAVIS or ELUCIA VHANE operative).\nIf you do so, enemy operatives are not Obscured for that shooting attack.','Ability','S','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','ESS24','','','AUS',1,'0','Armoured Undersuit','Whenever an operative is shooting a friendly ELUCIDIAN STARSTRIDER operative that has a 5+ Save stat (excluding CANID), you can retain one of your defence dice results of 4 as a normal success.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','ESS24','','','HSCP',2,'0','Hot Shot Capacitor Pack','Up to twice per turning point, whenever a friendly ELUCIDIAN STARSTRIDER operative is performing the Shoot action and you select a laspistol or lasgun, you can use this rule.\nIf you do, until the end of the turning point, add 1 to both Dmg stats of that weapon and it has the Hot and Piercing Crits 1 weapon rules. Note that relic laspistols are excluded from this rule.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','ESS24','','','ICUL',3,'0','Improved Coordinates Uplink','Whenever a friendly ELUCIDIAN STARSTRIDER operative is using a PRIVATEER SUPPORT ASSET, if the target is within 6\" of a friendly ELUCIDIAN STARSTRIDER NAVIS operative, the target cannot be obscured and that weapon has the Saturate weapon rule.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','ESS24','','','RG',4,'0','Rapid Gunnery','Once per battle, when selecting a PRIVATEER SUPPORT ASSET, you can select one that has already been used during the battle. This takes precedence over the normal PRIVATEER SUPPORT ASSET rules.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','FW','','','CB',0,'2','Cense Bearer','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n <br/>\n <strong>Cense Bearer:</strong>\n Each time a friendly FORGE WORLD operative within [CIRCLE] of and visible to this operative is activated, if it is injured, do not subtract [CIRCLE] from its Movement characteristic for that activation.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','FW','','','DT',0,'4','Data-Tether','The operative can perform the following action during the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Data-Tether (1 AP):</strong><br/>\nYou gain 1 CP. This operative cannot perform this action while within Engagement Range of enemy operatives.','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','FW','','','EB',0,'2','Enhanced Bionics','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Enhanced Bionics:</strong>\nEach time a shooting attack is made against this operative, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, you can re-roll any or all of your defence dice results of 1','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','FW','','','OS',0,'2','Omni Spex','The operative can perform the following action during the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Omni Spex (1 AP)</strong><br/>\nSelect one friendly FORGE WORLD operative within [SQUARE] of and Visible to this operative, then select one enemy operative.\nUntil the end of the Turning Point, each time that friendly operative makes a shooting attack, for that shooting attack:\n<ul>\n<li>That enemy operative is not Obscured</li>\n<li>If that enemy operative is the target, that friendly operative\'s ranged weapons have the No Cover special rule</li>\n</ul>\nThis operative cannot perform a Shoot or Fight action in the same activation in which it performs this action.\nAn operative cannot perform this action while within Engagement Range of enemy operatives.','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','FW','','','SS',0,'2','Servo-Skull','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Servo-Skull:</strong>\nThis operative can perform mission actions for one less AP (to a minimum of 0 AP).','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','FW','','','UVF',0,'2','Uplinked Vid-Feed','RANGER or VANGUARD operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Uplinked Vid-Feed</strong>: \nEach time this operative perform an Overwatch action, for that action\'s shooting attack, do not worsen the Ballistic Skill characteristc of its ranged weapons as a result of performing an Overwatch action.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','GK','','','HW',0,'2','Hexagrammic Ward*','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br>\n<strong>Hexagrammic Ward:</strong> Once per battle, when an enemy operative that is Visible to this operative performs a psychic action, this operative can use this ability.\nIf it does so, roll 1D6: On a 3+, that action\'s psychic power is not resolved (the action points subtracted for that action are not refunded).','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','GK','','','PA',0,'3','Psybolt Ammnunition*','Select one Storm Bolter this operative is equipped with. Add 1 that that weapon\'s Damage characteristic for the battle.','WepMod','wepid:SB','D:1/1','','','Equipment'),('IMP','GK','','','POG',0,'2','Psyk-Out Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br/>\n <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n 	<tr>\n 		<th>Name</th>\n         <th>A</th>\n         <th>BS</th>\n         <th>D</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td>Psyk-Out Grenade</td>\n         <td>4</td>\n         <td>3+</td>\n         <td>1/1</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Lim, Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect, Psyk-Out*</td>\n     </tr>\n </table>\n * <strong>Psyk-Out:</strong> \n Each time a shooting attack is made with this weapon, if the target has the PSYKER or DAEMON keyword, for that shooting attack, change its Damage characteristic to 3/5 and it has the Lethal 5+ Special Rule.','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','GK','','','PS',0,'3','Purity Seal','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n <strong>Purity Seal:</strong> Once per battle, when this operative is fighting in combat, making a shooting attack, or a shooting attack is being made against it, you can use the Command Re-Roll Tactical Ploy (see the Kill Team Core Book) without spending any CP.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','GK','','','SB',0,'2','Sanctic Blessing','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br>\n<strong>Sanctic Blessing:</strong> Once per battle, during this operative\'s activation, it can perform a free Manifest Psychic Power action.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','GK','','','TSA',0,'3','Truesilver Armour*','This operative has a Save characteristic of 2+ for the battle.','OpMod','SV','2+','','','Equipment'),('IMP','HC','','','BH-AC',206,'0','Autonomic Cortex','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nOnce per battle, when this operative is activated, you can use the Command Override Tactical Ploy without spending any CPs.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','HC','','','BH-BC',203,'0','Blessed Components','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nYou can re-roll Recovery tests taken for this operative.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','HC','','','BH-CC',205,'0','Consecrated Bionics','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nAt the start of each Firefight Phase, roll 1D6 for this operative: On a 4+, this operative is not affected by the Deprecation effect of your active Imperative.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','HC','','','BH-EB',204,'0','Enhanced Bionics','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nEach time this operative would lose a wound, roll 1D6: on a 6, that wound is not lost.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','HC','','','BH-FITM',202,'0','Faith In The Machine','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nEach time this operative is activated, you can ignore any or all modifiers to its APL.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','HC','','','BH-FIX',201,'0','Fixated','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nThe first time you roll Attack Dice for this operative in each battle, if you do not roll any critical hits,\nyou can select one successful normal hit to be retained as a critical hit instead.\nThat retained hit cannot cause any further critical hits to be retained (e.g. as a result of the Rending critical hit rule).','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','HC','','','CB',0,'2','Cense Bearer','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\r <br/>\r <strong>Cense Bearer:</strong> \r Each time a friendly HUNTER CLADE operative within [SQUARE] of this operative is activated, you can ignore any or all modifiers to that friendly operative\'s Movement characteristic for that activation (excluding the modifier from the Bulwark Imperative).','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','HC','','','CU',0,'4','Command Uplink*','DIKTAT operative only. The operative can perfom the following action during the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Command Uplink (2 AP):</strong> \nAdd 1 CP to your pool. This operative cannot perform this action while within [PENT] of an enemy operative.','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','HC','','','ER',0,'2','Enriched Rounds','Select one Radium Carbine or Mastercrafted Radium Pistol the operative is equipped with. \nAdd 1 to that weapon\'s Normal Damage characteristic for the battle.','WepMod','wepid:RC,MCRP','D:1/0','','','Equipment'),('IMP','HC','','','MD',0,'2','Mechadendrites*','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Mechadendrites:</strong> \nOnce per Turning Point, during this operative\'s activation, it can perfom the Pick Up action for one less AP (to a minimum of 0 AP).','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','HC','','','OG',0,'1','Optimised Gait','RUSTSTALKER operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Optimised Gait:</strong> \nEach time this operative is activated, it can ignore the first distance of [CIRCLE] it travels for a climb, drop, or traverse during that activation.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','HC','','','RE-ADE',404,'3','Amplified Data Emitter','DIKTAT operative only. Each time the operative performs the Enhanced Data-Tether action, you can select any friendly HUNTER CLADE operative in the killzone (instead of one Visible To and within [PENT] of it).','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','HC','','','RE-AG',406,'3','Arc Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n\n  <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n   <tr>\n   <th>Name</th>\n           <th>A</th>\n           <th>BS</th>\n           <th>D</th>\n       </tr>\n       <tr>\n   <td>Arc Grenade</td>\n           <td>4</td>\n           <td>3+</td>\n           <td>3/4</td>\n       </tr>\n       <tr>\n   <th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n   </tr>\n       <tr>\n   <td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], AP1, Indirect, Limited, Stun</td>\n   </tr>\n   </table>','Weapon','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','HC','','','RE-ARA',403,'2','Auto-Repair Appendage','Each time the operative is activated, you can use the Motive Force Vitality Tactical Ploy without spending any CP.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','HC','','','RE-OSA',405,'3','Omnispectral Analyser','SURVEYOR operative only. For the battle, for the purposes of the operative\'s Omnispex action, add the following bullet point to the list of effects for the shooting attack specified for that action:\n<ul>\n<li>That friendly operative\'s ranged weapons have the Relentless special rule</li>\n</ul>','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','HC','','','RE-TDW',402,'3','Thermodermic Weave','Change the operative\'s Save characteristic to 3+ for the battle.','OpMod','SV','3+','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','HC','','','RE-TR',401,'2','Thorium Rounds','Select a Master-Crafter Radium Pistol the operative is equipped with. It gains the following improvements for the battle:\n<ul>\n<li>Lethal 5+ Special Rule</li>\n<li>Add 1 to its Normal Damage characteristic. This is not cumulative with the Enriched Rounds equipment</li>\n</ul>','WepMod','wepid:','SR:Lethal 5+|D:0/1','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','HC','','','RF',0,'3','Refractor Field*','LEADER operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Refractor Field:</strong> \nThis operative has a 4+ Invulnerable Save.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','HC','','','SS',0,'2','Servo-Skull*','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Servo-Skull:</strong> \nOnce per Turning Point, during this operative\'s activation, it can perfom a mission action for one less AP (to a minimum of 0 AP).','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','HC','','','ULVF',0,'1','Uplinked Vid-Feed','RANGER or VANGUARD operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Uplinked Vid-Feed:</strong> \nEach time this operative performs an Overwatch action, for that action\'s shooting attack, do not worsen the Ballistic Skill characteristic of its ranged weapons as a result of performing an Overwatch action.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','HC24','','','EML',4,'0','Extremis Mind-Link','Once per battle, you can use the Control Edict firefight ploy for 0CP, but instead of activating the selected friendly operatives in succession, activate them at the same time.\nComplete their activations action by action in any order.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','HC24','','','RB',1,'0','Rad Bombardment','Once per battle STRATEGIC GAMBIT in any turning point after the first. Select one objective marker or your opponent’s drop zone.\nRoll one D6 separately for each enemy operative within control range of that selected objective marker or within that drop zone, and subtract 1 if any part of that enemy operative\'s base is underneath Vantage terrain:<br/>\non a 4+, subtract 1 from that operative\'s APL stat until the end of its next activation;<br/>\non a 6, also inflict D3 damage on it (roll separately for each).','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','HC24','','','RF',3,'0','Refractor Field','Once per turning point, when an operative is shooting a friendly HUNTER CLADE operative, at the start of the Roll Defence Dice step, you can use this rule.\nIf you do, worsen the x of the Piercing weapon rule by 1 (if any) until the end of that sequence. Note that Piercing 1 would therefore be ignored.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','HC24','','','RS',2,'0','Redundancy Systems','Once per turning point, when a friendly HUNTER CLADE operative is activated, if it’s not within control range of enemy operatives, you can use this rule.\nIf you do, that friendly operative regains up to D3+2 lost wounds.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','IG','GM','','CA',0,'3','Carapace Armour','GUARDSMAN operative only.\nThe operative has a 4+ Save characteristic for the battle.','OpMod','SV','4+','','','Equipment'),('IMP','IG','','','FG',0,'2','Frag Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br />\n <table width=\"100%\" class=\"eqtable\">\n <tr>\n 	<th>Name</th>\n     <th>A</th>\n     <th>BS</th>\n     <th>D</th>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n 	<td>Frag Grenade</td>\n     <td>4</td>\n     <td>3+</td>\n     <td>2/3</td>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n 	<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n 	<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Lim, Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect</td>\n </tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','IG','','','KG',0,'3','Krak Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br />\n<table width=\"100%\" class=\"eqtable\">\n<tr>\n	<th>Name</th>\n    <th>A</th>\n    <th>BS</th>\n    <th>D</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n	<td>Krak Grenade</td>\n    <td>4</td>\n    <td>3+</td>\n    <td>4/5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n	<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n	<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Lim, AP1, Indirect</td>\n</tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','IG','','','MK',0,'2','MediKit','The operative gains the MEDIC keyword until the start of the next battle and can perform the following action during the battle:\n <br/>\n <strong>MediKit (1 AP):</strong>\n Select one friendly IMPERIAL GUARD operative within [TRI] of and Visible to this operative.\n That operative regains 2D3 lost wounds.\n This operative cannot perform this action while within Engagement Range of enemy operatives','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','IG','','','RS',0,'3','Regimental Standard','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Regimental Standard:</strong>\nWhen determining control of an objective marker, treat this operative\'s APL as being 1 higher.\nNote that this is not a modifier. In narrative play, this is cumulative with the Focused Battle Honour (see the Kill Team Core Book).avg\n<br/><br/>\nThe operative can perform the following action during the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Plant The Standard (1 AP):</strong>\nUntil the end of the Turning Point, while this operative is Visible to and within [SQUARE] of a friendly IMPERIAL GUARD operative with the same <REGIMENT> or <TEMPESTUS REGIMENT> keyword as this operative, that friendly operative is inspired by the Regimental Standard.\nWhile an operative is inspired by the Regimental Standard, each time a shooting attack is made against it, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, you can re-roll one of your defence dice.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','IG','TS','','SB',0,'1','Scion Blade','TEMPESTUS SCION operative only.\nThe operative is equipped with the following melee weapon for the battle:\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n	<tr>\n		<th>Name</th>\n        <th>A</th>\n        <th>WS</th>\n        <th>D</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n		<td>Scion Blade</td>\n        <td>3</td>\n        <td>3+</td>\n        <td>3/4</td>\n    </tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','INB','','','BH-ASS',202,'0','Assured','<em>Battle Honour</em><br/>\nEach time a shooting attack is made against this operative, if this operative is within range of an objective marker or one of your Tac Ops tokens,\nor is carrying an objective marker or one of your Tac Ops tokens,\nin the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, before rolling your Defence Dice, you can retain one a successful normal save without rolling it.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','INB','','','BH-BR',204,'0','Bruiser','<em>Battle Honour</em><br/>\nEach time this operative fights in combat, if it is the active operative, its melee weapons have the Brutal special rule for that combat.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','INB','','','BH-DH',203,'0','Deckhand','<em>Battle Honour</em><br/>\nEach time this operative performs the Operate Hatch action, roll 1D6: on a 3+, the action point subtracted for that action is refunded.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','INB','','','BH-GALL',206,'0','Gallant','<em>Battle Honour</em><br/>\nEach time this operative fights in combat or makes a shooting attack, if it is within [PENT] of your opponent\'s drop zone or killzone edge, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat or shooting attack, you can re-roll one of your Attack dice.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','INB','','','BH-GUT',201,'0','Gutsy','<em>Battle Honour</em><br/>\nThis operative always treats the Close Assault Strategic Ploy as having been used.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','INB','','','BH-SCR',205,'0','Scrapper','<em>Battle Honour</em><br/>\nImprove the Weapon Skill characteristic of melee weapons this operative is equipped with by 1 (to a maximum of 2+).','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','INB','','','FG',0,'2','Frag Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n   <tr>\n   <th>Name</th>\n           <th>A</th>\n           <th>BS</th>\n           <th>D</th>\n       </tr>\n       <tr>\n   <td>Frag Grenade</td>\n           <td>4</td>\n           <td>3+</td>\n           <td>2/3</td>\n       </tr>\n       <tr>\n   <th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n   </tr>\n       <tr>\n   <td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect, Limited</td>\n   </tr>\n   </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','INB','','','KG',0,'3','Krak Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n   	<tr>\n   		<th>Name</th>\n           <th>A</th>\n           <th>BS</th>\n           <th>D</th>\n       </tr>\n       <tr>\n   		<td>Krak Grenade</td>\n           <td>4</td>\n           <td>3+</td>\n           <td>4/5</td>\n       </tr>\n       <tr>\n   		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n   	</tr>\n       <tr>\n   		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Lim, AP1, Indirect, No Overwatch</td>\n   	</tr>\n   </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','INB','','','RB',0,'1','Rebreather','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Rebreather:</strong>\nYou can ignore any or all modifiers to this operative\'s APL and it is not affected by the Stun critical hit rule.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','INB','','','RE-AMU',406,'3','Auto-Medicae Unit','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nAfter the battle, in the Update Dataslates step, if this operative was not incapacitated during the battle, you can re-roll one Casualty test.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','INB','','','RE-AUS',405,'3','Auspicator','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Auspicator:</strong>\nOnce per Turning Point, during this operative\'s activation, it can perform a mission action for one less Action point (to a minimum of 0 AP).','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','INB','','','RE-EEC',403,'2','Enhanced Energy Cell','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nNAVIS GUNNER operative only. Select a Navis Las-Volley the operative is equipped with. That weapon gains the Rending special rule for the battle.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','INB','','','RE-NC',402,'2','Navis Cuirass','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nNAVIS SERGEANT-AT-ARMS operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Navis Cuirass:</strong>\nEach time an enemy operative fights in combat or makes a shooting attack against this operative, subtract 1 from both Damage Characteristics of weapons that operative is equipped with for that combat or shooting attack (to a minimum of 2).\nThis is not cumulative with the Brace For Counter-Attack Strategic Ploy.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','INB','','','RE-RAD',404,'2','Remote Access Device','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Remote Access Device:</strong>\nThis operative can perform the Operate Hatch action while within [PENT] of a Hatchway\'s access point (instead of [TRI]),\nand can do so even if that Hatchway is open and an enemy operative is within [TRI] of its access point.\nAn operative cannot use this ability and the Deckhand Battle Honour and/or Hatchcutter ability at the same time.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','INB','','','RE-RC',401,'1','Relic Cutlass','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nNAVIS SERGEANT-AT-ARMS operative only. Select a Power Weapon the operative is equipped with. That weapon gains the Balanced special rule for the battle.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','INB','','','SG',0,'2','Stun Grenade','The operative can perform the following action during the battle:<br/>\r <strong>Stun Grenade (1 AP):</strong>\r Select one point on the killzone within [PENT] of this operative.\r Roll 1D6 for each operative within [CIRCLE] of that point, subtracting 1 from the result if that operative is not Visible To this operative.\r On a 4+, subtract 1 from that operative\'s APL.\r This operative can only perform this action once, and cannot perform this action while within Engagement Range of an enemy operative.','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','INB','','','SLUGS',0,'1','Slugs','Operative equipped with a Navis Shotgun only.\nIn the Set Up operatives step, select a type of ammunition for this operative to have loaded into its Navis Shotgun for the battle: cartridges or slugs.\nIf it has loaded cartridges, it uses either profile of its Navis Shotgun as normal.\nIf it has loaded slugs, it can only use the Long Range profile of its Navis Shotgun, but add 1 to both Damage Characteristics of that profile and improve its BS characteristic by 1 for that operative.<br/><br/>\nThe operative can perform the following action during the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Load Shotgun (1 AP):</strong>\nChange the type of ammunition loaded into the Navis Shotgun this operative is equipped with.','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','INB','','','SOD',0,'2','System Override Device*','The ooperative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>System Override Device:</strong>\nIn the Scouting step, after resolving your selection, you can open one Hatchway.\nIf both players have this or a similar ability, the Defender resolves this ability first.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','INB','','','ST',0,'1','Stimm','Add 1 to this operative\'s Wounds characteristic for the battle.','OpMod','W','+1','','','Equipment'),('IMP','INB24','','','CS',3,'0','Combat Stimms','You can ignore any changes to the Move stat of friendly IMPERIAL NAVY BREACHER operatives from being injured.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','INB24','','','RB',1,'0','Rebreathers','You can ignore any changes to the APL stats of friendly IMPERIAL NAVY BREACHER operatives, and they aren’t affected by enemy operatives’ Shock weapon rule.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','INB24','','','SL',2,'0','Slugs','Up to three times per turning point, whenever a friendly IMPERIAL NAVY BREACHER operative is performing the Shoot action and you select a navis shotgun (long range), you can use this rule.\nIf you do, until the end of that action, improve the Hit stat of that weapon by 1 and add 1 to both of its Dmg stats.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','INB24','','','SORD',4,'0','System Override Device','Once per turning point, one friendly IMPERIAL NAVY BREACHER operative can perform the Operate Hatch action for 1 less AP.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','INQ','','','ABS',0,'2','Armoured Bodysuit','INQUISITION operative with a 5+ characteristic only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Armoured Bodysuit:</strong>\nEach time a shooting attack is made against this operative, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, you can retain one of your Defence Dice results of 4 as a successfull normal save.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','INQ','','','BH-FR',204,'0','Firm Resolve','You can ignore any or all modifiers to this operative\'s APL and Movement characteristics, and it is not affected by the Stun critical hit rule.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','INQ','','','BH-HC',206,'0','Highly Capable','Once per battle, when this operative fights in combat, makes a shooting attack, or a shooting attack is made against it, you can use the Command Re-Roll Tactical Ploy without spending any CP.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','INQ','','','BH-INSP',203,'0','Inspector','When determining Line Of Sight for this operative (including each time it makes a shooting attack), enemy operatives must be more than [SQUARE] from it to be in Cover (instead of [CIRCLE]).','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','INQ','','','BH-PRO',202,'0','Proficient','Select one Battle Honour for this operative from a specialism you haven\'t selected for it to progress in.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','INQ','','','BH-RP',205,'0','Ruthless Persecutor','Each time this operative makes a shooting attack against an enemy operative that is not in Cover, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that shooting attack, before rolling your Attack dice, you can retain one as a successful normal hit without rolling it.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','INQ','','','BH-WS',201,'0','Weapon Specialist','Select one of this operative\'s weapons. Improve the Ballistic or Weapon Skill characteristic of that weapon and all its profiles by 1 (to a maximum of 3+).','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','INQ','INQ','INT','CT-INT-DEN',100,'0','Denunciation','<em>Consecrated Tome</em><br/>\nEach time a friendly INQUISITORIAL AGENT operative fights in combat with or makes a shooting attack against an enemy operative within [CIRCLE] of this operative,\nadd 1 to the Attacks characteristic of that friendly operative\'s weapon for that combat or shooting attack.','Ability','','','','','Consecrated Tome'),('IMP','INQ','INQ','INT','CT-INT-SANCT',101,'0','Sanctification','<em>Consecrated Tome</em><br/>\nEach time an enemy operative fights in combat with or makes a shooting attack against a friendly INQUISITORIAL AGENT operative within [CIRCLE] of this operative, subtract 1 from the Attacks characteristic of that enemy operative\'s weapon for that combat or shooting attack.','Ability','','','','','Consecrated Tome'),('IMP','INQ','INQ','TS','CT-TS-DEN',100,'0','Denunciation','<em>Consecrated Tome</em><br/>\nEach time a friendly INQUISITORIAL AGENT operative fights in combat with or makes a shooting attack against an enemy operative within [CIRCLE] of this operative,\nadd 1 to the Attacks characteristic of that friendly operative\'s weapon for that combat or shooting attack.','Ability','','','','','Consecrated Tome'),('IMP','INQ','INQ','TS','CT-TS-SANCT',100,'0','Sanctification','<em>Consecrated Tome</em><br/>\n Each time an enemy operative fights in combat with or makes a shooting attack against a friendly INQUISITORIAL AGENT operative within [CIRCLE] of this operative, subtract 1 from the Attacks characteristic of that enemy operative\'s weapon for that combat or shooting attack.','Ability','','','','','Consecrated Tome'),('IMP','INQ','','','FG',5,'2','Frag Grenade*','Not available for an AUTOSAVANT operative.\nThe operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n <tr>\n <th>Name</th><th>A</th><th>BS</th><th>D</th>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n <td>Frag Grenade</td><td>4</td><td>3+</td><td>2/3</td>\n </tr>\n <tr><th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th></tr>\n <tr><td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect, Lim, No Overwatch</td></tr>\n </table>\n','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','INQ','','','KG',6,'3','Krak Grenade*','Not available for an AUTOSAVANT operative.\nThe operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n <tr>\n <th>Name</th><th>A</th><th>BS</th><th>D</th>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n <td>Krak Grenade</td><td>4</td><td>3+</td><td>4/5</td>\n </tr>\n <tr><th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th></tr>\n <tr><td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], AP1, Indirect, Lim, No Overwatch</td></tr>\n </table>\n','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','INQ','','','MCAP',3,'2','Master-Crafter AutoPistol','INQUISITION operative only. Select one AutoPistol or Extended Stock AutoPistol the operative is equipped with (note that you cannot select a Suppressed Autpistol).\nAdd 1 to both Damage characteristics of that weapon for the battle.','WepMod','wepid:AP,ESAP','D:1/1','','','Equipment'),('IMP','INQ','','','PK',4,'3','Power Knife','INQUISITION operative only (excluding AUTOSAVANT and MYSTIC).\nThe operative is equipped with the following melee weapon for the battle:\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n <tr>\n <th>Name</th><th>A</th><th>BS</th><th>D</th>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n <td>Power Knife</td><td>3</td><td>4+</td><td>3/5</td>\n </tr>\n <tr><th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th></tr>\n <tr><td colspan=\"4\">Lethal 5+</td></tr>\n </table>\n','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','INQ','','','RE-DL',403,'3','Digital Laser','INQUISITION operative only. The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n  	<tr>\n  		<th>Name</th>\n          <th>A</th>\n          <th>BS</th>\n          <th>D</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td>Digital Laser</td>\n          <td>4</td>\n          <td>3+</td>\n          <td>0/0</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [SQUARE], Lethal 3+, Lim, MW2</td>\n      </tr>\n  </table>','Weapon','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','INQ','','','RE-IFS',404,'3','Infrascope','Select one of the operative\'s ranged weapons. That weapon gains the No Cover special rule for the battle.\nIn addition, each time the operative makes a shooting attack with that weapon during the battle, enemy operatives are not Obscured for that shooting attack.','WepMod','weptype:R','SR:No Cover','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','INQ','','','RE-PR',402,'2','Prometheum Rounds','Select one AutoPistol or Extended Stock AutoPistol the operative is equipped with (note that you cannot select a Suppressed AutoPistol). That weapon gains the Splash 1 Critical Hit rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepid:AP,ESAP','SR:Splash 1','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','INQ','','','RE-SF',406,'2','Shroudfield','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Shroudfield:</strong> While this operative has a Conceal order, it is always treated as having a Conceal order, regardless of any other rules (e.g. Vantage Point).','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','INQ','','','RE-TG',401,'3','Tangle Grenade','Not available for an AUTOSAVANT operative.\nThe operative can perform the following action during the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Tangle Grenade (1 AP):</strong>\nSelect one enemy operative Visible to and within [PENT] of this operative, then roll 1D6, adding 1 to the result if that enemy operative is in this operative\'s Line Of Sight.\nOn a 3+, that enemy operative is Tangled until it performs the Pass action or the battle ends (whichever comes first). \nA Tangled operative cannot perform any actions other than Pass','Action','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','INQ','','','RE-TSW',405,'2','Truesilver Weave','INQUISITION operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Truesilver Weave:</strong> Each time an enemy operative fights in combat with or makes a shooting attack against this operative,\nsubtract 1 from both Damage characteristics of that enemy operative\'s weapons for that combat or shooting attack (to a minimum of 2).','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','INQ','','','RF',1,'3','Refractor Field*','INQUISITION operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/><strong>Refractor Field:</strong>This operative has a 4+ Invulnerable Save for the battle','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','INQ','','','SG',7,'2','Stun Grenade','Not available for an AUTOSAVANT operative.\nThe operative can perform the fllowing action during the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Stun Grenade (1 AP):</strong>\nSelect one point in the killzone within [PENT] of this operative. Roll 1D6 for each operative within [CIRCLE] of that point, subtracting 1 frrom the result if that operative is not Visible to this operative.\nOn a 4+, sutract 1 from that operative\'s APL. This operative can only perform this action once, and cannot perform this action while within Engagement Range of an enemy operative.\n','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','INQ','','','SMK',8,'3','Smoke Grenade','Not available for an AUTOSAVANT operative.\nThe operative can perform the fllowing action during the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Smoke Grenade (1 AP):</strong>\nPlace the center of one Smoke token on a point within [PENT] of this operative.\nThat token creates an area of smoke with a [CIRCLE] radius and unlimited height (but not below).\nUntil the end of the Turning Point, an operative is Obscured if every Cover line drawn to it crosses an area of smoke.\nThis operative can only perform this action once, and cannot perform this action while within Engagement Range of an enemy operative.','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','INQ','','','SS',2,'2','Servo-Skull*','INQUISITION operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Servo-Skull:</strong>\nOnce per Turning Point, during this operative\'s activation, it can perform a mission action for one less AP (to a minimum of 0 AP).','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','INQ24','','','AB',2,'0','Armoured Bodysuits','Whenever an operative is shooting a friendly INQUISITORIAL AGENT operative that has a 5+ Save stat, you can retain one of your defence dice results of 4 as a normal success.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','INQ24','','','CD',3,'0','Combat Daggers','Friendly INQUISITORIAL AGENT operatives have the following melee weapon. Whenever a friendly SISTER OF SILENCE operative is using it, add 1 to its Atk stat.\n<table class=\"eqtable\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name</th><th>Atk</th><th>Hit</th><th>Dmg</th><th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Combat Dagger</td><td>3</td><td>4+</td><td>3/4</td>\n</tr>\n</table>','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','INQ24','','','IR',1,'0','Inquisitorial Rosette','Once per battle, when a friendly INQUISITORIAL AGENT operative is activated, if you’ve used the Quarry strategy ploy during this turning point, you can use this rule.\nIf you do, you can select a new enemy operative to be your quarry until the end of the turning point.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','INQ24','','','SS',4,'0','Servo-Skull','Once per turning point, one friendly INQUISITORIAL AGENT operative can perform a mission action for 1 less AP.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','INTS','','','AU',5,'2','Auspex*','The operative can perform the following action during the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Auspex Scan (1 AP):</strong><br/>\nSelect one enemy operative Visible to or within [PENT] of this\noperative. Until the end of the Turning Point:\n<ul>\n<li>That enemy operative is not Obscured.</li>\n<li>Defence dice cannot be automatically retained as a result of Cover for that enemy operative.</li>\n</ul>\nThis operative cannot perform this action while within\nEngagement Range of an enemy operative.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','INTS','','','BH-BH',202,'0','Bladesman\'s Honour','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>Select one of this operative’s melee weapons. Improve the Weapon Skill characteristic of that weapon by 1 (to a maximum of 2+).','WepMod','weptype:M','BS:-1','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','INTS','','','BH-CE',203,'0','Chapter Exemplar','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>This operative gains an additional Chapter Tactics ability (pg 3). This must be an ability from the category of one of its existing Chapter Tactics abilities.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','INTS','','','BH-HBTA',206,'0','Honoured by the Armoury','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>In the Select Equipment step, when selecting equipment from your stash, you can select one item of equipment to equip this operative with for one less equipment point (to a minimum of 0EP).','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','INTS','','','BH-MH',201,'0','Marksman\'s Honour','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>Select one of this operative’s ranged weapons. Improve the Ballistic Skill characteristic of that weapon by 1 (to a maximum of 2+).','WepMod','weptype:R','BS:-1','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','INTS','','','BH-SP',205,'0','Specialised','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>Select one Battle Honour for this operative from the Combat, Staunch, Marksman or Scout specialisms. Note that you can select a Battle Honour from that specialism even if the operative couldn’t normally progress in it.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','INTS','','','BH-SR',204,'0','Spiritual Resolve','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>You can re-roll Recovery tests taken for this operative. In addition, each time this operative gains a Battle Scar, you can roll an extra D6 and select which result to use.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','INTS','','','CB',6,'1','Combat Blade','The operative is equipped with the following melee weapon for the battle:<br/>\n <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n 	<tr>\n 		<th>Name</th>\n         <th>A</th>\n         <th>WS</th>\n         <th>D</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td>Combat Blade</td>\n 		<td>4</td>\n         <td>3+</td>\n         <td>3/5</td>\n     </tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','INTS','','','CT-DI-ACC',110,'0','[CT-DI] Accurate','<b>Chapter Tactic - Discipline Of Iron</b><br/>\nEach time this operative makes a shooting attack\nwith a bolt weapon, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that\nshooting attack, if you retain any critical hits, that weapon\ngains the No Cover special rule for that shooting attack.','Ability','','','','','Chapter Tactic'),('IMP','INTS','','','CT-DI-DSS',112,'0','[CT-DI] Deadly Sharpshooter','<b>Chapter Tactic - Discipline Of Iron</b><br/>\nFor the bolt weapon this operative is\nequipped with:\n<ul>\n<li>Subtract 1 from its Critical Damage characteristic.</li>\n<li>It gains the MW1 critical hit rule.</li>\n</ul>','WepMod','wepname:bolt','SR:MW1|D:0/-1','','','Chapter Tactic'),('IMP','INTS','','','CT-DI-MTH',111,'0','[CT-DI] Methodical','<b>Chapter Tactic - Discipline Of Iron</b><br/> Do not worsen the Ballistic Skill characteristic of this operative\'s ranged weapons as a result of performing the Overwatch action.','Ability','','','','','Chapter Tactic'),('IMP','INTS','','','CT-GR-DUR',108,'0','[CT-GR] Durable','<b>Chapter Tactic - Gene-Wrought Resilience</b><br/>\nEach time this operative fights in combat or a shooting attack is made against it,\nin the Resolve Successful Hits step of that combat or shooting attack, \none critical hit inflicts one less damage on this operative (to a minimum of 3).','Ability','','','','','Chapter Tactic'),('IMP','INTS','','','CT-GR-HAR',109,'0','[CT-GR] Hardy','<b>Chapter Tactic - Gene-Wrought Resilience</b><br/>\nEach time a shooting attack is made against this operative, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, retained defence dice results of 5+ are critical saves (instead of just 6).','Ability','','','','','Chapter Tactic'),('IMP','INTS','','','CT-GR-UY',107,'0','[CT-GR] Unyielding','<b>Chapter Tactic - Gene-Wrought Resilience</b><br/>\nAdd 1 to this operative’s Wounds characteristic.','OpMod','W','+1','','','Chapter Tactic'),('IMP','INTS','','','CT-MZ-AG',101,'0','[CT-MZ] Aggressive','<b>Chapter Tactic - Martial Zealotry</b><br/>\nEach time this operative fights in combat in an activation in which it performed a Charge action, its melee weapons gain the Rending critical hit rule for that combat.','Ability','','','','','Chapter Tactic'),('IMP','INTS','','','CT-MZ-D',102,'0','[CT-MZ] Dueller','<b>Chapter Tactic - Martial Zealotry</b><br/>\nEach time this operative fights in combat, in the Resolve Successful Hits step of that combat, each time it parries with a critical hit, you can select an additional normal hit of your opponent’s to be discarded.','Ability','','','','','Chapter Tactic'),('IMP','INTS','','','CT-MZ-RAP',103,'0','[CT-MZ] Rapid','<b>Chapter Tactic - Martial Zealotry</b><br/>\r While this operative is performing a Normal Move action, add [TRI] to this operative’s Movement characteristic.','OpMod','M','+[TRI]','','','Chapter Tactic'),('IMP','INTS','','','CT-TE-MOB',106,'0','[CT-TE] Mobile','<b>Chapter Tactic - Tactical Evasion</b><br/>\nThis operative can perform the Fall Back action for\none less action point (to a minimum of 1AP).','Ability','','','','','Chapter Tactic'),('IMP','INTS','','','CT-TE-RAP',104,'0','[CT-TE] Raider','<b>Chapter Tactic - Tactical Evasion</b><br/>\nThis operative can perform the Charge action while\nwithin Engagement Range of an enemy operative. In addition,\neach time this operative performs a Normal Move action, it\ncan move within Engagement Range of an enemy operative\n(but cannot finish its move there).','Ability','','','','','Chapter Tactic'),('IMP','INTS','','','CT-TE-ST',105,'0','[CT-TE] Stealthy','<b>Chapter Tactic - Tactical Evasion</b><br/>\n Each time a shooting attack is made against this\n operative, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting\n attack, before rolling your defence dice, if it is in Cover and\n more than [PENT] from the active operative, you can do one of\n the following:\n <ul>\n <li>Retain one additional dice as a successful normal save as a result of Cover.</li>\n <li>Retain one dice as a successful critical save instead of a normal save as a result of Cover.</li>\n </ul>','Ability','','','','','Chapter Tactic'),('IMP','INTS','','','FG',7,'2','Frag Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br/>\n  <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n  	<tr>\n  		<th>Name</th>\n          <th>A</th>\n          <th>WS</th>\n          <th>D</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td>Frag Grenade</td>\n  		<td>4</td>\n          <td>3+</td>\n          <td>2/3</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td colspan=\"4\">\n  			Rng [PENT], Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect, Lim\n	    </td>\n      </tr>\n  </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','INTS','','','KG',8,'3','Krak Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br/>\n  <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n  	<tr>\n  		<th>Name</th>\n          <th>A</th>\n          <th>WS</th>\n          <th>D</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td>Krak Grenade</td>\n  		<td>4</td>\n          <td>3+</td>\n          <td>4/5</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td colspan=\"4\">\n  			Rng [PENT], AP1, Indirect, Lim, No Overwatch\n          </td>\n      </tr>\n  </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','INTS','','','PS',4,'3','Purity Seal','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Purity Seal:</strong><br/>\nOnce per battle, when this operative is fighting\nin combat, making a shooting attack or a shooting attack\nis being made against it, you can use the Command Re-roll\nTactical Ploy (see the Kill Team Core Book) without spending\nany Command points.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','INTS','','','RBB',2,'3','Reclusiam-Blessed Bolts*','Select a Bolt weapon the operative is equipped with. Add 1 to both Damage characteristics of that weapon for the battle.','WepMod','wepname:bolt','D:1/1','','','Equipment'),('IMP','INTS','','','RE-AA',405,'3','Artificer Armour','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>Change the operative’s Save characteristic to 2+ for the battle.','OpMod','SV','2+','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','INTS','','','RE-AM',402,'2','Adamantine Mantle','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Adamantine Mantle:</strong>\nOnce per Turning Point, when Critical\nDamage would be inflicted upon this operative, you can\nuse this ability. If you do so, that attack dice inflicts Normal\nDamage instead.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','INTS','','','RE-BFG',401,'3','Bastion Field Generator','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Bastion Field Generator:</strong>\nThis operative has a 4+ invulnerable save','OpMod','SV','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','INTS','','','RE-CA',406,'1','Chapter Artefact','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Chapter Artefact:</strong>\nWhen determining control of an objective\nmarker, treat this operative’s APL characteristic as being 1\nhigher. Note that this is not a modifier. In narrative play, this is\ncumulative with the Focused Battle Honour.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','INTS','','','RE-SC',404,'3','Servo-Cherub','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Servo-Cherub:</strong>\nOnce per Turning Point, during this operative’s\nactivation, it can perform a mission action or the Pick Up\naction for one less action point (to a minimum of 0AP).','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','INTS','','','RE-TO',403,'2','Targeting Ocular','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Targeting Ocular:</strong>\nEach time this operative makes a shooting\nattack, in the Select Valid Target step of that shooting attack,\nenemy operatives are not Obscured.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','INTS','','','TS',3,'3','Tilting Shield','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Tilting Shield:</strong><br/>\nEach time this operative fights in combat, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat, your opponent cannot retain attack dice results of less than 6 as critical hits (e.g. as a result of the Lethal X or Rending rules)','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','INTS','','','VCS',1,'3','Vengeance-Class Scope','Select a bolt rifle or stalker bolt rifle the operative is equipped with. That weapon gains the Lethal 5+ special rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepid:BR,SBR','SR:Lethal5+','','','Equipment'),('IMP','KAS','','','ADR',2,'1','Adrenaline Shot','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Adrenaline Shot:</strong>\nOnce per battle, when this operative is activated, you can use this ability.\nIf you do so, until the end of the activation, you can ignore any or all modifiers to this operative\'s APL and Movement characteristics.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','KAS','','','BH-IE',206,'0','Independent Equipage','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>Before the battle, when selecting equipment from your stash, you can select one item of equipment to equip this operative with for one less equipment point (to a minimum of 0 EP).','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','KAS','','','BH-KS',204,'0','Kill Shot','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>Select one of the ranged weapons this operative is equipped with (if the weapon has more than one profile, select one of those profiles).\r Add 1 to its Critical Damage characteristic.','WepMod','weptype:R','D:0/1','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','KAS','','','BH-RES',203,'0','Resolute','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>While this operative is carrying of within [CIRCLE] of an objective marker, each time a shooting attack is made against it, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, you can re-roll one of your Defence dice.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','KAS','','','BH-SI',205,'0','Sharp Instincts','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>Each time this operative makes a shooting attack, enemy operatives must be more than 2 [CIRCLE] (instead of [CIRCLE]) from this operative to be in Cover.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','KAS','','','BH-VG',202,'0','Vengeful','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>Each time this operative fights in combat or makes a shooting attack against an enemy operative that does not have the IMPERIUM keyword, before rolling your Attack dice, you can retain one as a successful normal hit without rolling it.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','KAS','','','BH-WH',201,'0','War-Hardened','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>The first time an enemy operative is incapacitated by this operative in each battlem add 1 Elite Point to your pool.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','KAS','','','CB',5,'1','Combat Blade','The operative is equipped with the following melee weapon for the battle.<br/>\nBoth its Damage characteristics benefit from the For Cadia! Tactical Ploy.\n    <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n    	<tr>\n    		<th>Name</th>\n            <th>A</th>\n            <th>BS</th>\n            <th>D</th>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n    		<td>Combat Blade</td>\n            <td>3</td>\n            <td>4+</td>\n            <td>3/4</td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','KAS','','','DG',5,'2','Decoy Grenade','The operative can perform the following action during the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Decoy Grenade (1 AP):</strong>\nSelect onepoint in the killzone within [PENT] of this operative.\nRoll 1D6 for each operative within 2[CIRCLE] of that point, subtracting 1 from the result if that operative is not Visible to this operative.\nOn a 4+, until the end of the Turning Point, that operative cannot perform Guard or Overwatch actions (if they are already on guard, they are no longer on guard).\nThis operative can only perform this action once, and cannot perform this action while within Engagement Range of an enemy operative.','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','KAS','','','FG',0,'1','Foregrip','Operative with a Hot-Shot Lasgun only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\r <strong>Foregrip:</strong>\r Each time this operative performs an Overwatch action, for that action\'s shooting attack, do not worsen the BS characteristic of a Hot-Shot Lasgun it is equipped with as a result of performing an Overwatch action.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','KAS','KAS','GNR','FG-GNR',0,'2','Foregrip (Gunner)','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/> <strong>Foregrip:</strong> Each time this operative performs an Overwatch action, for that action\'s shooting attack, do not worsen the BS characteristic of a ranged weapon it is equipped with as a result of performing an Overwatch action.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','KAS','KAS','SS','FG-SS',0,'2','Foregrip (Sharpshooter)','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/> <strong>Foregrip:</strong> Each time this operative performs an Overwatch action, for that action\'s shooting attack, do not worsen the BS characteristic of a ranged weapon it is equipped with as a result of performing an Overwatch action.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','KAS','','','FGRN',3,'2','Frag Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n   <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n   	<tr>\n   		<th>Name</th>\n           <th>A</th>\n           <th>BS</th>\n           <th>D</th>\n       </tr>\n       <tr>\n   		<td>Frag Grenade</td>\n           <td>4</td>\n           <td>3+</td>\n           <td>2/3</td>\n       </tr>\n       <tr>\n   		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n       </tr>\n       <tr>\n   		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Blast [CIRCLE], Lim, Indirect</td>\n       </tr>\n   </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','KAS','','','KGRN',4,'3','Krak Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n    <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n    	<tr>\n    		<th>Name</th>\n            <th>A</th>\n            <th>BS</th>\n            <th>D</th>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n    		<td>Krak Grenade</td>\n            <td>4</td>\n            <td>3+</td>\n            <td>4/5</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n    		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n    		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], AP1, Lim, Indirect</td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','KAS','','','LRS',1,'2','Long-Range Scope','Operative with a Hot-Shot Lasgun or Hot-Shot Marksman Rifle only.\nThe Hot-Shot Lasgun or Hot-Shot Marksman Rifle the operative is equipped with gains the following critical hit rule for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Long-Range Scope:</strong>\nEach time a friendly operative makes a shooting attack with this weapon against a target more than [PENT] from it,\nin the Roll Attack Dice step of that shooting attack, if you retain any critical hits, this weapon gains the No Cover special rule for that shooting attack.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','KAS','','','RE-DIAG',404,'2','Diagnosticator','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>KASRKIN COMBAT MEDIC operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\r <strong>Diagnosticator:</strong>\r <ul>\r <li>Each time this operative performs the Combat Stimms action, the friendly operative selected regains 1D3 + 3 lost Wounds (instead of 2D3).</li>\r <li>After the battle, in the Update Dataslates step, if this operative was not incapacitated during the battle, you can re-roll two Casualty Tests as a reslt of this MEDIC operative, rather than one.</li>\r </ul>','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','KAS','','','RE-EL',405,'3','Emperor\'s Light','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>Operative equipped with a Hot-Shot Lasgun only. \r The Hot-Shot Lasgun the operative is equipped with gains the AP1 special rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepname:hot-shot lasgun','SR:AP1','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','KAS','','','RE-KS',406,'2','Kasrkin Surveyor','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>KASRKIN RECON-TROOPER operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\r <strong>Kasrkin Surveyor:</strong>\r Once per Turning Point, during this operative\'s activation, it can perform a mission action or the Pick Up action for one less action point (to a minimum of 0 AP).','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','KAS','','','RE-MOC',403,'4','Memento Of Cadia','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\r <strong>Memento Of Cadia:</strong>\r Once during the battle, when this operative is activated, you can use this ability.\r If you do so, until the end of its activation, this operative can perform two Shoot actions during its activation.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','KAS','','','RE-PAE',401,'1','Plasteel Armour Enhancement','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>KASRKIN DEMO-TROOPER operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\r <strong>Plasteel Armour Enhancement:</strong>\r Each time a shooting attack is made against this operative, in the Resolve Successful Hits step of that shooting attack, each time an attack die would inflict Critical Damage on this operative, you can choose for that attack die to inflict Normal damage instead.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','KAS','','','RE-TVN',402,'3','Tactical Vox-Net','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>KASRKIN VOX-TROOPER operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\r <strong>Tactical Vox-Net:</strong>\r At the end of each Roll Attack Dice step, roll 1D6 for each Elite point you spent in that step. On a 6, you gain 1 Elite point.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','KAS','','','SG',6,'3','Stun Grenade','The operative can perform the following action during the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Stun Grenade (1 AP):</strong>\nSelect onepoint in the killzone within [PENT] of this operative.\nRoll 1D6 for each operative within [CIRCLE] of that point, subtracting 1 from the result if that operative is not Visible to this operative.\nOn a 4+, subtract 1 from that operative\'s APL.\nThis operative can only perform this action once, and cannot perform this action while within Engagement Range of an enemy operative.','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','KAS24','','','CD',4,'0','Combat Daggers','Friendly KASRKIN operatives have the following melee weapon:\n<table class=\"eqtable\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name</th><th>ATK</th><th>HIT</th><th>DMG</th><th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Combat Dagger</td><td>3</td><td>4+</td><td>3/4</td>\n</tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','KAS24','','','FG',1,'0','Foregrip','Whenever a friendly KASRKIN operative is shooting an operative within 3\" of it, ranged weapons on its datacard\n(excluding weapons that include ‘pistol’ in their name, e.g. hot-shot laspistol, all profiles of a plasma pistol, etc.) have the Accurate 1 weapon rule.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','KAS24','','','LRS',2,'0','Long-Range Scope','Whenever a friendly KASRKIN operative is shooting an operative more than 6\" from it, in the Roll Attack Dice step,\nif you retain any critical successes, its hot-shot weapons (excluding hot-shot laspistol) have the Saturate weapon rule.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','KAS24','','','ROC',3,'0','Relics Of Cadia','Once per turning point, when a friendly KASRKIN operative is shooting, if you roll two or more fails, you can discard one of them to retain another as a normal success instead.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','NOV','','','AC',0,'2','Auto-Chastiser','This operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Auto-Chastiser:</strong> Each time this operative fights in combat or makes a shooting attack, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat or shooting attack, you can re-roll any or all of your attack dice results of 1. If any of your re-rolled dice also result in 1, that operative suffers 1 mortal wound.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','NOV','','','AWS',0,'2','Adamantium-Weave Surplice','This operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Adamantium-Weave Surplice:</strong> This operative has a Save characteristic of 3+ instead of 4+.','OpMod','SV','3+','','','Equipment'),('IMP','NOV','','','BH-DET',205,'0','Determined','Each time this operative is activated, if it is within [CIRCLE] of the centre of an objective marker, add 1 to its APL.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','NOV','','','BH-DEV',201,'0','Devout','During the first Turning Point, this operative can perform the following action:<br/>\n<strong>Pray For Guidance (1 AP):</strong> You gain 1 CP. Your kill team can only perform this action once.','Action','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','NOV','','','BH-GOC',204,'0','Glare Of Condemnation','Each time an enemy operative would perform a psychic action, if it is within [SQUARE] of one or more operatives with this Battle Honour, 1 additional AP must be subtracted to perform that action.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','NOV','','','BH-PI',202,'0','Pious','Each time this operative performs one or more Acts of Faith during an activation, roll 1D6: on a 5+, you gain 1 Faith Point.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','NOV','','','BH-QTA',206,'0','Quick Of Thought And Action','At the start of each Turning Point, if this operative is not within Engagement Range of an enemy operative, it can immediately perform a free Dash action.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','NOV','','','BH-RP',203,'0','Righteous Purpose','Each time an Attack die would inflict critical damage on this operative, you can choose for that Attack die to inflict normal damage instead.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','NOV','','','CE',0,'2','Chaplet Ecclesiaticus','This operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Chaplet Ecclesiaticus:</strong> Each time this operative is activated, roll one D6: on a 6, add 1 to its APL.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','NOV','','','FG',0,'2','Frag Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br />\n  <table width=\"100%\" class=\"eqtable\">\n  <tr>\n  	<th>Name</th>\n      <th>A</th>\n      <th>BS</th>\n      <th>D</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  	<td>Frag Grenade</td>\n      <td>4</td>\n      <td>3+</td>\n      <td>2/3</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  	<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  	<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Lim, Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect</td>\n  </tr>\n  </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','NOV','','','IOF',0,'2','Icon Of Faith*','<em>This equipment can be selected a maximum of two times.<br/></em>The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\r <br/>\r <strong>Icon of Faith:</strong> Once per battle, this operative can perform one Act of Faith without you needing to subtract Faith points.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','NOV','','','KG',0,'3','Krak Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br />\n <table width=\"100%\" class=\"eqtable\">\n <tr>\n 	<th>Name</th>\n     <th>A</th>\n     <th>BS</th>\n     <th>D</th>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n 	<td>Krak Grenade</td>\n     <td>4</td>\n     <td>3+</td>\n     <td>4/5</td>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n 	<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n 	<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Lim, AP1, Indirect</td>\n </tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','NOV','','','RE-BB',402,'2','Blessed Blade','Select a Novitiate Blade the operative is equipped with. It gains the following improvements for the battle:\n<ul>\n<li>Improve its WS characteristic by 1</li>\n<li>Add 1 to its Critical Damage characteristic</li>\n</ul>','WepMod','wepname:novitiate blade','BS:-1|D:0/1','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','NOV','','','RE-BI',403,'2','Blessed Incense','NOVITIATE PRECEPTOR operative only.\nThis operative\'s Mace Of The Righteous gains the Rending critical hit rule and the Brutal special rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepname:mace of the righteous','SR:Rending, Brutal','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','NOV','','','RE-IR',404,'3','Inferno Rounds','Select an Autogun or Autopistol the operative is equipped with.\nThat weapon gains the Inferno 1 critical hit rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepname:auto','SR:Inferno 1','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','NOV','','','RE-PB',406,'2','Proclamation Broadcaster','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Proclamation Broadcaster:</strong>\nOnce in this battle, at the start of a Turning Point, this operative can uise its Proclamation Broadcaster.\nIf it does, you gain a number of Faith Points equal to the number of other friendly NOVITIATE operatives Visible to and within [SQUARE] of this operative (to a maximum of 4 Faith Points).','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','NOV','','','RE-RG',401,'3','Relic Gunsight','Select an Autogun the operative is equipped with. It gains the following improvements for the battle:\n<ul>\n<li>Improve its BS characteristic by 1</li>\n<li>The operative can perform the following action:</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>Take Aim (1 AP):</strong>\nSelect one enemy operative Visible to this operative. Until the end of this activation,e ach time this operative makes a shooting attack, treat that enemy operative as having an Engage order for that shooting attack.','Action','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','NOV','','','RE-STC',405,'2','Saint-Touched Cloth','NOVITIATE RELIQUARIUS operative only. That operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Saint-Touched Cloth:</strong>\nAdd [SQUARE] to the range of this operative\'s Icon of Purity ability.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','NOV','','','SR',0,'2','Sainted Reliquae','This operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Sainted Reliquae:</strong> Each time this operative strikes with a critical hit, you gain 1 Faith point.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','NOV24','','','AC',3,'0','Auto-Chastisers','Once per turning point, when a friendly NOVITIATE operative is shooting, fighting or retaliating, in the Roll Attack Dice step,\nyou can inflict 1-3 damage on that friendly operative (but not enough to incapacitate it).\nIf you do, you can use one ACT OF FAITH for free during that sequence with a Faith points cost no more than the damage you inflicted from this rule.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','NOV24','','','HE',4,'0','Holy Embrocations','You can ignore any changes to the Move stat of friendly NOVITIATE operatives from being injured.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','NOV24','','','IOF',1,'0','Icon Of Faith','Once per turning point, you can use up to two ACTS OF FAITH during a sequence, but each one must be different. This takes precedence over the normal ACTS OF FAITH rules.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','NOV24','','','SR',2,'0','Sanctified Rounds','Whenever a friendly NOVITIATE operative is shooting with an autogun, autopistol, relic bolt pistol or relic boltgun, if you spend a Faith point, that weapon has the Piercing Crits 1 weapon rule until the end of that sequence.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','PHO','','','BH-ASS',202,'0','Assassin','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nThis operative can perform the Charge action while it has a Conceal order.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','PHO','','','BH-DYN',206,'0','Dynamic','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nEach time this operative is activated, you can ignore any or all modifiers to its APL and Movement characteristics.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','PHO','','','BH-GH',201,'0','Ghost','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nOnce per battle, this operative can perform the Guerila Warfare action for one less Action Point (to a minimum of 0 AP).','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','PHO','','','BH-GUE',205,'0','Guerilla','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\r For the purposes of the Guerilla Warfare action, this operative cannot perform that action while within Engagement Range of an enemy operative (instead of [SQUARE]).','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','PHO','','','BH-MOB',203,'0','Mobile','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nThis operative can perform the Fall Back action for one less Action Point (to a minimum of 0 AP).','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','PHO','','','BH-RAID',204,'0','Raider','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nThis operative can perform the Charge action while within Engagement Range of an enemy operative.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','PHO','PHO','INFVET','CUST-BAL',10,'0','Custom - Balanced','<em>Infiltrator Veteran<br/></em>Custom Bolt Carbine gains the Balanced special rule.','WepMod','wepid:CBC','SR:Bal','','','Custom Bolt Carbine'),('IMP','PHO','PHO','INFVET','CUST-L5',11,'0','Custom - Lethal 5+','<em>Infiltrator Veteran<br/></em>Custom Bolt Carbine gains the Lethal 5+ special rule.','WepMod','wepid:CBC','SR:Lethal 5+','','','Custom Bolt Carbine'),('IMP','PHO','PHO','INFVET','CUST-MW1',13,'0','Custom - MW1','<em>Infiltrator Veteran<br/></em>Custom Bolt Carbine gains the MW1 critical hit rule.','WepMod','wepid:CBC','SR:MW1','','','Custom Bolt Carbine'),('IMP','PHO','PHO','INFVET','CUST-NC',12,'0','Custom - No Cover','<em>Infiltrator Veteran<br/></em>Custom Bolt Carbine gains the No Cover special rule.','WepMod','wepid:CBC','SR:No Cover','','','Custom Bolt Carbine'),('IMP','PHO','PHO','INFVET','CUST-P1',14,'0','Custom - P1','<em>Infiltrator Veteran<br/></em>Custom Bolt Carbine gains the P1 critical hit rule.','WepMod','wepid:CBC','SR:P1','','','Custom Bolt Carbine'),('IMP','PHO','PHO','INFVET','CUST-REND',15,'0','Custom - Rending','<em>Infiltrator Veteran<br/></em>Custom Bolt Carbine gains the Rending critical hit rule.','WepMod','wepid:CBC','SR:Rending','','','Custom Bolt Carbine'),('IMP','PHO','','','FG',0,'2','Frag Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br />\n  <table width=\"100%\" class=\"eqtable\">\n  <tr>\n  	<th>Name</th>\n      <th>A</th>\n      <th>BS</th>\n      <th>D</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  	<td>Frag Grenade</td>\n      <td>4</td>\n      <td>3+</td>\n      <td>2/3</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  	<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  	<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Lim, Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect</td>\n  </tr>\n  </table>\n','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','PHO','','','GC',0,'2','Grav-Chute','REIVER operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/><br/>\n<strong>Grav-Chute</strong><br/>\n<ul>\n<li>During the mission sequence, after resolving your selected option in the Scouting step, if this operative is wholly within your drop zone, it can perform a Grav-Chute insertion.\nIf it does so, you can perform a free Normal Move action with this operative.\nFor that action, it has a Movement characteristic of 2[CIRCLE] and can FLY.</li>\n<li>Each time this operative moves off a Vantage Point, for that move, it can move as though it can FLY, so long as it does not move higher than that Vantage Point and ends that move lower than that Vantage Point.</li>\n</ul>','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','PHO','','','GL',0,'1','Grapnel Launcher','REIVER operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/><br/>\n<strong>Grapnel Launcher</strong><br/>\n<ul>\n<li>Each time this operative ascends or descends a terrain feature while climbing, the first vertical distance of up to 3[CIRCLE] it travels is counted as [CIRCLE] for that climb.</li>\n<li>This operative only needs to be within [TRI] horizontally of a terrain feature in order to climb it.</li>\n<li>Each time this operative drops, the intended location can be any vertical distance from the level it occupies.</li>\n<li>Each time this operative drops, it counts any vertical distance it travels as half for that drop.</li>\n</ul>','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','PHO','','','KG',0,'3','Krak Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle. It cannot make a shooting attack with this weapon by performing an Overwatch action.\n <br/>\n <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n  	<tr>\n  		<th>Name</th>\n          <th>A</th>\n          <th>BS</th>\n          <th>D</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td>Krak Grenade</td>\n          <td>4</td>\n          <td>3+</td>\n          <td>4/5</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Lim, Indirect, AP1</td>\n      </tr>\n  </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','PHO','','','PS',0,'3','Purity Seal','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/><br/>\n<strong>Purity Seal:</strong>\nOnce per battle, when this operative is fighting in combat, making a shooting attack or a shooting attack is being made against it,\nyou can use the Command Re-Roll Tactical Ploy without spending any CP.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','PHO','','','RE-AB',401,'3','Artificer\'s Blade','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>REIVER or INCURSOR operative only.\nSelect a Combat Knife or Combat Blade the operative is equipped with. It gains the following improvements for the battle:\n<ul>\n<li>Add 1 to its Critical Damage characteristic</li>\n<li>It gains the Lethal 5+ special rule</li>\n</ul>','WepMod','wepname:combat','D:0/1|SR:Lethal 5+','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','PHO','','','RE-ATA',404,'3','Aerial Tracking Augur','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>INFILTRATOR COMMSMAN operative only.\nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Aerial Tracking Augur:</strong>\nOnce per battle after rolling off to determine Initiative, this operative can use this ability. If it does so, you can re-roll your dice.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','PHO','','','RE-EGS',403,'2','Exogheist Scrambler','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>INFILTRATOR operative only.\nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Exogheist Scrambler:</strong>\nFor the purposes of this operative\'s Omni-Scrambler ability, if this operative is in the killzone:\n<ul>\n<li>An enemy operative does not have to be Visible to a friendly operative with the Omni-Scrambler ability to be selected</li>\n<li>This operative counts as two operatives when determining the number of friendly operatives with the Omni-Scrambler ability in the killzone at the start of the phase</li>\n</ul>','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','PHO','','','RE-EO',405,'2','Enhanced Optics','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>Select a ranged weapon this operative is equipped with. Change its Ballistic Skill characteristics to 2+ for the battle.','WepMod','weptype:R','BS:2+','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','PHO','','','RE-REAPR',406,'3','Reaper Rounds','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>REIVER operative only.\nSelect a Special Issue Bolt Pistol the operative is equipped with.\nIt gains the following improvements for the battle:\n<ul>\n<li>It gains the Silent special rule</li>\n<li>It gains the MW1 critical hit rule</li>\n</ul>','WepMod','wepid:SIBP','SR:Silent, MW1','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','PHO','','','RE-US',402,'3','Umbra Shroud','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Umbra Shroud:</strong>\nEach time a shooting attack is made against this operative, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that shooting attack,\nyour opponent must re-roll their critical hits.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','PHO','','','SG',0,'3','Smoke Grenade','The operative can perform the following action during the battle:<br/><br/>\n <strong>Smoke Grenade (1 AP)</strong><br/>\n Place the centre of one Smoke token on a point within [PENT] of this operative.\n That token creates an area of smoke with a [CIRCLE] radius and unlimited vertical upward height (but not below) measured from the centre of that token.\n Until the end of the Turning Point, an operative is Obscured if every Cover line drawn to it crosses an area of smoke.\n This operative can only perform this action once, and cannot perform this action while within Engagement Range of an enemy operative.','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','PHO','','','SHG',0,'2','Shock Grenade','The operative can perform the following action during the battle:<br/><br/>\r <strong>Shock Grenade (1 AP)</strong><br/>\r Select one point on the killzone within [PENT] of this operative.\r Roll 1D6 for each operative within [CIRCLE] of that point, subtracting 1 from the result if that operative is not Visible to this operative.\r On a 4+ subtract 1 from that operative\'s APL. \r This operative can only perform this action once, and cannot perform this action while within Engagement Range of an enemy operative.','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','PHO','','','TK',0,'2','Throwing Knife','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle.\n <br/>\n <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n  	<tr>\n  		<th>Name</th>\n          <th>A</th>\n          <th>BS</th>\n          <th>D</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td>Throwing Knife</td>\n          <td>4</td>\n          <td>3+</td>\n          <td>2/5</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Lim, Silent</td>\n      </tr>\n  </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','PHO24','','','AUG',2,'0','Additional Utility Grenades','This equipment allows you to select four utility grenades from the utility grenades equipment (see universal equipment).<br/>\nYou cannot also select that equipment as normal (i.e. to give you six).','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','PHO24','','','CB',3,'0','Combat Blades','Friendly PHOBOS STRIKE TEAM operatives have the following melee weapon:\n<table class=\"eqtable\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name</th><th>ATK</th><th>HIT</th><th>DMG</th><th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Combat Blade</td><td>5</td><td>3+</td><td>3/4</td>\n</tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','PHO24','PHO24','INFVET','CUST-BAL',10,'0','Custom - Balanced','<em>Infiltrator Veteran<br/></em>Custom Bolt Carbine gains the Balanced weapon rule.','WepMod','wepid:CBC','SR:Bal','','','Custom Bolt Carbine'),('IMP','PHO24','PHO24','INFVET','CUST-L5',11,'0','Custom - Lethal 5+','<em>Infiltrator Veteran<br/></em>Custom Bolt Carbine gains the Lethal 5+ weapon rule.','WepMod','wepid:CBC','SR:Lethal 5+','','','Custom Bolt Carbine'),('IMP','PHO24','PHO24','INFVET','CUST-PC1',12,'0','Custom - Piercing Crits 1','<em>Infiltrator Veteran<br/></em>Custom Bolt Carbine gains the Piercing Crits 1 weapon rule.','WepMod','wepid:CBC','SR:PrcCrit1','','','Custom Bolt Carbine'),('IMP','PHO24','PHO24','INFVET','CUST-REND',13,'0','Custom - Rending','<em>Infiltrator Veteran<br/></em>Custom Bolt Carbine gains the Rending weapon rule.','WepMod','wepid:CBC','SR:Rending','','','Custom Bolt Carbine'),('IMP','PHO24','PHO24','INFVET','CUST-SAT',14,'0','Custom - Saturate','<em>Infiltrator Veteran<br/></em>Custom Bolt Carbine gains the Saturate weapon rule.','WepMod','wepid:CBC','SR:Saturate','','','Custom Bolt Carbine'),('IMP','PHO24','','','PS',1,'0','Purity Seals','Once per turning point, when a friendly PHOBOS STRIKE TEAM operative is shooting, fighting or retaliating, if you roll two or more fails, you can discard one of them to retain another as a normal success instead.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','PHO24','','','SIA',4,'0','Special Issue Ammunition','Once per turning point, when a friendly PHOBOS STRIKE TEAM operative is performing the Shoot action and you select a bolt carbine, marksman bolt carbine or occulus bolt carbine,\nyou can use this rule. If you do, until the end of the turning point, that weapon has the Piercing 1 weapon rule.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','SCT','','','BH-ASS',204,'0','Assassin','This operative can perform the Charge action while it has a Conceal order.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','SCT','','','BH-DIS',201,'0','Distinguished','Once per battle, during this operative\'s activation, you can use the Astartes Training Tactical Ploy without spending any CP','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','SCT','','','BH-EXP',202,'0','Expedient','Add [TRI] to this operative\'s Movement characteristic.','OpMod','M','+[TRI]','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','SCT','','','BH-MOB',205,'0','Mobile','This operative can perform the Fall Back action for one less AP (to a minimum of 0 AP).','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','SCT','','','BH-RDR',206,'0','Raider','This operative can perform the Charge action while within Engagement Range of an enemy operative.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','SCT','','','BH-WV',203,'0','Well-Versed','This operative does not have to be Visible To a SERGEANT operative for the purposes of that operative\'s Guidance and Experience ability.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','SCT','','','CAM',1,'2','Camo Cloak','Not available for SNIPER operative (who already have this ability).<br/>\nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Camo Cloak:</strong>\nEach time a shooting attack is made against this operative, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, before rolling your Defence Dice, if it is in Cover, one additional die can be retained as a successful normal save as a result of Cover.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','SCT','','','CEQ',0,'1','Climbing Equipment','This operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n <strong>Climbing Equipment:<br/></strong>\n <ul>\n <li>Each time this operative ascends or descends a terrain feature while climbing, the first vertical distance of up to 3[CIRCLE] it travels are counted as [CIRCLE] for that climb.</li>\n <li>This operative only needs to be within [TRI] horizontally of a terrain feature in order to climb it.</li>\n <li>Each time this operative drops, the intended location can be any vertical distance from the level it occupies.</li>\n <li>Each time this operative drops, it counts any vertical distance it travels as half for that drop.</li>\n </ul>','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','SCT','','','EXB',2,'2','Extra Blade','Select a combat blade the operative is equipped with. That weapon gains the Balanced special rule for the battle.','WepMod','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','SCT','','','FG',6,'2','Frag Grenade','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br/>\n  <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n  	<tr>\n  		<th>Name</th>\n          <th>A</th>\n          <th>WS</th>\n          <th>D</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td>Frag Grenade</td>\n  		<td>4</td>\n          <td>3+</td>\n          <td>2/3</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td colspan=\"4\">\n  			Rng [PENT], Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect, Lim\n	    </td>\n      </tr>\n  </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','SCT','','','HWBP',3,'2','Heavy Weapon Bipod','Select a Heavy Bolter the operative is equipped with. That weapon gains the following special rule for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Heavy Weapon Bipod:</strong>\nEach time this operative makes a shooting attack with this weapon in the Roll Attack Dice step of that shooting attack, \nif the operative has not moved during this activation, you can re-roll any or all of your attack dice results of one result (e.g. results of 2).','WepMod','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','SCT','','','KG',7,'3','Krak Grenade','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br/>\n  <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n  	<tr>\n  		<th>Name</th>\n          <th>A</th>\n          <th>WS</th>\n          <th>D</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td>Krak Grenade</td>\n  		<td>4</td>\n          <td>3+</td>\n          <td>4/5</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td colspan=\"4\">\n  			Rng [PENT], AP1, Indirect, Lim, No Overwatch\n          </td>\n      </tr>\n  </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','SCT','SCT','HGNR','RE-HEWH',404,'2','High Explosive Warhead','HEAVY GUNNER operative only.\nSelect a Missile Launcher the operative is equipped with. That weapons has its Blast [CIRCLE] special rule changed to Blast [SQUARE] for the battle.','WepMod','wepid:ML','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','SCT','','','RE-ISGS',401,'1','Incendiary Shotgun Shells','Select an Astartes Shotgun the operative is equipped with. That weapon gains the Blast [TRI] special rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepid:ASG','SR:Blast [TRI]','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','SCT','','','RE-PCC',402,'2','Polycam Cloak','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Ploycam Cloak:</strong>\nWhile this operative has a Conceal order, it is always treated as having a Conceal order, regardless of any other rules (e.g. Vantage Point).','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','SCT','','','RE-SUP-BG',406,'3','Suppressor - Boltgun','Select one Boltgun the operative is equipped with. That weapon gains the Silent special rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepid:BG','SR:Silent','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','SCT','','','RE-SUP-BP',406,'2','Suppressor - Bolt Pistol','Select one Bolt Pistol the operative is equipped with. That weapon gains the Silent special rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepid:BP','SR:Silent','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','SCT','','','RE-TS-BG',403,'2','Tactical Scope - Boltgun','Select a Boltgun the operative is equipped with. That weapons gains the Lethal 5+ special rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepid:BG','SR:Lethal 5+','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','SCT','','','RE-TS-SNP',403,'4','Tactical Scope - Sniper','Select a Sniper Rifle the operative is equipped with. That weapons gains the Lethal 5+ special rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepid:SR','SR:Lethal 5+','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','SCT','','','RE-TSL',405,'4','Transpectral Lenses','The operative can perform the following action during the battle:</br>\n<strong>Transpectral Lenses (1 AP):</strong>\nUntil the end of the activation, each time this operative makes a shooting attack, each enemy operative that has a Conceal order and is in Cover provided by Light terrain is treated as having an Engage order for that attack instead. This operative cannot perform this action while within Engagement Range of an enemy operative.','Action','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','SCT','','','SMG',5,'3','Smoke Grenade','The operative can perform the following action during the battle:<br/><br/>\n<strong>Smoke Grenade (1 AP)</strong><br/>\nPlace the centre of one Smoke token on a point within [PENT] of this operative.\nThat token creates an area of smoke with a [CIRCLE] radius and unlimited vertical upward height (but not below) measured from the centre of that token.\nUntil the end of the Turning Point, an operative is Obscured if every Cover line drawn to it crosses an area of smoke.\nThis operative can only perform this action once, and cannot perform this action while within Engagement Range of an enemy operative.','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','SCT','','','TOC',4,'2','Targeting Ocular*','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Targeting Ocular:</strong>\nRanged weapons on this operative\'s datacard that it is equipped with gain the No Cover special rule. Note that ranged weapons it is equipped with by other means (e.g. grenades from Equipment) are unaffected.','WepMod','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','SCT24','','','CBAK',2,'0','Combat Blades and Knives','Friendly SCOUT SQUAD operatives have the following melee weapon:\n <table class=\"eqtable\">\n <tr>\n <th>Name</th><th>ATK</th><th>HIT</th><th>DMG</th><th>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n <td>Combat Blade</td><td>3</td><td>3+</td><td>3/5</td>\n </tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','SCT24','','','CBAK-HNTWAR',2,'0','Combat Blades and Knives - Hunter/Warrior','Friendly SCOUT SQUAD HUNTER and SCOUT SQUAD WARRIOR operatives that already have a combat blade (But with different stats) have the following melee weapon instead:\n <table class=\"eqtable\">\n <tr>\n <th>Name</th><th>ATK</th><th>HIT</th><th>DMG</th><th>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n <td>Combat Blade</td><td>4</td><td>3+</td><td>4/5</td>\n </tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','SCT24','','','CC',1,'0','Camo Cloak','Whenever an operative is shooting a friendly SCOUT SQUAD operative (excluding SNIPER), if you can retain any cover saves, you can retain one additional cover save, or you can retain one cover save as a critical success instead.<br/>\nThis is not cumulative with improved cover saves from vantage terrain.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','SCT24','','','HWBP',3,'0','Heavy Weapon Bipod','Whenever a friendly SCOUT SQUAD HEAVY GUNNER operative is shooting with a heavy bolter or missile launcher, if it has not moved during the activation, or if it is a counteraction, that weapon has the Ceaseless rule; if the weapon already has that weapon rule it has the Relentless weapon rule. Note that operative is not restricted from moving after shooting.<hr/>\n<strong>Ceaseless:</strong> Can re-roll any or all results of one value (e.g. all results of 2)<br/>\n<strong>Relentless:</strong> Can re-roll any or all Attack dice','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','SCT24','','','TO',4,'0','Targeting Oculars','Once per turning point, when a friendly SCOUT SQUAD operative is performing the Shoot action and you are selecting a valid target, you can use this rule. If you do, until the end of that action, its ranged weapons have the Saturate weapon rule.<hr/>\n<strong>Saturate:</strong> The defender cannot retain Cover saves.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','SM','','','AGL',0,'1','Auxiliary Grenade Launcher*','INTERCESSOR operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n <strong>Auxiliary Grenade Launcher:</strong> \n Frag and Krak Grenades the operative is equipped with can be selected for use twice, instead of once.\n Each time the operative performs a Shoot action, if a Frag or Krak Grenade is selected as the ranged weapon an Auxiliary Grenade Launcher can also be selected. \n If it is, for that action\'s shooting attack(s), Frag or Krak Grenades are treated as not having the Rng [PENT] and indirect Special Rule.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','SM','','','AUS',0,'3','Auspex','The operative can perform the following action during the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Auspex (2 AP):</strong> \nSelect one friendly SPACE MARINE operative within [SQUARE] of and Visible to this operative.\nUntil the end of the Turning Point, that operative\'s ranged weapons are treated as having the No Cover Special Rule.\nThis operative cannot perform this action while within Engagement Range of enemy operatives.','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','SM','','','FG',0,'2','Frag Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br />\n <table width=\"100%\" class=\"eqtable\">\n <tr>\n 	<th>Name</th>\n     <th>A</th>\n     <th>BS</th>\n     <th>D</th>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n 	<td>Frag Grenade</td>\n     <td>4</td>\n     <td>3+</td>\n     <td>2/3</td>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n 	<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n 	<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Lim, Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect</td>\n </tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','SM','','','GC',0,'2','Grav-Chute','REIVER operative only.\nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle.\n<br/>\n<strong>Grav-Chute:</strong> \n<ul>\n<li>During the mission sequence, after resolving your selected option in the Scouting step, if this operative is wholly within your dropzone, it can perform a Grav-Chute insertion. If it does so, you can perform a free Normal Move action with this operative. For that action, it has a Movement characteristic of 2 [CIRCLE] and can Fly.</li>\n<li>Each time this operative moves off a Vantage Point, for that move, it can move as though it can Fly, so long as it does not move higher than that Vantage Point and ends that move lower than that Vantage Point.</li>\n</ul>','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','SM','','','GRP',0,'1','Grapnel Launcher','REIVER operative only.\r The operative gains the following ability for the battle.\r <br/>\r <strong>Grapnel Launcher:</strong> \r <ul>\r <li>Each time this operative ascends or descends a terrain feature while climbing, the first vertical of up to 3 [CIRCLE] it travels is counted as [CIRCLE] for that climb.</li>\r <li>The operative onyl needs to be within [TRI] horizontally of a terrain feature in order to climb it.</li> \r <li>Each time this operative drops, the intended location can be any vertical distance from the level it occupies.</li>\r <li>Each time this operative drops, it counts any vertical distance it travels as half of that drop.</li>\r </ul>','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','SM','','','HG',0,'2','Helix Gauntlet','INFILTRATOR WARRIOR operative only. The operative gains the MEDIC keyword until the start of the next battle and can perform the following action during the battle:<br/>\n <strong>Helix Gauntlet (1 AP):</strong> \n Select one friendly SPACE MARINE operative Visible and within [TRI] of this operative.\n That operative regains 2D3 lost wounds. This operative cannot perform this action while within Engagement Range of enemy operatives.','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','SM','','','HM',0,'3','Haywire Mine','INCURSOR WARRIOR operative only. The operative can perform the following action during the battle:\n <br/>\n   <strong>Haywire Mine (1 AP):</strong> \n   Place a Haywire Mine token within [TRI] of this operative.\n   This operative can only perform this action once, and cannot perform this action while within Engagement Range of enemy operatives. \n   If this operative is incapacitated and removed from the killzone, remove its Haywire Mine token. \n <br/><br/>\n   The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon:\n   <table width=\"100%\" class=\"eqtable\">\n   	<tr>\n   		<th>Name</th>\n           <th>A</th>\n           <th>BS</th>\n           <th>D</th>\n       </tr>\n       <tr>\n   		<td>Haywire Mine</td>\n           <td>4</td>\n           <td>2+</td>\n           <td>4/5</td>\n       </tr>\n       <tr>\n   		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n       </tr>\n       <tr>\n   		<td colspan=\"4\">\n   			Detonate*, Silent\n           </td>\n       </tr>\n   </table>\n<strong>Detonate:</strong> \nEach time this operative makes a Shoot action using its Haywire Mine, make a shooting attack against each operative within [SQUARE] of the centre of its Haywire Mine token with that weapon.\nWhen making those shooting attacks, each operative is treated as being Visible, but when determining if it is in Cover, treat this operative\'s Haywire Mine token as the active operative. \nThen remove this operative\'s Haywire Mine token. \nAn operative cannot make a shooting attack with this weapon by performing an Overwatch action, or if its Haywire Mine token is not in the killzone.','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','SM','','','KG',0,'3','Krak Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br />\n<table width=\"100%\" class=\"eqtable\">\n<tr>\n	<th>Name</th>\n    <th>A</th>\n    <th>BS</th>\n    <th>D</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n	<td>Krak Grenade</td>\n    <td>4</td>\n    <td>3+</td>\n    <td>4/5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n	<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n	<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Lim, AP1, Indirect</td>\n</tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','SM','','','PS',0,'3','Purity Seal','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n <strong>Purity Seal:</strong> Once per battle, when this operative is fighting in combat, making a shooting attack, or a shooting attack is being made against it, you can use the Command Re-Roll Tactical Ploy (see the Kill Team Core Book) without spending any CP.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','SM','','','SG',0,'3','Smoke Grenade','INCURSOR, INFILTRATOR, REIVER, or SCOUT operative only.\n  The operative can perform the following action during the battle:\n<br/>\n  <strong>Smoke Grenade (1 AP):</strong> \n  Place the centre of one Smoke token on a point within [PENT] of this operative.\n  That token creates an area of smoke with a [CIRCLE] radius and unlimited upward height (but not below) measured from the centre of that token.\n  Until the end of the Turning Point, an operative is Obscured if every Cover line drawn to it crosses an area of smoke.\n  This operative can only perfom this action once, and cannot perform this action while within Engagement Range of enemy operatives.','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','SM','','','SHG',0,'3','Shock Grenade','REIVER operative only. \n  The operative can perform the following action during the battle.\n  <br/>\n  <strong>Shock Grenade (1 AP):</strong> \n  Select one point of the killzone within [PENT] of this operative. Roll 1D6 for each operative within [CIRCLE] of that point, subtracting 1 from the result if they are not Visible to this operative.\n  On a 4+, subtract 1 from that operative\'s APL. \n  This operative can only perform this action once, and cannot perform this action while within Engagement Range of enemy operatives.','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','SM','','','SUS',0,'3','Suspensor System','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n <br/>\n <strong>Suspensor System:</strong> \n The Heavy Special Rule of ranged weapons the operative is equipped with is treated differently.\n Instead, an operative cannot move more than 3 [CIRCLE] in the same activation in which it performs a Shoot action with any of those ranged weapons. ','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','TEMPAQ','','','CS',2,'0','Combat Stimms','You can ignore any changes to the Move stat of friendly TEMPESTUS AQUILON operatives from being injured.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','TEMPAQ','','','DA',3,'0','Drop Augury','Once during the battle, when a friendly TEMPESTUS AQUILON operative that is set up above is activated, before expending or landing that operative, you can move one of your Drop markers again.\r However, it cannot be moved closer to your opponent\'s drop zone.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','TEMPAQ','','','ROS',4,'0','Remote Overseer','Once during the battle, when rolling off to decide initiative, you can re-roll your D6.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','TEMPAQ','','','TD',1,'0','Tempestus Dagger','Friendly Tempestus Aquilon operatives (excluding SERVO-SENTRY) have the following Melee weapon:\n<table class=\"eqtable\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name</th><th>ATK</th><th>HIT</th><th>DMG</th><th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tempestus Dagger</td><td>3</td><td>4+</td><td>3/4</td>\n</tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','TOE','','','MC',0,'2','Misericordia','ADEPTUS CUSTODES operative that is not equipped with a\nstorm shield only. The operative gains the following ability for\nthe battle:<br/>\n<strong>Misericordia:</strong> Each time after this operative fights in\ncombat, you can use this ability. If you do so, roll one D6: on a\n3+, the enemy operative that fought it in that combat suffers\n2 mortal wounds.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','TOE','','','OP',0,'3','Oath Parchment','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:</br>\n<strong>Oath Parchment:</strong> Once per battle, when this operative is\nfighting in combat, making a shooting attack or a shooting\nattack is being made against it, you can use the Command\nRe-roll Tactical Ploy (see the Kill Team Core Book) without\nspending any CP.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','TOE','','','POG',0,'2','Psyk-Out Grenade*','ANATHEMA PSYKANA operative only. The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br/>\n  <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n  	<tr>\n  		<th>Name</th>\n          <th>A</th>\n          <th>BS</th>\n          <th>D</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td>Psyk-Out Grenade</td>\n          <td>4</td>\n          <td>3+</td>\n          <td>1/1</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Lim, Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect, Psyk-Out*</td>\n      </tr>\n  </table>\n  * <strong>Psyk-Out:</strong> \n  Each time a shooting attack is made with this weapon, if the target has the PSYKER or DAEMON keyword, for that shooting attack, change its Damage characteristic to 3/5 and it has the Lethal 5+ Special Rule.','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','TOE','','','TFG',0,'3','Tanglefoot Grenade','AOEPTUS CUSTODES operative only. The operative can\nperform the following action during the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Tanglefoot Grenade (1 AP):</strong> Select one enemy operative\nVisible to and within [PENT] of this operative. Subtract 1 from its\nAPL. This operative can only perform this action once, and\ncan not perform this action while within Engagement Range of\nenemy operatives.','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','TOE','','','VFP',0,'2','Vratine Faceplate','ANATHEMA PSYKANA operative only. The operative gains\nthe following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Vratine Faceplate:</strong> Once per battle, when damage would be\ninflicted upon this operative from an attack dice, subtract 3\nfrom the damage inflicted (to a minimum of 0).','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','VG','','','BH-BR',202,'0','Brash','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nEach time this operative is issued a Guardsman Order, you can select what order it receives (it can be a different order to what other friendly operatives have).','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','VG','','','BH-CUF',201,'0','Capable Under Fire','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nIf this operative has a Conceal order and is in Cover provided by Light terrain, enemy operatives cannot treat it as being on an Engage Order as a result of a Vantage Point.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','VG','','','BH-DV',205,'0','Decorated Veteran','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nImprove the Ballistic Skill characteristic of this operative\'s ranged weapons by 1 (to a maximum of 3+).','WepMod','weptype:R','BS:-1','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','VG','','','BH-FL',206,'0','Final Litany','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nWhen this operative is incapacitated, you can use the In Death, Atonement Tactical Ploy without spending any CP if this operative is the VETERAN GUARDSMAN selected.\nIf you do, for that operative\'s next activation, change the Ballistic Skill and Weapon Skill characteristic of its weapons to 2+ respectively.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','VG','','','BH-GAD',204,'0','Grit And Determination','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nWhile this operative is within [CIRCLE] of the centre of an objective marker, increase its Defence characteristic by 1.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','VG','','','BH-SS',203,'0','Siege Specialist','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>\nSelect one of this operative\'s ranged weapons. It gains the No Cover special rule.','WepMod','weptype:R','SR:No Cover','','','Battle Honour'),('IMP','VG','','','CM',0,'3','Chronometer*','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Chronometer:</strong> Once per battle, after rolling off to determine initiative, this operative can use this ability. If it does, you can re-roll your dice.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','VG','','','FG',0,'2','Frag Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n<br/>\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n 	<tr>\n 		<th>Name</th>\n         <th>A</th>\n         <th>BS</th>\n         <th>D</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td>Frag Grenade</td>\n         <td>4</td>\n         <td>3+</td>\n         <td>2/3</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Lim, Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect</td>\n     </tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','VG','','','HA',0,'2','Hand Axe','The operative is equipped with the following melee weapon for the battle:\n<br/>\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n 	<tr>\n 		<th>Name</th>\n         <th>A</th>\n         <th>BS</th>\n         <th>D</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td>Hand Axe</td>\n         <td>3</td>\n         <td>4+</td>\n         <td>3/5</td>\n     </tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','VG','','','HSCP',0,'2','Hot-Shot Capacitor Pack','Modify the operative’s ranged weapons for the battle as follows:\r <ul><li>Add 1 to both Damage characteristics of lasguns and laspistols this operative is equipped with.</li></ul>','WepMod','wepid:LG,LP','D:1/1','','','Equipment'),('IMP','VG','','','KG',0,'3','Krak Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle. It cannot make a shooting attack with this weapon by performing an Overwatch action.\n<br/>\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n 	<tr>\n 		<th>Name</th>\n         <th>A</th>\n         <th>BS</th>\n         <th>D</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td>Krak Grenade</td>\n         <td>4</td>\n         <td>3+</td>\n         <td>4/5</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Lim, Indirect, AP1</td>\n     </tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','VG','VG','MDC','RE-DIAG',406,'2','Diagnosticator','<em>Rare Equipment<br/></em>\nMEDIC VETERAN ooperative only.\nThe operative gains the fllowing abilities for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Diagnosticator:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>Each time this operative performs the Medikit action, the friendly operative selected regains 1D3 + 3 lost wounds (rather than 2D3)</li>\n<li>After the battle, in the Update Dataslates step of the mission sequence, if this operative was not incapacitated during the battle, you can re-roll two Casualty Tests as a result of this Medic, rather than one.</li>\n</ul>','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','VG','VG','ZLT','RE-LOS',404,'3','Litany Of Sacrifice','<em>Rare Equipment<br/></em>\nZEALOT VETERAN operative only. The operative gains the following Unique Action for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Litany Of Sacrifice (1 AP):</strong>\nUntil the end of the Turning Point, while a friendly VETERAN GUARDSMAN operative is within [PENT] of this operative, it is inspired by sacrifice.\nWhile an operative is inspired by sacrifice, each time it fights in combat or is the target of a shooting attack, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat or shooting attack,\nyou can change one of your opponent\'s Critical hits to a Normal hit.','Action','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','VG','','','RE-PS',402,'1','Prized Sabre','<em>Rare Equipment<br/></em>\nSelect a Power Weapon the operative is equipped with. It gains the Balanced special rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepid:PW','SR:Balanced','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','VG','','','RE-RHL',405,'2','Regimental Heirloom','<em>Rare Equipment<br/></em>\nThe operative gains the fllowing ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Regimental Heirloom:</strong>\nAt the end of this operative\'s activation, if it did not perform a Shoot action during that activation, until the start of its next activation it is motivated by honour.\nWhile an operative is motivated by honour:\n<ul>\n<li>When determining control of an objective marker, treat its APL as 1 higher (to a maximum of 3). Note this is not a modifier.</li>\n<li>In the Resolve Successful Hits step of a shooting attack or combat, each time damage is inflicted on this operative, halve the damage that is applied (rounding up).</li>\n</ul>','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','VG','','','RE-RSA',401,'2','Relic Sidearm','<em>Rare Equipment<br/></em>\nSelect a Bolt Pistol or Laspistol the operative is equipped with. It gains the following improvements for the battle:\n<ul>\n<li>Improve its Ballistic Skill characteristic by 1</li>\n<li>Add 1 to its Attacks characteristic</li>\n</ul>','WepMod','wepid:BP,LP','BS:-1|A:+1','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','VG','VG','COMMS','RE-VCR',403,'2','Vid-Capture Relay','<em>Rare Equipment<br/></em>\nCOMMS VETERAN operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Vid-Capture Relay:</strong>\nEach time this operative performs the Signal action, it can select any friendly operative in the kill zone, rather that within [PENT] and Visible to it.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('IMP','VG','','','ROS',0,'2','Rosary*','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Rosary:</strong> Once per battle, in the Resolve Successful Hits step of a shooting attack or combat, you can ignore the damage inflicted on this operative from one attack dice.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','VG','','','TC',0,'3','Topographical Chart*','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Topographical Chart:</strong>\nDuring the mission sequence, if this friendly operative was selected for deployment, after resolving your selected option in the Scouting step, you can select and resolve an additional scouting option. It must be a different option to your original selection, and initiative is still determined by your original selection.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('IMP','VG','','','TS',0,'2','Trench Shovel','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Dug Trench:</strong>\nWhile this operative is wholly within your drop zone, each time an enemy operative makes a shooting attack, if it is more than [CIRCLE] from this operative, this operative is treated as being in Cover provided by Light terrain. This operative loses this ability if it performs a Normal Move, Charge, Fall Back or Dash action.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('kt21','ALL','','','BH-COM-BW',302,'0','(Combat) Bladework','<em>Combat Specialist Battle Honour<br/></em>\nEach time this operative fights in combat, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat, you can re-roll one of your attack dice.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('kt21','ALL','','','BH-COM-DF',303,'0','(Combat) Dirty Fighter','<em>Combat Specialist Battle Honour<br/></em>\nEach time this operative fights in combat, if any friendly operatives are supporting them, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of their melee weapons for that combat.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('kt21','ALL','','','BH-COM-DUE',305,'0','(Combat) Duellist','<em>Combat Specialist Battle Honour<br/></em>\nEach time this operative fights in combat, subtract 1 from the Weapon Skill characteristic of the enemy operative for that combat.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('kt21','ALL','','','BH-COM-INEX',301,'0','(Combat) Inexorable','<em>Combat Specialist Battle Honour<br/></em>\nEach time this operative fights in combat, the enemy operative in that combat cannot be supported.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('kt21','ALL','','','BH-COM-SAV',306,'0','(Combat) Savage','<em>Combat Specialist Battle Honour<br/></em>\nEach time this operative fights in combat, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat, if you retain any critical hits, you can inflict one Mortal Wound on the enemy operative in that combat.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('kt21','ALL','','','BH-COM-VIC',304,'0','(Combat) Vicious','<em>Combat Specialist Battle Honour<br/></em>\nAdd 1 to the Critical Damage characteristic of this operative’s melee weapons.','WepMod','weptype:M','D:0/1','','','Battle Honour'),('kt21','ALL','','','BH-MRK-CA',324,'0','(Marksman) Careful Aim','<em>Marksman Specialist Battle Honour<br/></em>\nEach time this operative makes a shooting attack, when determining if the intended target is in Cover, Cover lines ignore the bases of all other operatives.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('kt21','ALL','','','BH-MRK-CALC',323,'0','(Marksman) Calculated','<em>Marksman Specialist Battle Honour<br/></em>\nEach time this operative performs an Overwatch action, for that action’s shooting attack, do not worsen the Ballistic Skill characteristic of its ranged weapons as a result of performing an Overwatch action.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('kt21','ALL','','','BH-MRK-CS',322,'0','(Marksman) Crack Shot','<em>Marksman Specialist Battle Honour<br/></em>\nEach time this operative makes a shooting attack, if you roll any critical hits, inflict one mortal wound on the target.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('kt21','ALL','','','BH-MRK-DFA',326,'0','(Marksman) Death From Above','<em>Marksman Specialist Battle Honour<br/></em>\nOnce per Turning Point, after this operative makes a shooting attack while on a Vantage Point, if the target did not lose any wounds as a result of that shooting attack, repeat that shooting attack.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('kt21','ALL','','','BH-MRK-GA',321,'0','(Marksman) Gun Ace','<em>Marksman Specialist Battle Honour<br/></em>\nEach time this operative makes a shooting attack, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that shooting attack, you can re-roll one of your attack dice.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('kt21','ALL','','','BH-MRK-SS',325,'0','(Marksman) Sharpshooter','<em>Marksman Specialist Battle Honour<br/></em> Each time this operative performs a Shoot action, when you would retain attack dice for that action’s shooting attack, if it has not performed a Normal Move, Fall Back or Charge action during that activation, you can select one of your results of 5+ to be retained as a critical hit.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('kt21','ALL','','','BH-SCT-COV',333,'0','(Scout) Covert','<em>Scout Specialist Battle Honour<br/></em>\nWhen this operative is activated during the first Turning Point, you can change its order.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('kt21','ALL','','','BH-SCT-DOD',336,'0','(Scout) Dodge','<em>Scout Specialist Battle Honour<br/></em>\nEach time this operative performs a Normal Move or Dash action, it can move within Engagement Range of enemy operatives, but cannot finish that move within Engagement Range of them. Each time this operative performs a Charge action, so long as it finishes that move within Engagement Range of an enemy operative, it can move within Engagement Range of any enemy operatives during that move.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('kt21','ALL','','','BH-SCT-EV',335,'0','(Scout) Evasive','<em>Scout Specialist Battle Honour<br/></em>\nEach time this operative is the target of a shooting attack, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, if it has a Conceal order, you can re-roll one of your defence dice.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('kt21','ALL','','','BH-SCT-PIC',334,'0','(Scout) Picket','<em>Scout Specialist Battle Honour<br/></em>\r During the Set Up Operatives step of the mission sequence, this operative can be set up within [SQUARE] of your drop zone.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('kt21','ALL','','','BH-SCT-RUN',331,'0','(Scout) Runner','<em>Scout Specialist Battle Honour<br/></em>\nEach time this operative is activated, so long as it does not perform a Shoot or Fight action during that activation, it can perform one free Dash action.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('kt21','ALL','','','BH-SCT-SW',332,'0','(Scout) Swift','<em>Scout Specialist Battle Honour<br/></em>\nThis operative can perform a Dash action more than once during its Activation. In addition, it automatically passes Jump tests and does not need to spend [CIRCLE] to traverse.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('kt21','ALL','','','BH-STA-FOC',313,'0','(Staunch) Focused','<em>Staunch Specialist Battle Honour<br/></em>\nWhen determining control of an objective marker, treat this operative’s APL characteristic as being 1 higher. Note that this is not a modifier.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('kt21','ALL','','','BH-STA-IND',316,'0','(Staunch) Indomitable','<em>Staunch Specialist Battle Honour<br/></em>\nEach time this operative would lose a wound as a result of a mortal wound or critical damage, roll one D6: on a 5+, that wound is not lost.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('kt21','ALL','','','BH-STA-INV',315,'0','(Staunch) Invulnerable','<em>Staunch Specialist Battle Honour<br/></em>\nEach time this operative is the target of a shooting attack, in the roll defence dice step of that shooting attack, ignore the AP1 special rule.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('kt21','ALL','','','BH-STA-RES',311,'0','(Staunch) Resilient','<em>Staunch Specialist Battle Honour<br/></em>\nAdd 2 to this operative’s Wounds characteristic.','OpMod','W','+2','','','Battle Honour'),('kt21','ALL','','','BH-STA-SO',312,'0','(Staunch) Shrug Off','<em>Staunch Specialist Battle Honour<br/></em>\nEach time this operative is the target of a shooting attack, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that shooting attack, you can change one of your opponent\'s retained critical hits to a normal hit.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('kt21','ALL','','','BH-STA-STA',314,'0','(Staunch) Stalwart','<em>Staunch Specialist Battle Honour<br/></em>\nThis operative is never injured.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('kt21','ALL','','','BS-CA',806,'0','Cerebral Affliction','<em>Battle Scar<br/></em>This operative does not gain a Battle Scar but does not gain any experience from this battle.','Ability','','','','','Battle Scar'),('kt21','ALL','','','BS-CI',802,'0','Critical Impairment','<em>Battle Scar<br/></em>This operative cannot perform Dash actions and its APL characteristic cannot be increased.','Ability','','','','','Battle Scar'),('kt21','ALL','','','BS-LA',805,'0','Lingering Ailment','<em>Battle Scar<br/></em>This operative always suffers the penalty to its Movement characteristic as if it were injured.','OpMod','M','-[CIRCLE]','','','Battle Scar'),('kt21','ALL','','','BS-SC',803,'0','Severe Concussion','<em>Battle Scar<br/></em>This operative always suffers the penalty to the Ballistic Skill characteristic of its ranged weapons as if it were injured.','WepMod','weptype:R','BS:+1','','','Battle Scar'),('kt21','ALL','','','BS-SL',801,'0','Slain','<em>Battle Scar<br/></em>This operative can no longer be used. Remove it from your dataslate.','Ability','','','','','Battle Scar'),('kt21','ALL','','','BS-SS',804,'0','Sapped Strength','<em>Battle Scar<br/></em>This operative always suffers the penalty to the Weapon Skill characteristic of its melee weapons as if it were injured.','WepMod','weptype:M','BS:+1','','','Battle Scar'),('kt21','ALL','','','RE-AL',501,'2','Auto-Loader','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nThis ranged weapon gains the Ceaseless special rule.','WepMod','weptype:R','SR:Ceaseless','','','Rare Equipment'),('kt21','ALL','','','RE-AU',512,'2','Arc Unit','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nThis melee weapon gains the Stun critical hit rule.','WepMod','weptype:M','SR:Stun','','','Rare Equipment'),('kt21','ALL','','','RE-FC',502,'2','Flux Capacitor','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nThis ranged weapon gains the P1 critical hit rule.','WepMod','weptype:R','SR:P1','','','Rare Equipment'),('kt21','ALL','','','RE-ID',508,'2','Inertia Displacer','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nThis melee weapon gains the Brutal special rule.','WepMod','weptype:M','SR:Brutal','','','Rare Equipment'),('kt21','ALL','','','RE-MME',511,'2','Monomolecular Edge','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nThis melee weapon gains the Lethal 5+ special rule.','WepMod','weptype:M','SR:Lethal 5+','','','Rare Equipment'),('kt21','ALL','','','RE-PA',504,'2','Propulsion Amplifier','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nAdd 1 to both Damage characteristics of this ranged weapon.','WepMod','weptype:R','D:1/1','','','Rare Equipment'),('kt21','ALL','','','RE-PE',507,'2','Power Enhancer','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\r Add 1 to both Damage characteristics of this melee weapon.','WepMod','weptype:M','D:1/1','','','Rare Equipment'),('kt21','ALL','','','RE-PW',509,'2','Perfectly Weighted','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nThis melee weapon gains the Balanced special rule.','WepMod','weptype:M','SR:Bal','','','Rare Equipment'),('kt21','ALL','','','RE-RB',510,'2','Rending Blade','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nThis melee weapon gains the Rending special rule.','WepMod','weptype:M','SR:Rending','','','Rare Equipment'),('kt21','ALL','','','RE-RR',503,'2','Rending Rounds','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nThis ranged weapon gains the Rending special rule.','WepMod','weptype:R','SR:Rending','','','Rare Equipment'),('kt21','ALL','','','RE-SS',506,'2','Seeker Spirit','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nEach time a friendly operative makes a shooting attack with this ranged weapon, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that shooting attack, for each critical hit you retain, you can re-roll one of your attack dice.','WepMod','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('kt21','ALL','','','RE-TS',505,'2','Thermal Sight','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nThis ranged weapon gains the No Cover special rule.','WepMod','weptype:R','SR:No Cover','','','Rare Equipment'),('kt24','ALL','','','UE-AC',601,'0','Ammo Cache','Before the battle, you can set up one of your Ammo Cache markers wholly within your territory. Friendly operatives can perform the following mission action during the battle:\r <strong>AMMO RESUPPLY (0 AP):</strong> One of your Ammo Cache markers the active operative controls is used during this turning point.<br/>\r Until the start of the next turning point, whenever this operative is shooting with a weapon from its datacard, you can re-roll one of your attack dice.</br>\r An operative cannot perform this action while within control range of an enemy operative, if that marker is not yours, or if that marker has been used this turning point.','Action','','','','','Universal Equipment'),('kt24','ALL','','','UE-CD',603,'0','Comms Device','Before the battle, you can set up one of your Comms Device markers wholly within your territory.\nWhile a friendly operative controls this marker, add 3\" to the distance requirements of its SUPPORT rules that refer to friendly operatives\n(e.g. ‘select one friendly operative within 6\"’ would be 9\" instead).\nNote that you cannot benefit from your opponent\'s Comms Device markers.','Ability','','','','','Universal Equipment'),('kt24','ALL','','','UE-HB',606,'0','Heavy Barricade','A heavy barricade is Heavy terrain. Before the battle, you can set it up wholly within 2\" of your drop zone, on the killzone floor and more than 2\" from other equipment terrain features.','Ability','','','','','Universal Equipment'),('kt24','ALL','','','UE-LAD',607,'0','Ladders','Ladders are Exposed terrain. Before the battle, you can set up any of them as follows:\r <ul>\r <li>Wholly within your territory.</li>\r <li>Upright against terrain that is at least 2\" tall.</li>\r <li>More than 2\" from other equipment terrain features.</li>\r <li>More than 1\" from doors and access points.</li>\r </ul>\r In addition, an operative can either move through ladders as if they aren’t there (but cannot finish on them), or climb them.\r Once per action, whenever an operative is climbing this terrain feature, treat the vertical distance as 1\".\r Note that if an operative then continues climbing another terrain feature during that action (including another ladder), that distance is determined as normal.','Ability','','','','','Universal Equipment'),('kt24','ALL','','','UE-LB',605,'0','Light Barricades','Light barricades are Light terrain. Before the battle, you can set up any of them wholly within your territory, on the killzone floor and more than 2\" from other equipment terrain features.','Ability','','','','','Universal Equipment'),('kt24','ALL','','','UE-MN',604,'0','Mines','Before the battle, you can set up one of your Mines markers wholly within your territory and more than 2\" from other markers and access points.\nThe first time that marker is within an operative\'s control range, remove that marker and inflict D3+3 damage on that operative.','Ability','','','','','Universal Equipment'),('kt24','ALL','','','UE-PB',608,'0','Portable Barricade','A portable barricade is Light, Protective and Portable terrain.\nBefore the battle, you can set it up wholly within your territory, on the killzone floor and more than 2\" from other equipment terrain features.\n<br/>\n<strong>Protective:</strong> While an operative is in cover from this terrain feature, improve its Save stat by 1 (to a maximum of 2+).<br/>\n<strong>Portable:</strong> This terrain feature only provides cover while an operative is connected to it and if the shield is intervening (ignore its feet).\nOperatives connected to the inside of it can perform the following action during the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Move With Barricade (1 AP):</strong>\nThe same as the Reposition action, except the active operative can move no more than its Move stat minus 2\" and cannot climb, drop or jump.<br/>\nBefore this operative moves, remove the portable barricade it is connected to. After it moves, set up the portable barricade so it is connected again.<br/>\nThis action is treated as a Reposition action. An operative cannot perform this action while within control range of an enemy operative, or in the same activation in which it performed the Fall Back or Charge action.','Ability','','','','','Universal Equipment'),('kt24','ALL','','','UE-RW',602,'0','Razor Wire','Razor wire is Exposed and Obstructing terrain. Before the battle, you can set it up wholly within your territory, on the killzone floor and more than 2\" from other equipment terrain features.<br/>\nObstructing: Whenever an operative would cross this terrain feature within 1\" of it, treat the distance as an additional 2\".','Ability','','','','','Universal Equipment'),('kt24','ALL','','','UE-UG-SMK',609,'0','Utility Grenade - Smoke','When you select this equipment, select two utility grenades (2 smoke, 2 stun, or 1 smoke and 1 stun).\nEach selection is a unique action your operatives can perform, but your kill team can only perform that action a total number of times during the battle equal to your selection.\n<br/>\n<strong>SMOKE GRENADE (1 AP):</strong><br/>\n<ul>\n<li>Place one of your Smoke Grenade markers within 6\" of this operative. It must be visible to this operative,\nor on Vantage terrain of a terrain feature that is visible to this operative. The marker creates an area of smoke 1\" horizontally and unlimited height vertically from (but not below) it.</li>\n<li>While an operative is wholly within an area of smoke, it is obscured to operatives more than 2\" from it, and vice versa.\nIn addition, whenever an operative is shooting an enemy operative wholly within an area of smoke, ignore the Piercing weapon rule unless they are within 2\" of each other.</li>\n<li>In the Ready step of the next Strategy phase, roll one D3. Remove that Smoke Grenade marker after a number of activations equal to that D3 have been completed\nor at the end of the turning point (whichever comes first).</li>\n<li>An operative cannot perform this action while within control range of an enemy operative, or if you have reached the total number of times your kill team can perform it.</li>\n</ul>','Action','','','','','Universal Equipment'),('kt24','ALL','','','UE-UG-STN',609,'0','Utility Grenade - Stun','When you select this equipment, select two utility grenades (2 smoke, 2 stun, or 1 smoke and 1 stun).\nEach selection is a unique action your operatives can perform, but your kill team can only perform that action a total number of times during the battle equal to your selection.\n<br/>\n<strong>STUN GRENADE (1 AP):</strong><br/>\n<ul>\n<li>Select one enemy operative visible to and within 6\" of this operative. That operative and each other operative within 1\" of it takes a stun test. For an operative to take a stun test, roll one D6: on a 3+, subtract 1 from its APL stat until the end of its next activation.</li>\n<li>An operative cannot perform this action while within control range of an enemy operative, or if you have reached the total number of times your kill team can perform it.</li>\n</ul>','Action','','','','','Universal Equipment'),('kt24','ALL','','','UE-XG-FRAG',610,'0','Explosive Grenade - Frag','When you select this equipment, select two explosive grenades (2 frag, 2 krak, or 1 frag and 1 krak).\n<table class=\"eqtable\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name</th><th>A</th><th>BS</th><th>D</th><th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Frag Grenade</td><td>4</td><td>4+</td><td>2/4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rng 6\", Blast 2\", Saturate</td>\n</tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Universal Equipment'),('kt24','ALL','','','UE-XG-KRAK',610,'0','Explosive Grenade - Krak','When you select this equipment, select two explosive grenades (2 frag, 2 krak, or 1 frag and 1 krak).\n<table class=\"eqtable\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name</th><th>A</th><th>BS</th><th>D</th><th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Krak Grenade</td><td>4</td><td>4+</td><td>4/5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rng 6\", Piercing 1, Saturate</td>\n</tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Universal Equipment'),('NEC','HIER','','','ASP',4,'1','Arcshock Projector','IMMORTAL operative equipped with a Tesla Carbine only.\nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Arcshock Projector:</strong>\nEach time this operative makes a shooting attack with a Tesla Carbine, for that shooting attack, for the purposes of the Splash X critical hit rule, inflict Mortal Wounds on the target\nand each other operative Visible To and within [SQUARE] of it (instead of [CIRCLE]).','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('NEC','HIER','','','BH-CRY-COLL',203,'0','(Cryptek) Collector','<em>Battle Honour - Cryptek</em><br/>\nIn the Select Equipment step, you can equip this operative with one item of equipment for the battle without spending any equipment points.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('NEC','HIER','','','BH-CRY-CON',201,'0','(Cryptek) Controlling','<em>Battle Honour - Cryptek</em><br/>\nEach time time this operative performs the Command action, you can select one friendly DEATHMARK or IMMORTAL operative anywhere within the killzone (instead of Visible To and within [PENT]).','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('NEC','HIER','','','BH-CRY-ING',202,'0','(Cryptek) Ingenious','<em>Battle Honour - Cryptek</em><br/>\nThis operative gains the remaining Cryptek action from its datacard.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('NEC','HIER','','','BH-HIER-END',204,'0','(Hierotek) Enduring','<em>Battle Honour - Hierotek</em><br/>\nIf this operative was not reanimated during the Turning Point, it can regain up to 1D3 additional lost Wounds as a result of the Living Metal ability.\nIf it does so, it cannot regain any lost Wounds as a result of the Canoptek Repair action during the same Turning Point.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('NEC','HIER','','','BH-HIER-REV',205,'0','(Hierotek) Revenant','<em>Battle Honour - Hierotek</em><br/>\nEach time you roll 1D6 for a Reanimation Token placed for this operative, add 1 to the result.\nEach time this operative is successfully reanimated, it has 3 Wounds remaining.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('NEC','HIER','','','BH-HIER-UNR',206,'0','(Hierotek) Unrelenting','<em>Battle Honour - Hierotek</em><br/>\nYou can ignore any or all modifiers to this operative\'s APL and Movement characteristics and it is not affected by the Stun critical hit rule.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('NEC','HIER','HIER','CHRON','CA-CM-CM',103,'0','[CA-CHRON] Chronometron','<strong>Cryptek Action - Chronomancer Only</strong><br/>\n<em>When this operative is added to your roster or dataslate, it gains two Cryptek actions.</em><br/><br/>\n<strong>Chronometron (1 AP):</strong>\nSelect one friendly HIEROTEK CIRCLE operative Visible to and within [PENT] of this operative. Until the start of this operative\'s next activation, if it\'s incapacitated, or if another friendly operative performs this action (whichever comes first):\n<ul>\n<li>Add [SQUARE] to that operative\'s Movement characteristic.</li>\n<li>Each time that operative would lose a Wound, roll 1D6: On a 5+, that Wound is not lost.</li>\n</ul>','Action','','','','','Cryptek Action'),('NEC','HIER','HIER','CHRON','CA-CM-CTNM',102,'0','[CA-CHRON] Countertemporal Nanomine','<strong>Cryptek Action - Chronomancer Only</strong><br/>\n<em>When this operative is added to your roster or dataslate, it gains two Cryptek actions.</em><br/><br/>\n<strong>Countertemporal Nanomine (1 AP):</strong>\nPlace one of your Countertemporal Nanomine tokens within [PENT] of this operative.\nEach time an enemy operative performs an action in which it moves, if it would move within [SQUARE] of that token, subtract [CIRCLE] from the distance it can move during that action (to a minimum of 2[CIRCLE]). Note Dash actions are not affected.\nAt the start of this operative\'s next activation, if it\'s incapacitated, or if another friendly operative performs this action (whichever comes first), remove that token.','Action','','','','','Cryptek Action'),('NEC','HIER','HIER','CHRON','CA-CM-TS',101,'0','[CA-CHRON] Timesplinter','<strong>Cryptek Action - Chronomancer Only</strong><br/>\n<em>When this operative is added to your roster or dataslate, it gains two Cryptek actions.</em><br/><br/>\n<strong>Timesplinter (1 AP):</strong>\nSelect one friendly HIEROTEK CIRCLE operative visible to and within [PENT] of this operative.\nUntil the start of this operative\'s next activation, if it\'s incapacitated, or if another friendly operative performs this action (whichever comes first), that operative has an Invulnerable Save equal to its unmodified Save characteristic.','Action','','','','','Cryptek Action'),('NEC','HIER','HIER','PSYCH','CA-PM-CT',104,'0','[CA-PSYCH] Conjure Trauma','<strong>Cryptek Action - Psychomancer Only</strong><br/>\n<em>When this operative is added to your roster or dataslate, it gains two Cryptek actions.</em><br/><br/>\n<strong>Conjure Trauma (1 AP):</strong>\nSelect one enemy operative Visible to this operative.\nUntil the start of this operative\'s next activation, if it\'s incapacitated, or if another friendly operative performs this action (whichever comes first), that operative is treated as being injured, regardless of any rules that say it cannot be injured.<br/>\nIn addition, roll 1D6. If the result is higher than that enemy operative’s APL, subtract 1 from that enemy operative’s APL.','Action','','','','','Cryptek Action'),('NEC','HIER','HIER','PSYCH','CA-PM-HOD',106,'0','[CA-PSYCH] Harbinger Of Despair','<strong>Cryptek Action - Psychomancer Only</strong><br/>\n<em>When this operative is added to your roster or dataslate, it gains two Cryptek actions.</em><br/><br/>\n<strong>Harbinger Of Despair (1 AP):</strong>\nSelect a point in the killzone Visible to this operative (treat that point as an intended target) that a token can be placed flat upon. e.g. the floor of the killzone or a Vantage Point.\nPlace one of your Despair tokens on that point. Each time an enemy operative would perform a mission action or the Pick Up action while within [CIRCLE] of that token,\none additional Action Point  must be subtracted for that enemy operative to perform that action.\nIn addition, when determining control of an objective marker that token is within [CIRCLE] or, treat enemy operatives\' total APL as being 1 less.\nNote that this is not a modifier. At the start of this operative\'s next activation, if it\'s incapacitated, or if another friendly operative performs this action (whichever comes first), remove that token.','Action','','','','','Cryptek Action'),('NEC','HIER','HIER','PSYCH','CA-PM-NS',105,'0','[CA-PSYCH] Nightmare Shroud','<strong>Cryptek Action - Psychomancer Only</strong><br/>\n<em>When this operative is added to your roster or dataslate, it gains two Cryptek actions.</em><br/><br/>\n<strong>Nightmare Shroud (1 AP):</strong>\nUntil the start of this operative\'s next activation, if it\'s incapacitated, or if another friendly operative performs this action (whichever comes first), each time an enemy operative within [PENT] of this operative fights in combat or makes a shooting attack,\nin the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat or shooting attack, your opponent cannot re-roll their Attack dice and cannot retain Attack dice as critical hits (they must be retained as normal hits instead).','Action','','','','','Cryptek Action'),('NEC','HIER','','','DNS',6,'3','Devourer Nanoscarabs*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br/>\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n 	<tr>\n 		<th>Name</th>\n         <th>A</th>\n         <th>BS</th>\n         <th>D</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td>Devourer Nanoscarabs</td>\n         <td>4</td>\n         <td>3+</td>\n         <td>3/4</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Indirect, Lethal 5+, Lim</td>\n     </tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('NEC','HIER','','','HB',2,'2','Hyperphase Blade','IMMORTAL operative only.\nSelect one Bayonet the operative is equipped with. That weapon gains the Lethal 5+ special rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepname:bayonet','SR:Lethal 5+','','','Equipment'),('NEC','HIER','','','PO',1,'2','Phase Oculars','DEATHMARK operative only. The operative can perform the following action during the battle:<br/>\r <strong>Phase Oculars (0 AP):</strong>\r Select one enemy operative. Until the end of the Turning Point, each time this operative makes a shooting attack with a synaptic disintegrator against that enemy operative, at the end of the Roll Attack Dice step of that shooting attack, if you did not retain any critical hits, you can change one of your retained successful normal hits to a critical hit instead (resolving the MWx critical hit rule accordingly).','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('NEC','HIER','','','PS',5,'3','Phase Shifter*','CRYPTEK operative only.\nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Phase Shifter:</strong>\nThis operative has a 4+ Invulnerable Save.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('NEC','HIER','','','QR',7,'3','Quantum Reanimytes*','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Cryptek Reanimytes:</strong>\nWhile a friendly HIEROTEK CIRCLE operative is within [SQUARE] of this operative, each time that operative would lose a Wound as a result of a Mortal Wound, roll 1D6:\nOn a 4+, that Wound is not lost.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('NEC','HIER','','','RE-HS',406,'3','Hunter Scarab*','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nThe operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr>\n	<th>Name</th><th>A</th><th>BS</th><th>D</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n	<td>Hunter Scarab</td><td>5</td><td>3+</td><td>1/1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n	<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n	<td colspan=\"5\">\n		Indirect, Limited, No Cover, MW1\n    </td>\n</tr>\n<table>','Weapon','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('NEC','HIER','','','RE-PC',401,'2','Plasma Crystal','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nSelect one ranged weapon the operative is equipped with. That weapon gains the MW1, critical hit rule for the battle.\nIf the weapon already has the MWx critical hit rule, increase x by 1 (e.g. MW1 becomes MW2).','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('NEC','HIER','','','RE-RB',402,'2','Resurrection Beam','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nCRYPTEK or APPRENTEK operative only.</br>\nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Resurrection Beam:</strong>\nOnce per Turning Point, before you woud roll 1D6 for one of your Reanimation Tokens, if that token is within [PENT] of this operative, you can treat the result as a 6 without rolling it.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('NEC','HIER','','','RE-RRA',404,'1','Rapid Reanimatrix','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Rapid Reanimatrix:</strong>\nAfter the battle, in the Update Dataslates step:\n<ul>\n<li>If this operative was incapacitated during that battle, it automatically passes its Casualty test.</li>\n<li>If this operative has any Battle Scars, you can re-roll its Recovery test.</li>\n</ul>','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('NEC','HIER','','','RE-TO',405,'3','Temporic Orb','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nCRYPTEK operative only.<br/>\nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Temporic Orb:</strong>\nOnce per battle, after rolling off to determine initiative, this operative can use this ability. If it does so, you can re-roll your die or add 1 to the result.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('NEC','HIER','','','RE-TT',403,'3','Tech-Tendrils','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>\nCRYPTEK operative only.</br>\nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Tech-Tendrils:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>While an enemy operative is Visible To and within [CIRCLE] of this operative, subtract 1 from the Attacks characteristic of the melee weapons that enemy operative is equipped with.</li>\n<li>Once per Turning Point, during this operative\'s activation, it can perform a mission action or the Pick Up action for one less Action Point (to a minimum of 0 AP).</li>\n</ul>','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('NEC','HIER','','','TW',3,'2','Tesla Weave','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Tesla Weave:</strong>\nEach time an enemy operative finishes a Charge action within Engagement Range of this operative, roll 3D6.\nFor each result of 5+, that enemy operative suffers 1 Mortal Wound.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('NEC','HIER24','','','MC',1,'0','Magnification Conduits','Once per turning point, when a friendly HIEROTEK CIRCLE APPRENTEK or HIEROTEK CIRCLE CRYPTEK operative is performing the Shoot action, you can use this rule.\nIf you do, select one other friendly HIEROTEK CIRCLE operative (excluding PLASMACYTE) that has an Engage order and is visible to that friendly operative.\nUntil the end of that action, that other friendly operative can be treated as the active operative for the Magnify weapon rule.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('NEC','HIER24','','','PS',2,'0','Phase Shifter','Once per turning point, when an operative is shooting a friendly CRYPTEK operative, at the start of the Roll Defence Dice step, you can use this rule.\nIf you do, worsen the x of the Piercing weapon rule by 1 (if any) until the end of that sequence.\nNote that Piercing 1 would therefore be ignored.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('NEC','HIER24','','','TC',3,'0','Tesseract Cube','In the Ready step of each Strategy phase, when you gain CP, if a friendly CRYPTEK operative is not incapacitated, is not within control range of enemy operatives, and has not been REANIMATED this turning point,\nyou can use this rule.\nIf you do, roll one D6: on a 1, you cannot use this rule for the rest of the battle; on a 4+, you gain 1CP.\nOnce you have gained 2CP from this rule, you cannot use it for the rest of the battle.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('NEC','HIER24','','','TW',4,'0','Tesla Weave','Whenever an enemy operative ends the Charge action, inflict D3 damage on it for each friendly HIEROTEK CIRCLE operative within its control range.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('NEC','TW','','','DNS',0,'3','Devourer Nanoscarabs*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n\n<table width=\"100%\" class=\"eqtable\">\n<tr>\n	<th>Name</th>\n	 <th>A</th>\n	 <th>BS</th>\n	 <th>D</th>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n	<td>Devourer Nanoscarabs</td>\n	 <td>4</td>\n	 <td>3+</td>\n	 <td>3/4</td>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n	<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n	<td colspan=\"4\">\n		Rng [PENT], Lim, Indirect, Lethal 5+\n	 </td>\n </tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('NEC','TW','','','HB',0,'2','Hyperphase Blade','Select one Bayonet the operative is equipped with. That weapon gains the Lethal 5+ special rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepname:bayonet','SR:Lethal 5+','','','Equipment'),('NEC','TW','','','MS',0,'3','Mindshackle Scarabs*','The operative can perform the following action during the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Mindshackle (1 AP)</strong><br/>\nSelect one enemy operative within [SQUARE] of and visible to this operative and roll 1D6.\nIf the result is higher than that enemy operative\'s APL characteristic, subtract 1 from its APL.\nIf the result is more than double that enemy operative\'s APL, you can immediately perform a free Shoot or Fight action with that enemy operative as if it was a friendly operative.\nThis operative can only perform this action once.','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('NEC','TW','','','SC',0,'2','Starfire Core','Select one Gauss Flayer, Gauss Reaper, or Gauss Blaster the operative is equipped with. That weapon gains the following special rule for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Starfire Core:</strong> \nEach time a friendly operative makes a shooting attack with this weapon, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that shooting attack, if you retain any critical hits, you can retain one of your failed hits as a successful normal hit.','WepMod','','','','','Equipment'),('NEC','TW','','','SW',0,'3','Sempiternal Weave*','DEATHMARK LEADER or IMMORTAL LEADER operative only. \nThe operative has a Save characteristic of 2+ for the battle','OpMod','SV','2+','','','Equipment'),('NEC','TW','','','TW',0,'2','Tesla Weave','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Tesla Weave:</strong> Each time an enemy operative finishes a Charge action within Engagement Range of this operative, roll 3D6. \nFor each result of 5+, that enemy operative suffers 1 Mortal Wound.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('ORK','GSK','','','BP',0,'3','Bosspole*','BOSS NOB or KOMMANDO NOB operative only. Add 1  to \nthe operative\'s APL for the battle.','OpMod','APL','3','','','Equipment'),('ORK','GSK','','','CN',0,'2','Cuttin\' Nozzle','BURNA BOY operative only. The operative is equipped with \nthe following melee weapon for the battle: \n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n	<tr>\n		<th>Name</th>\n        <th>A</th>\n        <th>WS</th>\n        <th>D</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n		<td>Cuttin\' Nozzle</td>\n        <td>4</td>\n        <td>3+</td>\n        <td>3/5</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n		<td colspan=\"4\">\n			Lethal 5+\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('ORK','GSK','','','DM',0,'2','Drum Mag','Select one shoota or big shoota this operative is equipped \nwith. That weapon gains the Ceaseless special rule for \nthe battle. ','WepMod','wepname:shoota','SR:Ceaseless','','','Equipment'),('ORK','GSK','','','EA',0,'2','\'Eavy armour','Operative with a 5+ Save characteristic only. Change the \noperative\'s Save characteristic to 4+ for the battle. ','OpMod','SV','4+','','','Equipment'),('ORK','GSK','','','KFF',0,'3','Kustom Force Field*','SPANNER operative only. The operative gains the following \nability for the battle: \n<br/>\n<strong>Kustom Force Field:</strong> Each time an operative makes a \nshooting attack, if the target is wholly within• of this \noperative and the operative making the shooting attack is not, \nthe target has a 5+ invulnerable save for that shooting attack. ','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('ORK','GSK','','','SB',0,'2','Stikkbomb*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n 	<tr>\n 		<th>Name</th>\n         <th>A</th>\n         <th>BS</th>\n         <th>D</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td>Stikkbomb</td>\n         <td>4</td>\n         <td>3+</td>\n         <td>2/4</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Lim, Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect</td>\n     </tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('ORK','GSK','','','TF',0,'3','Targetin\' Fing','Select one ranged weapon this operative is equipped \nwith (excluding a burna or a ranged weapon with the \nkombi special rule). Improve that weapon\'s Ballistic Skill \ncharacteristic by  1  for the battle (to a maximum of 4+).','WepMod','','','','','Equipment'),('ORK','KOM','','','BH-AMB',206,'0','Ambusher','<em>Battle Honour<br/></rm>\nOnce per battle, at the start or end of this operative\'s activatiohn, you can change its order.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('ORK','KOM','','','BH-DES',203,'0','Destructive','<em>Battle Honour<br/></rm>\nEach time this operative performs a Fight action, if it made a Charge action during that activation,\nits melee weapons gain the Relentless special rule for that combat.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('ORK','KOM','','','BH-IRR',202,'0','Irritable','<em>Battle Honour<br/></rm>\nWhile this operative has lost any wounds, add 1 to both Damage characteristics of its melee weapons.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('ORK','KOM','','','BH-SHI',204,'0','Shifty','<em>Battle Honour<br/></rm>\nEach time this operativet is the target of a shooting attack, before rolling Defence dice for that shooting attack,\nif it is in Cover and either has a Conceal order or is Ready, you can retain two dice as successful normal saves as a result of cover (instead of one).','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('ORK','KOM','','','BH-SK',201,'0','Skinna','<em>Battle Honour<br/></rm>\nEach time this operative fights in combat, when you would retain attack dice for that combat,\nyou can select one of your results of 5+ to be retained as a critical hit.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('ORK','KOM','','','BH-THG',205,'0','Thievin\' Git','<em>Battle Honour<br/></rm>\nBefore the battle, when selecting equipment from your stash, you can select one item of equipment to equip this operative with for 1 less EP (to a minimum of 0).','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('ORK','KOM','','','CH',0,'2','Choppa','The operative is equipped with the Choppa melee weapon for the battle\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n	<tr>\n		<th>Name</th>\n        <th>A</th>\n        <th>BS</th>\n        <th>D</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n		<td>Choppa</td>\n        <td>3</td>\n        <td>3+</td>\n        <td>4/5</td>\n    </tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('ORK','KOM','','','DYN',0,'4','Dynamite*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n 	<tr>\n 		<th>Name</th>\n         <th>A</th>\n         <th>BS</th>\n         <th>D</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td>Dynamite</td>\n         <td>4</td>\n         <td>3+</td>\n         <td>5/6</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Blast [CIRCLE], AP1, Indirect, Unwieldy, Lim</td>\n     </tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('ORK','KOM','','','HRP',0,'3','Harpoon*','<em>This equipment can be selected a maximum of two times.<br/></em>The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\r  <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\r  	<tr>\r  		<th>Name</th>\r          <th>A</th>\r          <th>BS</th>\r          <th>D</th>\r      </tr>\r      <tr>\r  		<td>Harpoon</td>\r          <td>4</td>\r          <td>4+</td>\r          <td>4/5</td>\r      </tr>\r      <tr>\r  		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\r      </tr>\r      <tr>\r  		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Stun</td>\r      </tr>\r  </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('ORK','KOM','','','RE-DW',403,'2','Devil\'s Whispa','A Slugga the operative is equipped with gains the following improvements for the battle:\n<ul>\n<li>Lethal 4+ special rule</li>\n<li>Silent special rule</li>\n</ul>','WepMod','wepname:slugga','SR:Lethal 4+, Silent','','','Rare Equipment'),('ORK','KOM','','','RE-FB',405,'2','Fungal Brew','The operative gains the following abilities for the battle:\n<ul>\n<li>Before the battle, remove one Battle Scar the operative has.</li>\n<li>During the battle, the operative cannot be injured.</li>\n<li>After the battle, the operative passes its Casualty test.</li>\n</ul>','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('ORK','KOM','','','RE-KK',406,'2','Klever Kap','Gain 1 CP for the battle.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('ORK','KOM','','','RE-MEB',402,'1/3','Mork\'s Eyeball','Select a Slugga, Dakka Shoota, Scoped Big Shoota or\nRokkit Launcha the operative is equipped with. Improve\nthe Ballistic Skill characteristic of that weapon by 1 for\nthe battle. If you selected a Slugga, that weapon loses\nthe Rng special rule for the battle and this rare\nequipment costs 1EP; otherwise, it costs 3EP.','WepMod','weptype:R','BS:-1','','','Rare Equipment'),('ORK','KOM','','','RE-SC',404,'2','Skraga\'s Choppa','A Choppa, Big Choppa, or Twin Choppas the operative is equipped with gains the Lethal 5+ special rule for the battle.','WepMod','weptype:M','SR:Lethal 5+','','','Rare Equipment'),('ORK','KOM','','','RE-SHSL',401,'2/3','Shiny Slugs','Select a Sslugga, Dakka Shoota or Scoped Big Shoota\nthe operative is equipped with. That weapon gains\nthe AP1 special rule for the battle. If you selected a\nSlugga, this rare equipment costs 2EP; otherwise, it\ncosts 3EP.','WepMod','weptype:R','SR:AP1','','','Rare Equipment'),('ORK','KOM','','','ROP',0,'1','Climbing Rope','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\r <br/\r <strong>Climbing Rope:</strong><br/>\r <li>Each time this operative ascends or descends a terrain feature while climbing, the first vertical distance of up to 3 [CIRCLE] it travels are counted as 1 [CIRCLE] for that climb.</li>\r <li>This operative only needs to be within [TRI] horizontally of a terrain feature in order to climb it.</li>\r <li>Each time this operative drops, the intended location can be any vertical distance from the level it occupies.</li>\r <li>Each time this operative drops, it counts any vertical distance it travels as half for that drop</li>','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('ORK','KOM','','','SLG',0,'2','Slugga','The operative is equipped with the Slugga ranged weapon for the battle.\n  <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n  	<tr>\n  		<th>Name</th>\n          <th>A</th>\n          <th>BS</th>\n          <th>D</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td>Slugga</td>\n          <td>4</td>\n          <td>4+</td>\n          <td>3/4</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT]</td>\n      </tr>\n  </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('ORK','KOM','','','SLH',0,'3','Sledgehammer*','<em>This equipment can be selected a maximum of two times.<br/></em>The operative is equipped with the following melee weapon for the battle:\r  <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\r  	<tr>\r  		<th>Name</th>\r          <th>A</th>\r          <th>BS</th>\r          <th>D</th>\r      </tr>\r      <tr>\r  		<td>Sledgehammer</td>\r          <td>4</td>\r          <td>3+</td>\r          <td>4/4</td>\r      </tr>\r      <tr>\r  		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\r      </tr>\r      <tr>\r  		<td colspan=\"4\">Stun</td>\r      </tr>\r  </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('ORK','KOM','','','SMG',0,'3','Smoke Grenade','The operative can perform the following action for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Smoke Grenade (1 AP):</strong><br/>\nPlace the centre of one Smoke token on a point within [PENT] of this operative. That token creates an area of smoke with a [CIRCLE] radius and unlimited upward height (but not below) measured from the centre of that token. Until the end of the Turning Point, an operative is Obscured if every Cover line drawn to it crosses an area of smoke. This operative can only perform this action once, and cannot perform this action if it is within Engagement Range of an enemy operative.','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('ORK','KOM','','','STB',0,'2','Stikkbomb*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n 	<tr>\n 		<th>Name</th>\n         <th>A</th>\n         <th>BS</th>\n         <th>D</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td>Stikkbomb</td>\n         <td>4</td>\n         <td>3+</td>\n         <td>2/4</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect, Lim</td>\n     </tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('ORK','KOM','','','STG',0,'2','Stun Grenade','The operative can perform the following action for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Stun Grenade (1 AP):</strong><br/>\nSelect one point on the battlefield within [PENT] of this operative. Roll one D6 for each operative within [CIRCLE] of that point, subtracting 1 from the result if they are not Visible to this operative. On a 4+, subtract 1 from that operative’s APL. This operative can only perform this action once, and cannot perform this action if it is within Engagement Range of an enemy operative.','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('ORK','KOM24','','','CHP',1,'0','Choppas','Friendly KOMMANDO operatives (excluding BOMB SQUIG and GROT) have the following melee weapon. Note that some operatives already have this weapon but with better stats, in that instance, use the better version.\r <table class=\"eqtable\">\r <tr>\r <th>Name</th><th>ATK</th><th>HIT</th><th>DMG</th><th>\r </tr>\r <tr>\r <td>Choppa</td><td>3</td><td>3+</td><td>4/5</td>\r </tr>\r </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('ORK','KOM24','','','CS',2,'0','Collapsible Stocks','Add 4\" to the range rule of the following ranged weapons that friendly KOMMANDO operatives have:\r <ul>\r <li>Dakka Shoota (Short Range)</li>\r <li>Shokka Pistol</li>\r <li>Slugga</li>\r </ul>','WepMod','','','','','Equipment'),('ORK','KOM24','','','DYN',3,'0','Dynamite','Once per battle, a friendly KOMMANDO operative (excluding BOMB SQUIG and GROT) can use the following Ranged Weapon:\n<table class=\"eqtable\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name</th><th>ATK</th><th>HIT</th><th>DMG</th><th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dynamite</td><td>5</td><td>4+</td><td>4/5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"4\">Weapon Rules</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rng 4\", Blast 1\", Heavy (RepositionOnly), Saturate</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('ORK','KOM24','','','HRP',4,'0','Harpoon','Once per turning point, a friendly KOMMANDO operative (excluding BOMB SQUIG and GROT) can use the following Ranged Weapon:\r <table class=\"eqtable\">\r <tr>\r <th>Name</th><th>ATK</th><th>HIT</th><th>DMG</th><th>\r </tr>\r <tr>\r <td>Harpoon</td><td>4</td><td>4+</td><td>4/5</td>\r </tr>\r <tr>\r <th colspan=\"4\">Weapon Rules</th>\r </tr>\r <tr>\r <td>Rng 8\", Lethal 5+, Stun</td>\r </tr>\r </table>','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','CM','','','B',0,'3','Bolas*','The operative can perform the following action during \nthe battle: \n<br/>\n<strong>Bolas (1 AP):</strong>\nSelect one enemy operative Visible to and within \n[PENT] of this operative, then roll 3D6 and add the \nresults together.  If the total is greater than that enemy \noperative\'s Wounds characteristic, subtract  1  from \nits APL. This operative can only perform this action \nonce, and cannot perform this action while within \nEngagement Range of enemy operatives. ','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','CM','','','KHR',0,'3','Kroot Hunting Rifle','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle: \n <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n 	<tr>\n 		<th>Name</th>\n 		<th>A</th>\n 		<th>BS</th>\n 		<th>D</th>\n 	</tr>\n 	<tr>\n 		<td>Kroot Hunting Rifle</td>\n 		<td>4</td>\n 		<td>4+</td>\n 		<td>3/3</td>\n 	</tr>\n 	<tr>\n 		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n 	</tr>\n 	<tr>\n 		<td colspan=\"4\">\n 			Heavy, Silent, MW1\n 		</td>\n 	</tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','CM','','','SB',0,'2','Skinning Blade','The operative is equipped with the following melee weapon for the battle: \n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n	<tr>\n		<th>Name</th>\n		<th>A</th>\n		<th>WS</th>\n		<th>D</th>\n	</tr>\n	<tr>\n		<td>Skinning Blade</td>\n		<td>4</td>\n		<td>3+</td>\n		<td>3/5</td>\n	</tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','CM','','','SFC',0,'2','Sure-Foot Charm*','The operative gains the following ability for the battle: \n<br/>\n<strong>Sure-foot Charm:</strong>  Each time this operative is activated, you \ncan select one other ready friendly CADRE MERCENARY\noperative within [SQUARE] of  and Visible to it.  After this operative\'s \nactivation ends, you can activate that friendly operative. ','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','CM','','','TP',0,'3','Trophy Pistol','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle: \n <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n 	<tr>\n 		<th>Name</th>\n 		<th>A</th>\n 		<th>BS</th>\n 		<th>D</th>\n 	</tr>\n 	<tr>\n 		<td>Trophy Pistol</td>\n 		<td>4</td>\n 		<td>4+</td>\n 		<td>3/4</td>\n 	</tr>\n 	<tr>\n 		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n 	</tr>\n 	<tr>\n 		<td colspan=\"4\">\n 			Bal, Blast [TRI], Rng [PENT]\n 		</td>\n 	</tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','FSKB','','','BH-CD',206,'0','Clandestine','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>If this operative has a Conceal order and is in Cover provided by Light terrain, enemy operatives cannot treat it as being on an Engage order as a result of Vantage Point.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('TAU','FSKB','','','BH-EOTM',202,'0','Eye On The Mark','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>Each time this operative makes a shooting attack during its activation, if it has not yet moved during that activation,\r ranged weapons it is equipped with (excluding Quill Grenades) gain the No Cover special rule for that shooting attack.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('TAU','FSKB','','','BH-LP',205,'0','Leathery Physiology','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>Each time this operative would lose a Wound as a result of an Attack die that inflicts 4 damage or less, roll 1D6: on a 6, that Wound is not lost.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('TAU','FSKB','','','BH-SAV',201,'0','Savage','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of  melee weapons this operative is equipped with (to a maximum of 4).','WepMod','weptype:M','A:+1','','','Battle Honour'),('TAU','FSKB','','','BH-TRP',203,'0','Trapper','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>This operative can perform a Charge action if it has a Conceal order.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('TAU','FSKB','','','BH-WIR',204,'0','Wiry','<em>Battle Honour<br/></em>Each time this operative makes any kind of move, it can move aroun, across, and over other operatives (and their bases) as if they were not there, but must finish its move following all requirements specified by that move,\r and cannot finish its move on top of other operatives (or their bases).','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('TAU','FSKB','','','KP',6,'1','Kroot Pistol','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n 	<tr>\n 		<th>Name</th>\n         <th>A</th>\n         <th>BS</th>\n         <th>D</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td>Kroot Pistol</td>\n         <td>4</td>\n         <td>4+</td>\n         <td>3/4</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT]</td>\n     </tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','FSKB','','','MEAT',3,'1','Meat','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/><br/>\n<strong>Meat:</strong>\nOnce during the battle, when this operative is activated, you can use this ability. \nIf you do so, this operative regains D3+1 lost wounds.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','FSKB','','','PS',1,'2','Piercing Shot','Operative equipped with a Kroot Rifle, Kroot Pistol, or Dual Kroot Pistols only.\nThe operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle (its BS characteristic is the same as the Kroot Rifle or Kroot Pistol the operative is equipped with):\n <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n 	<tr>\n 		<th>Name</th>\n         <th>A</th>\n         <th>BS</th>\n         <th>D</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td>Piercing Shot</td>\n         <td>4</td>\n         <td>*</td>\n         <td>3/4</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td colspan=\"4\">AP1, Limited</td>\n     </tr>\n </table>\nUnless the operative is equipped with a Kroot rifle, this ranged weapon has the Rng [PENT] special rule.','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','FSKB','','','QG',0,'2','Quill Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n  <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n  	<tr>\n  		<th>Name</th>\n          <th>A</th>\n          <th>BS</th>\n          <th>D</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td>Quill Grenade</td>\n          <td>4</td>\n          <td>3+</td>\n          <td>2/3</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Blast [CIRCLE], Lim, Indirect, No Overwatch</td>\n      </tr>\n  </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','FSKB','','','RB',5,'2','Ritual Blade*','KROOT KILL-BROKER operative only.\r Instead of its Blade, the operative is equipped with the following melee weapon for the battle:\r  <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\r  	<tr>\r  		<th>Name</th>\r          <th>A</th>\r          <th>BS</th>\r          <th>D</th>\r      </tr>\r      <tr>\r  		<td>Ritual Blade</td>\r          <td>4</td>\r          <td>2+</td>\r          <td>4/5</td>\r      </tr>\r  </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','FSKB','','','RE-AFL',404,'2','Ancient Flintlock','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>Select one Kroot Pistol, Kroot Rifle, Kroot Scattergun, or dual Kroot Pistols this operative is equipped with.\r It gains the Lethal 5+ special rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepid:DKP,KP,KR,KSG','SR:Lethal 5+','','','Rare Equipment'),('TAU','FSKB','','','RE-KB',401,'3','Kinblade','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>KROOT KILL-BROKER operative only. Insteaad of its Blade, the operative is equipped with the following melee weapon for the battle:\r <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\r <tr>\r <th>Name</th><th>A</th><th>WS</th><th>D</th>\r </tr>\r <tr>\r <td>Kinblade</td><td>3</td><td>2+</td><td>4/5</td>\r </tr>\r <tr>\r <th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\r </tr>\r <tr>\r <td colspan=\"4\">Balanced, Rending</td>\r </tr>\r </table>','Weapon','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('TAU','FSKB','','','RE-KH',402,'2','Knarloc Hide','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\r <strong>Knarloc Hide:</strong> \r Each time an enemy operative fights in combat with or makes a shooting attack against this operative, subtract 1 from both Damage characteristics of weapons that enemy operative is equipped with for that combat or shooting attack (to a minimum of 2).','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('TAU','FSKB','','','RE-KHT',403,'3','Kroothawk Totem','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\r <strong>Kroothawk Totem:</strong> \r Once per battle, after rolling off to deterine initiative, this operative can use this ability. If it does so, you can re-roll your die.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('TAU','FSKB','','','RE-KT',405,'2','Kin Totem','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\r <strong>Kin Totem:</strong>\r While a friendly FARSTALKER KINBAND operative is Visible To and within [SQUARE] of this operative, it is not treated as being injured (only ignore modifiers to its Movement characteristics as a result of being injured if it is activated within [SQUARE] of this operative).','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('TAU','FSKB','','','RE-WM',406,'1','Windmark','<em>Rare Equipment</em><br/>The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\r <strong>Windmark:</strong>\r Add [TRI] to this operative\'s Movement characteristic for the battle.','OpMod','M','+[TRI]','','','Rare Equipment'),('TAU','FSKB','','','TROPHY',4,'3','Trophy','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/><br/>\n<strong>Trophy:</strong>\nOnce during the battle, when this operative is activated, you can use this ability. \nIf you do so, add 1 to this operative\'s APL.\nEach Turning Point, only one friendly operative can use this ability.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','FSKB','','','TS',2,'2','Toxin Shot','Operative equipped with a Kroot Rifle, Kroot Pistol, or Dual Kroot Pistols only.\nThe operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle (its BS characteristic is the same as the Kroot Rifle or Kroot Pistol the operative is equipped with):\n <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n 	<tr>\n 		<th>Name</th>\n         <th>A</th>\n         <th>BS</th>\n         <th>D</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td>Toxin Shot</td>\n         <td>4</td>\n         <td>*</td>\n         <td>2/2</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td colspan=\"4\">Lethal 5+, Limited, Stun</td>\n     </tr>\n </table>\nUnless the operative is equipped with a Kroot rifle, this ranged weapon has the Rng [PENT] special rule.','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','FSKB24','','','MEAT',3,'0','Meat','Once per turning point, when a friendly FARSTALKER KINBAND operative (excluding HOUND) is activated, if it’s not within control range of enemy operatives, you can use this rule. If you do, that friendly operative regains D3+1 lost wounds.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','FSKB24','','','PS',1,'0','Piercing Shot','Once per turning point, when a friendly FARSTALKER KINBAND operative is performing the Shoot action and you select a Kroot rifle, Kroot scattergun or dual Kroot pistols (focused), you can use this rule.\nIf you do, until the end of that action, that weapon has the Piercing 1 weapon rule.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','FSKB24','','','TRP',4,'0','Trophy','Once per battle, when a friendly FARSTALKER KINBAND operative (excluding HOUND) is activated, if it’s not within control range of enemy operatives, you can use this rule.\nIf you do, add 1 to that friendly operative’s APL stat until the end of its activation.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','FSKB24','','','TS',2,'0','Toxin Shot','Once per turning point, when a friendly FARSTALKER KINBAND operative is performing the Shoot action and you select a Kroot rifle, Kroot scattergun or dual Kroot pistols (focused), you can use this rule.\nIf you do, until the end of that action, that weapon has the Lethal 5+ and Stun weapon rules.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','HC','','','HR',0,'2','Holographic Readout*','LEADER operative only. The operative gains the following \nability for the battle: \n<br/>\n<strong>Holographic Readout:</strong>\nOnce per battle, when a friendly \nHUNTER CADRE operative (excluding a DRONE operative) \nis activated within [SQUARE] of this operative, this operative can use \nthis ability.  If it does so, until the end of the friendly HUNTER \nCADRE operative\'s activation, it can perform one mission \naction for one less AP (to a minimum of 0 AP). ','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','HC','','','ML',0,'2','Markerlight','The operative can perform the following action during \nthe battle: <br/>\n<strong>Markerlight (l AP):</strong> \nSelect one enemy operative Visible to this operative. That \nenemy operative gains one Markerlight token until the \nend of  the Turning Point. This operative cannot perform \nthis action while within Engagement Range of enemy \noperatives.  If an  operative would perform this  action and \na Shoot action in the same activation, only the target of \nthat Shoot action\'s shooting attack can be selected for \nthis action. \n<br/><br/>\nEach time a shooting attack is made against an enemy \noperative, in the Roll Attack  Dice step of that shooting \nattack, if that enemy operative has one or  more Markerlight \ntokens, you can re-roll one of your attack dice. ','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','HC','','','PG',0,'2','Photon Grenade','The operative can perform the following action during \n the battle: <br/>\n <strong>Photon  Grenade  (1 AP):</strong>\n Select one enemy operative Visible \n to this operative. Roll one D6, subtracting 1 from the result \n as follows: \n <ul>\n <li>If that enemy operative is not in this operative\'s Line of Sight. </li>\n <li>If that enemy operative is more than [PENT] from this operative. </li>\n </ul>\n On a  2+, that enemy operative gains a Photon token. While \n an operative has any photon tokens, subtract [CIRCLE] from its \n Movement characteristic and it cannot perform Dash  actions. \n At the end of an operative\'s activation, remove all Photon \n tokens it has. This operative cannot perform this action while \n within Engagement Range of enemy operatives. ','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','HC','','','SI',0,'3','Stimulant Injector*','The operative gains the following ability for the battle: \n<br/>\n<strong>Stimulant Injector:</strong>\nOnce per battle, when this operative is \nactivated or would lose a wound, it can use this ability.  If it \ndoes so, until the end of the Turning Point: \n<ul>\n<li>Each time this operative would lose a wound, roll one D6: on a  5+, that wound is not lost. </li>\n<li>It cannot be injured. </li>\n<li>You  can ignore any or all modifiers to its APL.</li>\n</ul>','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','HC','','','TL',0,'3','Target Lock','STEALTH BATTLESUIT operative only. The operative gains the \nfollowing ability for the battle: \n<br/>\n<strong>Target Lock:</strong>\n Each time this operative makes a shooting \nattack, in the Roll Attack  Dice step of that shooting attack, \nthe target is treated as having a  Markerlight token. ','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','PF','','','BH-CH',203,'0','Cunning Hunter','Each time this operative makes a shooting attack, before rolling your Attack Dice, if it has not performed a Normal Move, Fall Back, Dash, or Charge action during that activation, you can retain one as a successful normal hit without rolling it.\nYou cannot use this ability and the Merciless Hunter ability during the same shooting attack.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('TAU','PF','','','BH-CUF',206,'0','Capable Under Fire','If this operative has a Conceal order and is in Cover provided by Light Terrain, enemy operatives cannot treat it as being on an Engage order as a result of a Vantage Point.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('TAU','PF','','','BH-FTGG',201,'0','For The Greater Good','This operative can perform the Markerlight action twice during its activation. In addition, when this operative is incapacitated, it can perform a free Markerlight action, even if it is within Engagement Range of an enemy operative.\nIf this operative cannot perform the Markerlight action, determine a different Battle Honour for it.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('TAU','PF','','','BH-MH',204,'0','Merciless Hunter','Each time this operative makes a shooting attack, before rolling your Attack Dice, if the target is within [PENT] of it, you can retain one as a successful normal hit without rolling it.\nYou cannot use this ability and the Cunning Hunter ability during the same shooting attack.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('TAU','PF','','','BH-MP',205,'0','Martial Philosopher','When a friendly SHAS\'UI operative uses its Art of War ability, you can select which Art of War this operative benefits from (it can be a different Art of War to waht other friendly operatives benefit from).','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('TAU','PF','','','BH-RS',202,'0','Reliant Support','Each time you would use the Supporting Tactical Fire Ploy and select this operative, that Tactical Ploy costs 0 CP for that use.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('TAU','PF','','','CE',0,'1','Climbing Equipment','The operative gains the following ability:\r  <br/>\r  <strong>Climbing Equipment:</strong>\r  <li>Each time this operative ascends or descends a terrain feature while climbing, the first vertical distance of up to 3 [CIRCLE] it travels are counted as [CIRCLE] for that climb.</li>\r  <li>This operative only needs to be within [TRI] horizontally of a terrain feature in order to climb it.</li>\r  <li>Each time this operative drops, the intended location can be any vertical distance from the level it occupies.</li>\r  <li>Each time this operative drops, it counts any vertical distance it travels as half for that drop.</li>','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','PF','','','DRK',0,'2','Drone Repair Kit','The operative can perform the following action during the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Repair Drone (1 AP):</strong>\nSelect one friendly PATHFINDER DRONE operative Visible to and within [TRI] of this operative. It regains D3 lost wounds. If the operative performing this action is a Drone Controller Pathfinder operative, the selected operative regains 3 lost wounds instead. This operative cannot perform this action if it is within Engagement Range of an enemy operative.','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','PF','','','EMP',0,'2','EMP Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n<br/>\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n 	<tr>\n 		<th>Name</th>\n 		<th>A</th>\n 		<th>BS</th>\n 		<th>D</th>\n 	</tr>\n 	<tr>\n 		<td>EMP Grenade</td>\n 		<td>4</td>\n 		<td>3+</td>\n 		<td>2/3</td>\n 	</tr>\n 	<tr>\n 		<th colspan=\"4\">\n 			Special Rules\n 		</th>\n 	</tr>\n 	<tr>\n 		<td colspan=\"4\">\n 			Rng [PENT], Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect, EMP*, Lim\n 		</td>\n 	</tr>\n </table>\n<strong>*EMP:</strong> Each time a friendly operative makes a shooting attack with this weapon, this weapon has the Lethal X special rule for that shooting attack. X is the target’s unmodified Save characteristic.','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','PF','','','FG',0,'4','Fusion Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle. It cannot make a shooting attack with this weapon by performing an Overwatch action.\r <br/>\r <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\r  	<tr>\r  		<th>Name</th>\r  		<th>A</th>\r  		<th>BS</th>\r  		<th>D</th>\r  	</tr>\r  	<tr>\r  		<td>Fusion Grenade</td>\r  		<td>4</td>\r  		<td>3+</td>\r  		<td>4/3</td>\r  	</tr>\r  	<tr>\r  		<th colspan=\"4\">\r  			Special Rules\r  		</th>\r  	</tr>\r  	<tr>\r  		<td colspan=\"4\">\r  			Rng [PENT], Indirect, AP2, Lim, MW3\r  		</td>\r  	</tr>\r  </table>\r ','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','PF','','','HIML',0,'2','High-Intensity Markerlight','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>High-Intensity Markerlight:</strong> Each time this operative performs the Markerlight action, the selected enemy operative gains 2 markerlight tokens instead of 1.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','PF','','','OSUL',0,'3','Orbital Survey Uplink*','The operative can perform the following action during the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Orbital Scan (2 AP):</strong>\nSelect one enemy operative. That operative, and each enemy operative within [TRI] of it, gains 1 Markerlight token if they are visible to an orbital scan (determine each operative separately). An operative is not visible to an orbital scan if any part of its base is hidden by a terrain feature from directly above.','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','PF','','','PG',0,'2','Photon Grenade','The operative can perform the following action during the battle:<br/>\n <strong>Photon Grenade (1 AP):</strong>\n Select one enemy operative Visible to this operative. Roll one D6, subtracting 1 from the result as follows:\n <ul>\n <li>If that enemy operative is not in this operative’s Line of Sight.</li>\n <li>If that enemy operative is more than [PENT] from this operative.</li>\n </ul>\n On a 2+, that enemy operative gains a Photon token. While an operative has any Photon tokens, subtract [CIRCLE] from its Movement characteristic and it cannot perform Dash actions. At the end of an operative’s activation, remove all Photon tokens it has. This operative can only perform this action once, and cannot perform this action if it is within Engagement Range of an enemy operative.\n ','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','PF','','','RE-ACC',403,'1','Advanced Cogitation Chip','DRONE operative only. The operative gains the following abilities for the battle:<br/>\n<ul>\n<li>It is not considered to have the first three bullet points of its Artificial Intelligence ability</li>\n</ul>','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('TAU','PF','','','RE-EPA',401,'2','Experimental Pulse Ammunition','Select a Pulse weapon the operative is equipped with. It gains the following improvements for the battle:\n<ul>\n<li>It gains the P1 special rule</li>\n<li>Add 1 to both its Damage characteristics</li>\n</ul>','WepMod','wepname:pulse','SR:P1|D:1/1','','','Rare Equipment'),('TAU','PF','','','RE-HB',402,'1','Honour Blade','SHAS\'UI PATHFINDER operative only. The Bonding Knife the operative is equipped with gains the following improvements for the battle:\n<ul>\n<li>Improve its WS characteristic by 1</li>\n<li>Add 1 to both its Damage characteristics</li>\n</ul>','WepMod','wepname:bonding knife','BS:-1|D:1/1','','','Rare Equipment'),('TAU','PF','','','RE-MLG',405,'2','Markerlight Grenade','The operative can perform the following action once during the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Markerlight Grenade (1 AP):</strong>\nSelect one point in the killzone Visible to this operative.\nRoll 1D6 for each enemy operative within [SQUARE] of that point, subtracting 1 from the result as follows:\n<ul>\n<li>If that enemy operative is not Visible to this operative</li>\n<li>If that enemy operative is more than [PENT] from this operative</li>\n</ul>\nOn a 2+, that enemy operative gains 1 Markerlight Token.','Action','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('TAU','PF','','','RE-PF',406,'2','Projection Field','The operative can perform the following action once during the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Projection Field (1 AP):</strong>\nChange this operative\'s order.','Action','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('TAU','PF','','','RE-SG',404,'2','Shield Generator','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<ul>\n<li>This operative has a 4+ Invulnerable Save</li>\n</ul>','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('TAU','PF','','','TAO',0,'2','Target Analysis Optic','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Target Analysis:</strong> Each time this operative makes a shooting attack, enemy operatives with at least one Markerlight token are considered to have one additional Markerlight token for that shooting attack.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','PF24','','','HIML',3,'0','High-Intensity Markerlight','Once per turning point, when a friendly PATHFINDER operative (excluding MV7 MARKER DRONE) performs the Markerlight action, you can use this rule.\nIf you do, the enemy operative you select gains two of your Markerlight tokens (instead of one).','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','PF24','','','OSUL',2,'0','Orbital Survey Uplink','Once per turning point, when a friendly PATHFINDER operative performs the Markerlight action, you can use this rule.\nIf you do, you can select one enemy operative in the killzone to gain one of your Markerlight tokens instead (it doesn’t need to be visible).\nThis is not cumulative with the high-intensity Markerlight or Analyse rules.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','PF24','','','PG',4,'0','Photon Grenade','Once per turning point, a friendly PATHFINDER operative that has the Markerlight action on their datacard (excluding DRONE) can perform the following unique action:<br/>\n<strong>PHOTON GRENADE (1 AP):</strong><br/>\nSelect a valid target for this operative and roll one D6:<br/>\nOn a 3+, until the end of that operative’s next activation, subtract 2\" from its Move stat and it cannot perform the Dash action.</br>\nAn operative cannot perform this action while within control range of an enemy operative.','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','PF24','','','TAO',1,'0','Target Analysis Optic','Once per turning point, when a friendly PATHFINDER operative (excluding DRONE) is performing the Shoot action and you’re selecting a valid target, you can use this rule.\nIf you do, until the end of that action, if the target has at least one of your Markerlight tokens, it is treated as having one more. If the ranged weapon has the Blast or Torrent weapon rule, only the primary target is affected.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','VESP','','','AGS',2,'0','Aggression Stimulant','Whenever a friendly VESPID STINGWING operative (excluding OVERSIGHT DRONE) is fighting, its melee weapons have the Ceaseless weapon rule.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','VESP','','','AS',2,'0','Accelerant Stimulant','Whenever a friendly VESPID STINGWING operative (excluding OVERSIGHT DRONE) performs the Charge or Dash action, it can move an additional 1\". If it uses FLY for this action, you can set it back up 1\" further away.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','VESP','','','CS',2,'0','Convergence Stimulant','Once per Turning Point, a friendly VESPID STINGWING operative can perform the Pick Up Marker or a mission action without spending a Communion point.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TAU','VESP','','','NS',1,'0','Neurostimulant','In the Ready step of each Strategy phase, when determining how many Communion points to gain, you can roll two D3 and select one D3 to use.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TYR','BBRO','','','BH-AMB',205,'0','Ambusher','Each time this operative fights in combat or makes a shooting attack against an enemy operative that hsa a Crossfire token, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat or shooting attack, you can spend one Crossfire token for free. This is not cumulative with the Psiren Caster ability.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('TYR','BBRO','','','BH-CLD',201,'0','Clandestine','If this operative has a Conceal order and is in Cover provided by Light Terrain, enemy operatives cannot treat it as being on an Engage order as a result of a Vantage Point.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('TYR','BBRO','','','BH-INF',202,'0','Infiltrator','In the Select Equipment step, when selecting equipment from your stash, you can equip this operative with Covert Guise for 1 EP.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('TYR','BBRO','','','BH-INS',203,'0','Insurrectionist','Each time a shooting attack is made against this operative, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, if it is in Cover, you can retain one die as a successful critical save instead of a normal save as a result of Cover.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('TYR','BBRO','','','BH-SA',204,'0','Symbiotic Assailant','Each time this operative fights in combat or makes a shooting attack against an enemy operative that has a Crossfire token, its weapons gain the Lethal 5+ special rule for that combat or shooting attack.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('TYR','BBRO','','','BH-SCR',206,'0','Scurry','While this operative has a Conceal order, add [TRI] to its Movement characteristic.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('TYR','BBRO','','','CG',2,'3','Covert Guise','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Covert Guise:</strong>\nAt the end of the Scouting step, if this operative is wholly within your drop zone and has a Conceal order, it can perform a free Dash action. If it does so, its order cannot be changed during the first Turning Point (e.g. as a result of the Infiltrate option in the Scouting step).','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TYR','BBRO','','','CK',6,'1','Cult Knife','The operative is equipped with the following melee weapon for the battle:\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr>\n	<th>Name</th>\n	  <th>A</th>\n	  <th>BS</th>\n	  <th>D</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n	<td>Cult Knife</td>\n	  <td>4</td>\n	  <td>4+</td>\n	  <td>2/3</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('TYR','BBRO','','','CT',1,'2','Cult Talisman','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Cult Talisman:</strong>\nOnce per battle, when a shooting attack is made against this operative, in the Resolve Successful Hits step of that shooting attack, you can change one of your retained normal saves to a critical save.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TYR','BBRO','','','FG',7,'2','Frag Grenade','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n <tr>\n <th>Name</th>\n <th>A</th>\n <th>BS</th>\n <th>D</th>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n <td>Frag Grenade</td>\n <td>4</td>\n <td>3+</td>\n <td>2/3</td>\n <tr><th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th></td>\n <tr><td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect, Limited</td></td>\n </tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('TYR','BBRO','','','HSCP',5,'2','Hot-Shot Capacitor Pack','Add 1 to both Damage characteristics of Lasguns and Laspistols the operative is equipped with for the battle.','WepMod','wepid:LG,LP','D:1/1','','','Equipment'),('TYR','BBRO','','','KG',8,'3','Krak Grenade','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br/>\n   <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n   	<tr>\n   		<th>Name</th>\n           <th>A</th>\n           <th>WS</th>\n           <th>D</th>\n       </tr>\n       <tr>\n   		<td>Krak Grenade</td>\n   		<td>4</td>\n           <td>3+</td>\n           <td>4/5</td>\n       </tr>\n       <tr>\n   		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n       </tr>\n       <tr>\n   		<td colspan=\"4\">\n   			Rng [PENT], AP1, Indirect, Lim, No Overwatch\n           </td>\n       </tr>\n   </table>','Weapon',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Equipment'),('TYR','BBRO','','','LG',3,'2','Lasgun','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\r <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\r <tr>\r 	<th>Name</th>\r 	  <th>A</th>\r 	  <th>BS</th>\r 	  <th>D</th>\r   </tr>\r   <tr>\r 	<td>Lasgun</td>\r 	  <td>4</td>\r 	  <td>4+</td>\r 	  <td>2/3</td>\r   </tr>\r </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('TYR','BBRO','','','LP',4,'1','Laspistol','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr>\n	<th>Name</th>\n	  <th>A</th>\n	  <th>BS</th>\n	  <th>D</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n	<td>Laspistol</td>\n	  <td>4</td>\n	  <td>4+</td>\n	  <td>2/3</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n	<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n	<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT]</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('TYR','BBRO','BBRO','MDC','RE-BPV',402,'2','Biophagic Vial','MEDIC operative only. The operative can perform the following action during the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Experimental Alchemy (1 AP):</strong>\nSelect one friendly BROODGUARD operative Visible To and within [TRI] of this operative, then roll 1D6:\n<ul>\n<li>On a 1, that operative suffers 1D6 Mortal Wounds</li>\n<li>On a 2+, until the end of the battle, add 1 to both Damage characteristics of that operative\'s melee weapons</li>\n<li>On a 4+, until the end of the battle, each time that operative fights in combat or a shooting attack is made against it, subtract 1 from both Damage characteristics of the enemy operative\'s weapons for that combat or shooting attack (to a minimum of 2).</li>\n</ul>\nThis operative cannot perform this action while within Engagement Range of an enemy operative.','Action','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('TYR','BBRO','','','RE-BTCK',403,'2','Bio-Toxin Cult Knife','The operative is equipped with the following melee weapon for the battle:<br/>\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>A</th>\n<th>BS</th>\n<th>D</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bio-Toxin Cult Knife</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>3+</td>\n<td>3/5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\">Lethal 5+</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>','Weapon','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('TYR','BBRO','BBRO','AGIT','RE-PBA',404,'2','Psibilance Amplifier','AGITATOR operative only. Add [CIRCLE] to the distance of the operative\'s Psiren Caster ability for the battle.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('TYR','BBRO','BBRO','VOX','RE-SV',406,'1','Sire\'s Voice','VOX OPERATOR operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Sire\'s Voice:</strong>\nEach time after this operative performs the Signal action, it can select any friendly operative in the killzone, rather than Visible to and within [PENT] of it.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('TYR','BBRO','BBRO','SNP','RE-WSR',405,'1','Wyrmshriek Rounds','SNIPER operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Wyrmshriek Rounds:</strong>\nEach time after this operative makes a shooting attack, every other enemy operative within [CIRCLE] of the target gains a Crossfire token.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('TYR','BBRO','','','RE-XCA',401,'2','Xenos Chitin Amulet','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\r <strong>Xenos Chitin Amulet:</strong>\r You can use the Idolisation Tactical Ploy for 0CP if this is the BROOD BROTHER operative the attack dice were rolled for, and it does not have to be within [PENT].','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('TYR','BBRO24','','','CD',1,'0','Covert Disguises','After revealing this equipment option, roll 1D3.\nAs a STRATEGIC GAMBIT in the first turning point, a number of friendly BROOD BROTHER BROODGUARD operatives equal to the result that are wholly within your drop zone can immediately perform a free\nReposition action, but must end that move wholly within 3\" of your drop zone.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TYR','BBRO24','','','CK',2,'0','Cult Knives','Friendly BROOD BROTHER BROODGUARD operatives have the following melee weapon:\n<table class=\"eqtable\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name</th><th>ATK</th><th>HIT</th><th>DMG</th><th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cult Knife</td><td>3</td><td>4+</td><td>3/4</td>\n</tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('TYR','BBRO24','','','CT',3,'0','Cult Talisman','Once per turning point, when an operative is shooting a friendly BROOD BROTHER operative (Excluding Patriarch), in the roll defence dice step, you can retain one of your normal successes as a critical success instead.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TYR','BBRO24','','','LO',4,'0','Lookout','STRATEGIC GAMBIT: Select one enemy operative visible to a friendly BROOD BROTHER operative to gain one of your Crossfire tokens.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TYR','BC','','','BC',0,'2','Blasting Charge*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n 	<tr>\n 		<th>Name</th>\n         <th>A</th>\n         <th>BS</th>\n         <th>D</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td>Blasting Charge</td>\n 		<td>4</td>\n         <td>3+</td>\n         <td>2/3</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td colspan=\"4\">\n 			Rng [PENT], Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect, Lim\n         </td>\n     </tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('TYR','BC','','','DC',0,'4','Demolition Charge*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n 	<tr>\n 		<th>Name</th>\n         <th>A</th>\n         <th>BS</th>\n         <th>D</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td>Demolition Charge</td>\n 		<td>4</td>\n         <td>3+</td>\n         <td>5/6</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td colspan=\"4\">\n 			Rng [PENT], Blast [CIRCLE], AP1, Indirect, Unwieldy, Lim\n         </td>\n     </tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('TYR','BC','','','FV',0,'1','Flash Visor','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Flash Visor:</strong>\nEach time this operative is activated, you can ignore any modifiers to its APL.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TYR','BC','','','HWB',0,'2','Heavy Weapon Bipod','Select one ranged weapon the NEOPHYTE HYBRID HEAVY GUNNER operative is equipped with that has the Heavy special rule. That weapon gains the following special rule for the battle:\n <br/>\n <strong>Heavy Weapon Bipod:</strong>\n Each time this operative makes a shooting attack with this weapon, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that shooting attack, if the operative has not moved during the Turning Point, you can re-roll one of your Attack dice.','WepMod','','','','','Equipment'),('TYR','BC','','','MTR',0,'3','Mining Tool Rig','Select one Heavy Rock Cutter, Heavy Rock Drill, or Heavy Rock Saw the ACOLYTE HYBRID FIGHTER operative is equipped with.\nThat weapon gains the Relentless special rule for the battle.','WepMod','wepname:heavy rock','SR:Relentless','','','Equipment'),('TYR','BC','','','SS',0,'3','Structural Surveyor*','The operative can perform the following action during the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Structural Surveyor (1 AP):</strong>\nSelect one terrain feature within [PENT] of this operative, then select one friendly BROOD COVEN operative Visible to and within [SQUARE] of this operative.\nUntil the end of the Turning Point, each time that operative makes a shooting attack:\n<ul>\n<li>That terrain feature is not Obscuring for that shooting attack</li>\n<li>Defence dice cannot be automatically retained as a result of Cover from that terrain feature (they must be rolled instead).</li>\n</ul>','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('TYR','HF','','','AG',0,'2','Adrenal Glands','Add [TRI] to the operative\'s Movement characteristic for the battle.','OpMod','M','+[TRI]','','','Equipment'),('TYR','HF','','','AM',0,'2','Acid Maw','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br/>\n<table width=\"100%\" class=\"eqtable\">\n	<tr>\n		<th>Name</th>\n        <th>A</th>\n        <th>BS</th>\n        <th>D</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n		<td>Acid Maw</td>\n        <td>4</td>\n        <td>2+</td>\n        <td>3/3</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Splash 1</td>\n    </tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('TYR','HF','','','EC',0,'2/3','Extended Chitin','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Extended Chitin:</strong> \nEach time a shooting attack is made against this operative, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, you may re-roll one of your Defence Dice.<br/>\nIf the operative is a TYRANID WARRIOR, this equipment costs 3 EP, otherwise it costs 2 EP.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TYR','HF','','','FH',0,'2','Flesh Hooks','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br/>\n <table width=\"100%\" class=\"eqtable\">\n 	<tr>\n 		<th>Name</th>\n         <th>A</th>\n         <th>BS</th>\n         <th>D</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td>Flesh Hooks</td>\n         <td>4</td>\n         <td>2+</td>\n         <td>3/4</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [SQUARE], Lethal 5+</td>\n     </tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('TYR','HF','','','FT',0,'2','Feeder Tendrils','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Feeder Tendrils:</strong> \nEach time this operative incapacitates an enemy operative in combat, it regain up to 1D3 lost wounds.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TYR','HF','','','TS',0,'2','Toxin Sacks','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n <strong>Toxin Sacks:</strong> \n Each time this operative fights in combat, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat, if you retain any critical hits, you can retain one of your failed hits as a successful normal hit.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TYR','WB','','','BC',0,'3','Blasting Charge*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>A</th>\n<th>BS</th>\n<th>D</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Blasting Charge</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>3+</td>\n<td>3/4</td>\n<tr><th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th></td>\n<tr><td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Blast [TRI], Indirect, Limited</td></td>\n</tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('TYR','WB','','','BH-CL',206,'0','Clandestine','If this operative has a Conceal order and is in Cover provided by Light terrain, enemy operatives cannot treat it as being on an Engage order as a result of a Vantage Point.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('TYR','WB','','','BH-EL',202,'0','Elusive','Each time this operative is activated, if it is within Engagement Range of only one enemy operative, roll 1D6:\nOn a 4+, it can perform the Fall Back action for one less AP during that activation (to a minimum of 0 AP).','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('TYR','WB','','','BH-MERC',203,'0','Mercurial','Each time a shooting attack is made against this operative by an enemy operative more than [PENT] away, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, you can re-roll one of your Defence Dice.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('TYR','WB','','','BH-PR',204,'0','Prowler','For the purposes of this operative performing mission actions, it only needs to be within the required range of an objective marker or token (it does not need to control it).','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('TYR','WB','','','BH-SC',201,'0','Scurry','While this operative has a Conceal order, add [TRI] to its Movement characteristic.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('TYR','WB','','','BH-ST',205,'0','Stalker','You can use the Slink Into Darkness Tactical Ploy for this operative twice, instead of once.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('TYR','WB','','','CE',0,'1','Climbing Equipment','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\r <br/>\r <strong>Climbing Equipment:</strong>\r <ul>\r <li>Each time this operative ascends or descends a terrain feature while climbing, the first vertical distance of up to 3 [CIRCLE] is counted as [CIRCLE] for that climb.</li>\r <li>This operative only needs to be within [TRI] horizaontally of a terrain feature in order to climb it.</li>\r <li>Each time this operative drops, the intended location can be any vertical distance from the level it occupies.</li>\r <li>Each time this operative drops, it counts any vertical distance it travels as half for that drop.</li>\r </ul>','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TYR','WB','','','CK',0,'1','Cult Knife','The operative is equipped with the following melee weapon for the battle:\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>A</th>\n<th>BS</th>\n<th>D</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cult Knife</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>4+</td>\n<td>2/3</td>\n</tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('TYR','WB','','','CT',0,'2','Cult Talisman','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Cult Talisman:</strong> Once per battle, when a shooting attack is made against this operative, in the Resolve Successful Saves step of that shooting attack, you can change one of your retained Normal saves to a Critical save.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TYR','WB','','','FG',0,'2','Frag Grenade','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>A</th>\n<th>BS</th>\n<th>D</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Frag Grenade</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>3+</td>\n<td>2/3</td>\n<tr><th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th></td>\n<tr><td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect, Limited</td></td>\n</tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('TYR','WB','','','FV',0,'1','Flash Visor','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\r  <br/>\r  <strong>Flash Visor:</strong> Each time this operative is activated, you can ignore any or all modifiers to its APL.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TYR','WB','','','RE-GB',402,'2','Gene-Brew','Add 2 to the operative\'s Wounds characteristic for the battle. In addition, it gains the following ability for the battle:\n<strong>Gene-Brew:</strong>\nThis operative ignores the effects of the Heavy special rule.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('TYR','WB','','','RE-IIA',403,'1/2','Ichor-Infused Ammunition','Select an Autogun, Heavy Stubber, or Shotgun the operative is equipped with. It gains the Lethal 5+ special rule for the battle.\nIf you selected a Heavy Stubber, this equipment costs 2 EP, otherwise it costs 1 EP.','WepMod','wepid:AG,HS,SG','SR:Lethal 5+','','','Rare Equipment'),('TYR','WB','','','RE-NS',406,'3','Neutral Shroud','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Neutral Shroud:</strong>\nWhile this operative is more than [PENT] from the active operative, it is in Cover.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('TYR','WB','','','RE-SBI',405,'3','Sire-Blessed Icon','ICON BEARER operative only. When the operative is equipped with this item for the battle, add 1 CP to your pool.\nIn addition, improve the operative\'s Save characteristic by 1 for the battle.','OpMod','SV','-1','','','Rare Equipment'),('TYR','WB','','','RE-SLC',404,'2','Shadowleap Cloak','The operative gains the FLY keyword for the battle.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('TYR','WB','','','RE-SWK',401,'2','Splinterwyrm Knife','The operative is equipped with the following melee weapon for the battle:\n   <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n   	<tr>\n   		<th>Name</th>\n           <th>A</th>\n           <th>BS</th>\n           <th>D</th>\n       </tr>\n       <tr>\n   		<td>Splinterwyrm Knife</td>\n           <td>3</td>\n           <td>3+</td>\n           <td>3/5</td>\n       </tr>\n       <tr>\n   		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n   	</tr>\n       <tr>\n   		<td colspan=\"4\">Rending</td>\n   	</tr>\n   </table>','Weapon','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('TYR','WB','','','SL',0,'3','Spotlight','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\r <br/>\r <strong>Spotlight:</strong> While an enemy operative is Visible to and within [PENT] of a friendly operative with this ability, that enemy operative cannot be Obscured.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TYR','WB24','','','BC',1,'0','Blasting Charges','Once per turning point, a friendly WYRMBLADE NEOPHYTE operative can use the following ranged weapon:\n<table class=\"eqtable\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name</th><th>Atk</th><th>Hit</th><th>Dmg</th><th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Blasting Charge</td><td>4</td><td>4+</td><td>3/5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"4\">Weapon Rules</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Range 4\", Blast 1\", Saturate</td>\n</tr>\n</table>','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TYR','WB24','','','CK',2,'0','Cult Knives','Friendly WYRMBLADE NEOPHYTE operatives have the following melee weapon:\n<table class=\"eqtable\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name</th><th>Atk</th><th>Hit</th><th>Dmg</th><th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cult Knife</td><td>3</td><td>4+</td><td>3/4</td>\n</tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('TYR','WB24','','','SL',4,'0','Spotlights','Whenever a friendly WYRMBLADE operative is shooting, the target cannot be obscured if it is visible to and within 6\" of a friendly WYRMBLADE NEOPHYTE operative that is not within control range of enemy operatives.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('TYR','WB24','','','XT',3,'0','Explosive Traps','This equipment allows you to select two mines (see universal equipment).\nYou cannot also select that equipment as normal (i.e. to give you three), and friendly WYRMBLADE operatives are ignored for your mines’ effects (i.e. they cannot trigger or take damage from them).\nThis takes precedence over the normal mines rules.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('UNIVERSAL','UNIVERSAL','','','UE-AC',50,'0','Ammo Cache','Before the battle, you can set up one of your Ammo Cache markers wholly within your territory. Friendly operatives can perform the following mission action during the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Ammo Resupply (0 AP):</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>One of your Ammo Cache markers the active operative controls is used this Turning Point.</li>\n<li>Until the start of the next Turning Point, whenever this operative is shooting with a weapon from its datacard, you can re-roll one of your Attack Dice.</li>\n<li>An operative cannot perform this action while within control range of an enemy operative, if that marker is not yours, or if that marker has been used this Turning Point.</li>\n</ul>','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('UNIVERSAL','UNIVERSAL','','','UE-CD',52,'0','Comms Device','Before the battle, you can set up one of your Comms Device markers wholly within your territory.\nWhile a friendly operative controls this marker, add 3\" to the distance requirements of its SUPPORT rules that refer to friendly operatives (e.g. \'Select a friendly operative within 6\"\' would be 9\" instead).\nNote that you cannot benefit from your opponent\'s Comms Device markers.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('UNIVERSAL','UNIVERSAL','','','UE-HB',55,'0','Heavy Barricades','Heavy Barricades are heavy terrain. Before the battle, you can set it up wholly within 2\" of your drop zone, on the killzone floor, and more than 2\" from other equipment terrain features.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('UNIVERSAL','UNIVERSAL','','','UE-LB',54,'0','Light Barricades','Light Barricades are light terrain. Before the battle, you can set up any of them wholly within your territory, on the killzone floor, and more than 2\" from other equipment terrain features.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('UNIVERSAL','UNIVERSAL','','','UE-LD',56,'0','Ladder','Ladders are Exposed terrain. Before the battle, you can set up any of them as follows:\n<ul>\n<li>Wholly within your territory.</li>\n<li>Upright against terrain that is at least 2\" tall.</li>\n<li>More than 1\" from doors and access points.</li>\n</ul>\nIn addition, an operative can either move through ladders as if they are not there (but cannot finish on them), or climb them.\nOnce per action, whenever an operative is climbing this terrain feature, treat the vertical distance as 1\".\nNote that if an operative then continues climbing another terrain feature during that action (including another ladder), that distance is determined as normal.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('UNIVERSAL','UNIVERSAL','','','UE-MN',53,'0','Mines','Before the battle, you can set up one of your Mine markers wholly within your territory and more than 2\" from other markers and access points.\nThe first time that marker is within an operative\'s control range, remove that marker and inflict D3+3 damage on that operative.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('UNIVERSAL','UNIVERSAL','','','UE-PB',57,'0','Portable Barricade','A Portable Barricade is Light, Protective, and Portable terrain.\nBefore the battle, you can set it up wholly within your territory, on the killzone floor, and more than 2\" from other equipment terrain features.<br/>\n<strong>Protective:</strong> While an operative is in Cover from this terrain feature, improve its Save stat by 1 (to a maximum of 2+).<br/>\n<strong>Portable:</strong> This terrain feature only provides cover while an operative is connected to it and if the shield is intervening (ignore its feet).\nOperatives connected to the inside of it can perform the following action during the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Move With Barricade (1 AP):</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>The same as the Reposition action, except the active operative can move no more than its Move stat minus 2\" and cannot climb, drop, or jump.</li>\n<li>Before this operative moves, remove the portable barricade it is connected to. After it moves, set up the Portable Barricade to it is connected again.</li>\n<li>This action is treated as a Reposition action. An operative cannot perform this action while within control range of an enemy operative, or in the same activation in which it performed the Fall Back or Charge action.</li>\n</ul>','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('UNIVERSAL','UNIVERSAL','','','UE-RW',51,'0','Razor Wire','Razor Wire is Exposed and Obstructing terrain. Before the battle, you can set it up wholly within your territory, on the killzone floor, and more than 2\" from other equipment terrain features.<br/>\n<strong>Obstructing Terrain:</strong> Whenever an operative would cross this terrain feature within 1\" of it, treat the distance as an additional 2\".','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('VOT','HKS','','','ACAL',5,'1','Auto-Calibrator','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\nSelect one of the operative\'s ranged weapons. Each time the operative makes a shooting attack with that weapon during the battle, you can ignore any or all modifiers to its Ballistic Skill characteristic.','WepMod','','','','','Equipment'),('VOT','HKS','','','BH-BEG',203,'0','Begrudging','While this operative has less than half of its Wounds remaining, each time it fights in combat with or makes a shooting attack against an enemy operative,\nthat enemy operative has one additional Grudge token for that combat or shooting attack.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('VOT','HKS','','','BH-HON',206,'0','Honoured','Enemy operative do not gain a Grudge token for incapacitating this operative. Instead, the first enemy operative that causes this operative to lose any Wounds during the battle gains a Grudge token.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('VOT','HKS','','','BH-IT',204,'0','Inveterate Toughness','Each time an Attack Die inflicts damage on this operative, Damage characteristics of more than 4 are treated as 4.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('VOT','HKS','','','BH-RS',201,'0','Rugged Suvivalist','Each time this operative is activated, it regains 1 lost wound.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('VOT','HKS','','','BH-STUB',202,'0','Stubborn','You can ignore any or all modifiers to this operative\'s characteristics.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('VOT','HKS','','','BH-VD',205,'0','Void-Dredger','Each time this operative makes a shooting attack against an enemy operative within [PENT] of it, its ranged weapons gain the No Cover special rule for that shooting attack.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('VOT','HKS','','','CEQ',2,'1','Climbing Equipment','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\r <br/>\r <strong>Climbing Equipment:</strong>\r <ul>\r <li>Each time this operative ascends or descnds a terrain feature while climbing, the first vertical distance of up to 3[CIRCLE] it travels are counted as [CIRCLE] for that climb.</li>\r <li>This operative only needs to be within [TRI] horizontally of a terrain feature in order to climb it.</li>\r <li>Each time this operative drops, the intended location can be any vertical distance from the level it occupies.</li>\r <li>Each time this operative drops, it counts any vertical distance it travels as half for that drop.</li>\r </ul>','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('VOT','HKS','','','EXT',4,'2','Excavation Tool','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n <br/>\n <strong>Excavation Tool:</strong>\n At the end of the Set Up Barricades step, place one of your Clearance tokens within [TRI] of a part of a terrain feature with the Traversable trait and more than [PENT] from your opponent\'s drop zone.\n Until the end of the battle, friendly operatives do not have to traverse that terrain feature, they can move through it as if it were not there, so long as they do so within [TRI] of that token.\n Note that they cannot finish the move on that terrain feature.\n You can select this item of equipment no more than three times for the battle.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('VOT','HKS','','','GCG',0,'2','Gravitic Concussion Grenade*','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n  <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n  	<tr>\n  		<th>Name</th>\n          <th>A</th>\n          <th>BS</th>\n          <th>D</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td>Gravitic Concussion Grenade</td>\n          <td>4</td>\n          <td>3+</td>\n          <td>2/4</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n  		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect, Lim, No Overwatch</td>\n      </tr>\n  </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('VOT','HKS','','','PK',1,'2','Plasma Knife','The operative is equipped with the following melee weapon for the battle:\n<table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n	<tr>\n		<th>Name</th>\n	   <th>A</th>\n	   <th>BS</th>\n	   <th>D</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n		<td>Plasma Knife</td>\n	   <td>4</td>\n	   <td>4+</td>\n	   <td>3/5</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n	</tr>\n	<tr>\n		<td colspan=\"4\">Lethal 5+</td>\n	</tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('VOT','HKS','','','RE-AGD',401,'3','A Grudge Declared','This operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>A Grudge Declared:</strong>\nOnce during the battle, in the Strategy phase, when it is your turn to use a Strategic Ploy or pass, you can instead select one enemy operative to gain a Grudge token.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('VOT','HKS','','','RE-DW',402,'2','Darkstar Weapon','Select one of the operative\'s melee weapons. Until the end of the battle, that weapon gains the Rending critical hit rule.','WepMod','weptype:M','SR:Rending','','','Rare Equipment'),('VOT','HKS','','','RE-GLD',405,'2','Grav-Lift Device','The operative can perform the following action once during the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Grav-Lift Device (1 AP):</strong>\nPlace a Grav-Wave token within [PENT] of this operative. Until the end of the battle, each time a friendly HEARTHKYN SALVAGER operative moves within [TRI] of that token,\nit gains the FLY keyword until the end of its activation.','Action','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('VOT','HKS','','','RE-IEX',406,'2','Ion Expediter','Select one Ion Blaster or Ion Pistol the operative is equipped with. Add 1 to both of its Damage characteristics for the battle.','WepMod','wepname:ion','D:1/1','','','Rare Equipment'),('VOT','HKS','','','RE-ROC',404,'3','Right of Claim','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Right Of Claim:</strong>\nWhile this operative is within [CIRCLE] of an objective marker, add 1 to its Defence characteristic.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('VOT','HKS','','','RE-RP',403,'3','Relic Plate','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Relic Plate:</strong>\nEach time a shooting attack is made against this operative, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, you can re-roll one of your Defence Dice.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('VOT','HKS','HKS','TH','WFC',3,'3','Weavefield Crest','THEYN operative only. The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n<br/>\n<strong>Weavefield Crest:</strong>\nWhile a friendly HEARTHKYN SALVAGER operative is within [SQUARE] of this operative, that operative has a 4+ Invulnerable Save.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('VOT','HKS24','','','CR',2,'0','Climbing Rigs','Whenever a friendly HEARTHKYN SALVAGER operative is climbing, treat the vertical distance as 1\" less (to a minimum of 2\").\nNote this has no effect when using ladder equipment terrain, which treats the vertical distance as 1\" (but would have an effect if the operative then continued climbing another terrain feature).','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('VOT','HKS24','','','ET',3,'0','Excavation Tools','Friendly HEARTHKYN SALVAGER operatives can perform the Pick Up Marker action for 1 less AP, and don’t have to control the marker to do so (taking precedence over that action\'s conditions – they only need to contest the marker).','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('VOT','HKS24','','','PK',1,'0','Plasma Knives','Friendly HEARTHKYN SALVAGER operatives have the following melee weapon. Note that the FIELD MEDIC operative already has this weapon but with better stats; in that instance, use the better version.\nThe operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:<br/>\n<table class=\"eqtable\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name</th><th>Atk</th><th>Hit</th><th>Dmg</th><th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plasma Knife</td><td>3</td><td>4+</td><td>3/5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lethal 5+</td>\n</tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('VOT','HKS24','','','WOC',4,'0','Writ Of Claim','Once per battle, after rolling off to decide initiative, you can use this rule. If you do:\n<ul>\n<li>Add 1 to your result for each objective marker friendly HEARTHKYN SALVAGER operatives contest.</li>\n<li>Add 1 to your result for each objective marker friendly HEARTHKYN SALVAGER operatives control. Note this is cumulative with the above (if they control the marker, they also contest it).</li>\n</ul>','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('VOT','HKY','','','BH-AS',204,'0','Aggressive Surveyor','In the first Turning Point, up to three friendly operatives with this Battle Honour that have been set up using the Dauntless Explorers ability are not restricted from making shooting attacks and/or performing the Charge action.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('VOT','HKY','','','BH-CAN',205,'0','Canny','Each time you activate this operative, if you spend a Resourceful Point, you can select both effects for this operative.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('VOT','HKY','','','BH-PH',203,'0','Patient Hunter','Each time this operative fights in combat or makes a shooting attack against an enemy operative that is not Ready, in the Roll Attack Dice step of that combat or shooting attack, before rolling your Attack Dice, you can retain one as a successful normal hit without rolling it.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('VOT','HKY','','','BH-STB',202,'0','Stubborn','You can ignore any or all modifiers to this operative\'s characteristics.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('VOT','HKY','','','BH-TGH',201,'0','Tough','Each time a shooting attack is made against this operative, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, you can re-roll any or all of your Defence Dice results of 1.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('VOT','HKY','','','BH-UNF',206,'0','Unfazed','Ignore Engagement Range when determining if this operative generates Resourceful Points and when spending them.','Ability','','','','','Battle Honour'),('VOT','HKY','','','BR',2,'1','Bolt Revolver','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n    <tr>\n		<th>Name</th>\n		<th>A</th>\n		<th>BS</th>\n		<th>D</th>\n	</tr>\n	<tr>\n		<td>Bolt Revolver</td>\n		<td>4</td>\n		<td>4+</td>\n		<td>3/5</td>\n	</tr>\n	<tr>\n		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n    </tr>\n	<tr>\n		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT]</td>\n    </tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('VOT','HKY','','','BSG',3,'3','Bolt Shotgun','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\n  <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n     <tr>\n 		<th>Name</th>\n 		<th>A</th>\n 		<th>BS</th>\n 		<th>D</th>\n         <th>SR</th>\n 	</tr>\n 	<tr>\n 		<td>Bolt Shotgun (Short Range)</td>\n 		<td>4</td>\n 		<td>3+</td>\n 		<td>4/4</td>\n         <td>Rng [PENT]</td>\n 	</tr>\n 	<tr>\n 		<td>Bolt Shotgun (Long Range)</td>\n 		<td>4</td>\n 		<td>5+</td>\n 		<td>2/2</td>\n         <td></td>\n 	</tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('VOT','HKY','','','CE',4,'1','Climbing Equipment','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:\n <br/>\n <strong>Climbing Equipment:</strong>\n <ul>\n <li>Each time this operative ascends or descnds a terrain feature while climbing, the first vertical distance of up to 3[CIRCLE] it travels are counted as [CIRCLE] for that climb.</li>\n <li>This operative does not need to be within [TRI] of a physical and climbable part of a terrain feature in order to climb it.</li>\n <li>Each time this operative drops, the intended location can be any vertical distance from the level it occupies.</li>\n <li>Each time this operative drops, it counts any vertical distance it travels as half for that drop.</li>\n </ul>','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('VOT','HKY','','','FBS',6,'1','Firestorm Bolt Shells','Select a Bolt Shotgun the operative (excluding THEYN) is equipped with. That weapon gains the following additional profile for the battle.\n <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n    <tr>\n		<th>Name</th>\n		<th>A</th>\n		<th>BS</th>\n		<th>D</th>\n	</tr>\n	<tr>\n		<td>Firestorm Bolt Shells</td>\n		<td>4</td>\n		<td>3+</td>\n		<td>2/4</td>\n	</tr>\n	<tr>\n		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n    </tr>\n	<tr>\n		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Blast [TRI]</td>\n    </tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('VOT','HKY','HKY','THEYN','FBS-THEYN',6,'1','Firestorm Bolt Shells (THEYN)','Select a Bolt Shotgun the operative is equipped with. That weapon gains the following additional profile for the battle.\r  <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\r     <tr>\r 		<th>Name</th>\r 		<th>A</th>\r 		<th>BS</th>\r 		<th>D</th>\r 	</tr>\r 	<tr>\r 		<td>Firestorm Bolt Shells</td>\r 		<td>4</td>\r 		<td>2+</td>\r 		<td>2/4</td>\r 	</tr>\r 	<tr>\r 		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\r     </tr>\r 	<tr>\r 		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Blast [TRI]</td>\r     </tr>\r </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('VOT','HKY','','','GCG',7,'2','Gravitic Concussion Grenade','The operative is equipped with the following ranged weapon for the battle:\r  <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\r     <tr>\r 		<th>Name</th>\r 		<th>A</th>\r 		<th>BS</th>\r 		<th>D</th>\r 	</tr>\r 	<tr>\r 		<td>Gravitic Concussion Grenade</td>\r 		<td>4</td>\r 		<td>3+</td>\r 		<td>2/4</td>\r 	</tr>\r 	<tr>\r 		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\r     </tr>\r 	<tr>\r 		<td colspan=\"4\">Rng [PENT], Blast [CIRCLE], Indirect, Limited</td>\r     </tr>\r </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('VOT','HKY','','','KVCU',8,'1','KV-Ceramide Undersuit','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>KV-Ceramide Undersuit:</strong>\nEach time a shooting attack is made against this operative, if the ranged weapon has the Blast or Torrent special rule, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, you can re-roll one of your Defence Dice.\nThis operative is unaffected by the Splash critical hit rule.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('VOT','HKY','','','PK',1,'2','Plasma Knife','The operative is equipped with the following melee weapon for the battle:\n <table class=\"eqtable\" width=\"100%\">\n 	<tr>\n 		<th>Name</th>\n 	   <th>A</th>\n 	   <th>BS</th>\n 	   <th>D</th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<td>Plasma Knife</td>\n 	   <td>4</td>\n 	   <td>4+</td>\n 	   <td>3/5</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n 		<th colspan=\"4\">Special Rules</th>\n 	</tr>\n 	<tr>\n 		<td colspan=\"4\">Lethal 5+</td>\n 	</tr>\n </table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('VOT','HKY','','','RE-CS',403,'2','Concussion Shells','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Concussion Shells:</strong>\nSelect a Bolt Revolver or the Short Range profile of a Bolt Shotgun the operative is equipped with. That weapon or weapon profile gains the Stun critical hit rule for the battle.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('VOT','HKY','','','RE-DEG',405,'2/3','Delver\'s Eyeglass','If the operative is a RIFLEKYN or GUNNER, this Rare Equipment costs 3EP. Otherwise, it costs 2EP.<br/>\nThe operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Delver\'s Eyeglass:</strong>\nWhen determining Line of Sight for this operative, enemy operatives are not Obscured.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('VOT','HKY','','','RE-DSW',401,'2','Darkstar Weapon','Select a throwing Plasma Knife or one of the operative\'s melee weapons. That weapon gains the Rending critical hit rule for the battle.','WepMod','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('VOT','HKY','','','RE-RVS',406,'1','Relic Voidsuit','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Relic Voidsuit:</strong>\nEach time a shooting attack is made against this operative, in the Roll Defence Dice step of that shooting attack, you can retain one of your successful normal saves as a critical save instead.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('VOT','HKY','','','RE-SI',402,'3','Spectral Implant','In the Ready Operatives step of each Turning Point, if this operative is in the killzone and more than [PENT] from enemy operatives, add one Resourceful Point to your pool.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('VOT','HKY','','','RE-WFG',404,'2','Weavefield Gorget','The operative gains the following ability for the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Weavefield Gorget:</strong>\nThis operative has a 4+ Invulnerable Save for the battle.','Ability','','','','','Rare Equipment'),('VOT','HKY','','','SS',5,'1','Stabilised Shells','Operative equipped with a Bolt Shotgun only. In the Set Up Operatives step, select a type of ammnunition for this operative to have loaded into its Bolt Shotgun for the battle: Standard Shells or Stabilised Shells.\nIf it has loaded Standard Shells, it uses either profile of its Bolt Shotgun as normal. If it has loaded Stabilised Shells, it can only use the Long Range profile of its Bolt Shotgun, but att 1 to both Damage characteristics of that profile and improve its Ballistic Skill characteristics by 1 for that operative.\n<br/>\nThe operative can perform the following action during the battle:<br/>\n<strong>Load Shotgun (1 AP):</strong><br/>\nChange the type of ammunition loaded into the Bolt Shotgun this operative is equipped with.','Action','','','','','Equipment'),('VOT','HKY24','','','FSBS',1,'0','Firestorm Bolt Shells','Once per turning point, when a friendly HERNKYN YAEGIR operative is performing the Shoot action and you select a bolt shotgun (short range), you can use this rule.\nIf you do, until the end of that action, that weapon has the Blast 1\" weapon rule.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('VOT','HKY24','','','KVCU',2,'0','KV-Ceramide Undersuit','Whenever an enemy operative is shooting a friendly HERNKYN YAEGIR operative, if the ranged weapon in that sequence has the Blast or Torrent weapon rule, you can re-roll one of your defence dice.\nIn addition, friendly HERNKYN YAEGIR operatives are not affected by the X\" Devastating X weapon rule (i.e, Devastating with a distance) unless they are the target during that sequence.','Ability','','','','','Equipment'),('VOT','HKY24','','','PK',3,'0','Plasma Knives','Friendly HERNKYN YAEGIR operatives have the following melee weapon. Note that some operatives already have this weapon but with better stats; in that instance use the better version.\n<table class=\"eqtable\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name</th><th>ATK</th><th>HIT</th><th>DMG</th><th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plasma Knife</td><td>3</td><td>4+</td><td>3/5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"4\">Weapon Rules</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lethal 5+</td>\n</tr>\n</table>','Weapon','','','','','Equipment'),('VOT','HKY24','','','SBS',4,'0','Stabilized Bolt Shells','Up to twice per turning point, whenever a friendly HERNKYN YAEGIR operative is performing the Shoot action and you selected a bolt shotgun (long range), you can use this rule.\nIf you do, until the end of that action, improve the Hit stat of that weapon by 1 and add 1 to both of its damage stats.','Ability','','','','','Equipment');
